Gemini regardless of what cleaning was actually\n  done (now reads the real, already-tracked CleaningOperation log via a\n  PipelineContext field that existed but was never wired up).\n- 9 new pytest cases for /hypothesis-test (30/30 passing, ruff-clean).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Tb2Ssg7HbHLMqRrGtTEm7f\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQNm9Vje8\nVdQm2A2ONwwreyWXimpwwElChc90kesnZLCGgkEWtjZpr4OhHPWmc3dyap28TGOKsZP4QA5qFW0B\nJA0=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-28T08:16:59Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/thedeepakreddy/DataScienceStudio-AskDeepakAI/commit/36aa3e24b3779e4826ed32440ae9f0186012aa02","node_id":"C_kwDOSoFmP9oAKDM2YWEzZTI0YjM3NzllNDgyNmVkMzI0NDBhZTlmMDE4NjAxMmFhMDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/thedeepakreddy/DataScienceStudio-AskDeepakAI/commit/e056f290cf