lathurai/ssserve/commits/f7680e426bda8c1d4c13bd5c383ae3a5775e9a4f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T07:20:41Z","email":"prakashsellathurai@gmail.com","name":"prakash S"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T07:20:41Z","email":"prakashsellathurai@gmail.com","name":"prakash S"},"message":"Fix C server: non-blocking client sockets, EPOLLEXCLUSIVE, write_all, drain loops\n\n- Set client sockets O_NONBLOCK after accept() (required for EPOLLET)\n- Add EPOLLEXCLUSIVE to listen socket to prevent thundering herd\n- Add write_all() helper to handle partial writes on non-blocking sockets\n- Add EAGAIN/EWOULDBLOCK handling in sendfile loops\n- Add accept() EAGAIN drain loop for edge-triggered listen socket\n- Add read() EAGAIN drain loop for edge-triggered client sockets\n- Remove dead header parsing (Accept-Encoding, Range, If-None-Match, If-Modified-Since)\n- Add minimal OPTIONS handler returning 200 with Allow header\n- Add comment for config_callback (used in Task 5)\n- Close listen_fd in normal shutdown path","tree":{"sha":"22c2428877a87603c7f1148b4f6e1861b226b0fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prakashsellathurai/ssserve/git/trees/22c2428877a87603c7f1148b4f6e1861b226b0fb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prakashsellathurai/ssserve/git/commits/f7680e426bda8c1d4c13bd5c383ae3a5775e9a4f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22521752?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prakashsellathurai/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prakashsellathurai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prakashsellathurai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prakashsellathurai/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/prakashsellathurai","id":22521752,"login":"prakashsellathurai","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTIxNzUy","organizat