ts","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commits/90e5ab5e649f10d0a6d2738db144946b56956a9d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T18:00:50Z","email":"47615094+marventu94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"marventu94"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T18:01:03Z","email":"47615094+marventu94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"marventu94"},"message":"fix(explorer): stabilize discovery and improve graph editing\n\nSeparate structural discovery from value filters, reuse bounded samples, stream directions and retain results when retrying upstream failures. Log SPARQL and request timing for discovery and execution.\n\nAdd free variables by default, apply observed types explicitly, name literal variables by owner, deduplicate generated filters, fix temporary preview searches, clean up orphaned nodes and restore readable URI labels. Align platform branding and canvas hints.\n\nValidation: 280 RDF Explorer tests, 214 backend tests, frontend build and browser checks for result search.","tree":{"sha":"501afba9182bf80e9da46b697ede371e247abf70","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/git/trees/501afba9182bf80e9da46b697ede371e247abf70"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/git/commits/90e5ab5e649f10d0a6d2738db144946b56956a9d","verification":{"payload":"tree 501afba9182bf80e9da46b697ede371e247abf70\nparent 7cef529f5e533eaa9cb70da6567c5f33dd9def3f\nauthor marventu94 <47615094+marventu94@users.noreply.github.com> 1791223250 -0300\ncommitter marventu94 <47615094+marventu94@users.noreply.github.com> 1791223263 -0300\n\nfix(explorer): stabilize discovery and improve graph editing\n\nSeparate structural discovery from value filters, reuse bounded samples, stream directions and retain results when retrying upstream failures. Log SPARQL and request timing for discovery and execution.\n\nAdd free variables by default, apply observed types explicitly, name literal variables by owner, deduplicate generated filters, fix temporary preview searches, clean up orphaned nodes and restore readable URI labels. Align platform branding and canvas hints.\n\nValidation: 280 RDF Explorer tests, 214 backend tests, frontend build and browser checks for result search.\n","reason":"unknown_key","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg9u0rz8QOY2NK8xzwFSMiAKqbox\ndkYNEYdFCsopZrg6kAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQBQX/rbykRBW6YlXytqmyxDWjoVvlm/ftwxxBDbVUTxF7eE1KSMofjaaGKbHbiQdOv\nRYIgVvdcV4EeUWebu91wU=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47615094?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94","id":47615094,"login":"marventu94","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjE1MDk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/comm