ng\n\nBound catalogue searches and discovery requests with cancellation, queueing and server timeouts. Restore resource search and optimize Wikidata direct-property exploration with readable labels.\n\nUnify the Explorer panel, preserve concrete values and selection when dragging, and use single-value editing constraints. Refresh search controls, toolbar actions, SPARQL cards and dark-theme styling.\n\n(cherry picked from commit bf2753d65f4f0c86419559a36a654dccabd6bedb)","tree":{"sha":"0584c1d15b7894d8717a70809340a3a625cc3989","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/git/trees/0584c1d15b7894d8717a70809340a3a625cc3989"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/git/commits/7cef529f5e533eaa9cb70da6567c5f33dd9def3f","verification":{"payload":"tree 0584c1d15b7894d8717a70809340a3a625cc3989\nparent fe8b24eb21aecddb5efe39e2c61b121c20c950cc\nauthor marventu94 <47615094+marventu94@users.noreply.github.com> 1791156598 -0300\ncommitter marventu94 <47615094+marventu94@users.noreply.github.com> 1791156699 -0300\n\nfix(explorer): simplify discovery and improve canvas editing\n\nBound catalogue searches and discovery requests with cancellation, queueing and server timeouts. Restore resource search and optimize Wikidata direct-property exploration with readable labels.\n\nUnify the Explorer panel, preserve concrete values and selection when dragging, and use single-value editing constraints. Refresh search controls, toolbar actions, SPARQL cards and dark-theme styling.\n\n(cherry picked from commit bf2753d65f4f0c86419559a36a654dccabd6bedb)\n","reason":"unknown_key","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg9u0rz8QOY2NK8xzwFSMiAKqbox\ndkYNEYdFCsopZrg6kAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQEXocgjPFLPEyK/lJze02f/1+l5qXJ7nE+xW9O6tIH8HqjhKH/JvCl9VrANkRJt7wJ\nxL0KW3q9HP2NTq74BpbQE=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https