","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commit/589a71c15291a86b2a82bddfb99afb76e525ca4a","node_id":"C_kwDOSoZ88NoAKDU4OWE3MWMxNTI5MWE4NmIyYTgyYmRkZmI5OWFmYjc2ZTUyNWNhNGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commit/ec9c525473b4c798ee514c10106204c13b00450a","sha":"ec9c525473b4c798ee514c10106204c13b00450a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commits/ec9c525473b4c798ee514c10106204c13b00450a"}],"sha":"589a71c15291a86b2a82bddfb99afb76e525ca4a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commits/589a71c15291a86b2a82bddfb99afb76e525ca4a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47615094?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94","id":47615094,"login":"marventu94","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjE1MDk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commits/ec9c525473b4c798ee514c10106204c13b00450a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T18:20:44Z","email":"47615094+marventu94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"marventu94"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T18:20:44Z","email":"47615094+marventu94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"marventu94"},"message":"fix(eval): C1 y C3 por partido de Berisso, sin LIMIT propio\n\nLos dos tableros decían \"en Berisso\" y medían otra cosa.\n\nC1 filtraba por `regex(?direccion, \"berisso\")` sobre `inm:address`, que es texto\nlibre del scraper: traía 28 avisos de otros partidos por calles homónimas (23 de\nLa Plata, 3 de Almirante Brown, 2 de Merlo) y, sobre todo, se perdía las ~1200\ncasas de Berisso cuya dirección no nombra la localidad. C3 filtraba por barrio,\nque deja afuera Los Talas, Villa Argüello, Villa San Carlos y el resto del\npartido. Ahora los dos filtran por `inm:city`, que es el eje administrativo del\nmodelo: 332 -> 1546 avisos en C1 y 135 -> 203 en C3.\n\nEl filtro va sobre el `rdfs:label` del distrito y no sobre su URI porque el\ndataset trae el mismo partido bajo tres distritos (GBA_Sur, Buenos_Aires,\nBuenos_Aires_Interior): son la misma localidad duplicada por la taxonomía de\nregiones del scraper. C2 sigue por barrio a propósito: City Bell no existe como\n`inm:city`, es barrio de La Plata.\n\nAdemás C1 y C3 se siembran sin LIMIT propio, que es donde interesa el total. Un\nLIMIT en la consulta recorta en el endpoint antes del tope del backend y, al\nllegar menos filas que ese tope, `meta.truncated` queda en false: el tablero\ntrataba el recorte como el resultado completo y tanto el resumen como el export\nse quedaban con esa muestra. Sin LIMIT recorta el backend, que sí marca el\ntruncamiento.","tree":{"sha":"0ea76f6fc350147440d8059480665bd31b914911","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/git/trees/0ea76f6fc350147440d8059480665bd31b914911"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/git/commits/ec9c525473b4c798ee514c10106204c13b00450a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47615094?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94","id":47615094,"login":"marventu94","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjE1MDk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commit/ec9c525473b4c798ee514c10106204c13b00450a","node_id":"C_kwDOSoZ88NoAKGVjOWM1MjU0NzNiNGM3OThlZTUxNGMxMDEwNjIwNGMxM2IwMDQ1MGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commit/8bf476760bf476edf5a16d9cd30563ada203af41","sha":"8bf476760bf476edf5a16d9cd30563ada203af41","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commits/8bf476760bf476edf5a16d9cd30563ada203af41"}],"sha":"ec9c525473b4c798ee514c10106204c13b00450a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commits/ec9c525473b4c798ee514c10106204c13b00450a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47615094?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94","id":47615094,"login":"marventu94","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjE1MDk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commits/8bf476760bf476edf5a16d9cd30563ada203af41/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T17:52:08Z","email":"47615094+marventu94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"marventu94"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T17:52:08Z","email":"47615094+marventu94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"marventu94"},"message":"feat(gis): avisar en el editor cuando la consulta trae LIMIT propio\n\nEl backend no inyecta su propio LIMIT: manda la query tal cual y recorta la\nrespuesta a maxLimit. Un LIMIT escrito a mano, entonces, recorta en el endpoint\nantes de ese tope, y como meta.truncated se calcula como \"filas >= maxLimit\"\nqueda en false: el tablero trata el recorte como el resultado completo, el panel\nde resumen se computa local sobre esa muestra y el export la baja como total en\nvez de paginar el resto. Con LIMIT >= maxLimit pasa lo contrario, el excedente\nno se aplica.\n\nEn los dos casos el volumen ya lo maneja la app con los lotes, así que acotar a\nmano solo resta información sin avisar. Ahora la barra del editor muestra un\naviso con el detalle en el tooltip. Vive dentro del editor a propósito: se ve\nsolo con el editor expandido y se va con él al colapsarlo tras ejecutar.","tree":{"sha":"f3fa9aa603c0d330cf2bc9bd45d6a5af738f2d5f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/git/trees/f3fa9aa603c0d330cf2bc9bd45d6a5af738f2d5f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/git/commits/8bf476760bf476edf5a16d9cd30563ada203af41","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47615094?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94","id":47615094,"login":"marventu94","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjE1MDk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commit/8bf476760bf476edf5a16d9cd30563ada203af41","node_id":"C_kwDOSoZ88NoAKDhiZjQ3Njc2MGJmNDc2ZWRmNWExNmQ5Y2QzMDU2M2FkYTIwM2FmNDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commit/52b5d7ce86d054283b21333d614fef4794df089e","sha":"52b5d7ce86d054283b21333d614fef4794df089e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commits/52b5d7ce86d054283b21333d614fef4794df089e"}],"sha":"8bf476760bf476edf5a16d9cd30563ada203af41","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commits/8bf476760bf476edf5a16d9cd30563ada203af41"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47615094?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94","id":47615094,"login":"marventu94","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjE1MDk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commits/52b5d7ce86d054283b21333d614fef4794df089e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T17:28:18Z","email":"47615094+marventu94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"marventu94"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T17:28:18Z","email":"47615094+marventu94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"marventu94"},"message":"fix(gis): show full values in table tooltips","tree":{"sha":"6cb9e9b90ad150a4682201e8bc2e70c086a826c1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/git/trees/6cb9e9b90ad150a4682201e8bc2e70c086a826c1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/git/commits/52b5d7ce86d054283b21333d614fef4794df089e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47615094?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94","id":47615094,"login":"marventu94","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjE1MDk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commit/52b5d7ce86d054283b21333d614fef4794df089e","node_id":"C_kwDOSoZ88NoAKDUyYjVkN2NlODZkMDU0MjgzYjIxMzMzZDYxNGZlZjQ3OTRkZjA4OWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commit/6f995b73b50025e98656dfa3b0fcbee58d4aefd0","sha":"6f995b73b50025e98656dfa3b0fcbee58d4aefd0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commits/6f995b73b50025e98656dfa3b0fcbee58d4aefd0"}],"sha":"52b5d7ce86d054283b21333d614fef4794df089e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commits/52b5d7ce86d054283b21333d614fef4794df089e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47615094?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94","id":47615094,"login":"marventu94","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjE1MDk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commits/6f995b73b50025e98656dfa3b0fcbee58d4aefd0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T18:59:54Z","email":"47615094+marventu94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"marventu94"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T18:59:54Z","email":"47615094+marventu94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"marventu94"},"message":"docs: por qué existe la vista de grafo, y qué dice de más\n\nLa doc de la vista de grafo defendía la vista (\"esto no la vuelve\nincorrecta\") pero nunca afirmaba qué hace que ninguna otra vista haga.\nFaltaba el argumento, y sobraban cuatro afirmaciones que el código\ncontradice.\n\nEl argumento (§3.8, nueva)\nEn RDF los valores no cuelgan de la entidad: están reificados al final de\nuna cadena de nodos intermedios. El grafo es la única vista que muestra\nesa cadena — la tabla proyecta el literal en una columna y la pierde.\nEso ya lo hace la app: query-topology.ts lee los patrones ?s <p> ?o,\ndetecta las variables que participan de relaciones pero no están\nproyectadas, reescribe el SELECT para recuperarlas y las dibuja con su\npredicado y dirección reales. De ahí las dos preguntas que responde y\nnadie más: de dónde sale un valor, y si todo el conjunto tiene la misma\nforma (una firma que no coincide con el motivo dominante es una\nexcepción de modelado, y Resumen la deja explícita sola).\n\nEl límite (§3.10, nueva)\nRecorrer el grafo —expandir vecinos, buscar caminos, profundidad\nvariable— es no-objetivo explícito, no una funcionalidad pendiente: cada\nexpansión es una consulta nueva, y construir consultas es el paradigma\ndel RDF Explorer, del otro lado del handoff. Queda aclarado que los\n\"caminos acotados\" de §3.2 son otra cosa: recortan dentro del resultado\nya recuperado, no piden datos nuevos.\n\nLo que decía de más\n- §3.4 afirmaba que el cálculo inicial corre sin animación. Cola —el\n  layout por defecto de los grafos cíclicos— se anima y además randomiza\n  posiciones, así que el primer dibujo no es reproducible. Queda descrito\n  como es y anotado como mejora pendiente en §4.\n- §3.2 daba el grado como criterio de desempate. Ordena el bucket de\n  contexto; el desempate es el orden de entrada.\n- §3.3 decía que al seleccionar, el agregado \"resume solo los restantes\".\n  El componente seleccionado queda fuera del agrupamiento, y si la firma\n  tenía solo dos, el resumen desaparece en lugar de reducirse.\n- El comentario de la semilla geométrica decía gobernar el dibujo inicial;\n  ahí la descarta el randomize de cola. Manda en el camino incremental.\n\nTambién: se va la razón de inclusión \"degree\", declarada y siempre en\ncero (hay cuatro, no cinco), y §6 registra que un motivo expandido puede\nquedar sin control para contraerse si la expansión supera el cap.","tree":{"sha":"7dfad8eefcbbade9fbc54bf1a6aee947f320a2d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/git/trees/7dfad8eefcbbade9fbc54bf1a6aee947f320a2d5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/git/commits/6f995b73b50025e98656dfa3b0fcbee58d4aefd0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47615094?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94","id":47615094,"login":"marventu94","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjE1MDk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commit/6f995b73b50025e98656dfa3b0fcbee58d4aefd0","node_id":"C_kwDOSoZ88NoAKDZmOTk1YjczYjUwMDI1ZTk4NjU2ZGZhM2IwZmNiZWU1OGQ0YWVmZDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commit/eb113279e84bb674fffb37517ff9d946ae24f9bb","sha":"eb113279e84bb674fffb37517ff9d946ae24f9bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commits/eb113279e84bb674fffb37517ff9d946ae24f9bb"}],"sha":"6f995b73b50025e98656dfa3b0fcbee58d4aefd0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commits/6f995b73b50025e98656dfa3b0fcbee58d4aefd0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47615094?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94","id":47615094,"login":"marventu94","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjE1MDk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commits/eb113279e84bb674fffb37517ff9d946ae24f9bb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T18:42:20Z","email":"47615094+marventu94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"marventu94"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T18:42:20Z","email":"47615094+marventu94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"marventu94"},"message":"feat(gis): vistas coordinadas más legibles y carga explicada\n\nTres trabajos que comparten los mismos archivos (las cuatro vistas y el\nservicio de selección), por eso van juntos.\n\nResumen del grafo\nMotivos repetidos colapsados en un glifo reversible, niveles de detalle\n(\"Resumen\" / \"Entidades\" / \"Entidades + relaciones\") y popups con el\nconteo de lo que representa cada agregado.\n\nCartel de carga por etapas\nAbrir un tablero mostraba un spinner mudo que no distinguía esperar al\nendpoint SPARQL (minutos en GraphDB) de pintar las vistas. Ahora se ven\nlas etapas reales con su duración: recuperar el tablero, ejecutar la\nconsulta (con filas y ms del endpoint), procesar, resumir y renderizar.\nEl modelo es puro (shared/progress) y las vistas solo reportan.\n\nSelección coordinada por fila\nCada vista dibuja una entidad distinta de la misma fila —el mapa la que\ntiene coordenada, la timeline la que tiene fecha, la tabla la fila\nentera—, así que comparar por URI exacta hacía que un click en el mapa no\nseleccionara nada en la tabla. La selección ahora viaja con las entidades\nde sus filas (shared/selection/row-index) y cada vista resalta la que\nsabe dibujar; en el grafo, si la entidad quedó colapsada, se resalta el\nresumen que la contiene.\n\nDe paso, seleccionar dejó de recalcular el lote y repintar las cuatro\nvistas: el pinning solo cambia lo visible cuando el nodo está fuera del\nlote, así que el resto de las veces se reusa el mismo objeto y no se\nemite nada. Con lotes grandes y la vista coordinada encendida eso trababa\nla app.\n\nY en la vista coordinada del grafo: el encuadre tiene piso de zoom (fit\nsobre decenas de nodos dejaba todo ilegible) y el foco ya no borra el\nresaltado de la selección, que ahora se distingue del resto del foco por\nopacidad.","tree":{"sha":"56c4dc9df5c93f0c3529db043a87972a6e3799cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/git/trees/56c4dc9df5c93f0c3529db043a87972a6e3799cd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/git/commits/eb113279e84bb674fffb37517ff9d946ae24f9bb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47615094?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94","id":47615094,"login":"marventu94","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjE1MDk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commit/eb113279e84bb674fffb37517ff9d946ae24f9bb","node_id":"C_kwDOSoZ88NoAKGViMTEzMjc5ZTg0YmI2NzRmZmZiMzc1MTdmZjlkOTQ2YWUyNGY5YmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commit/0926198bbcf61f4a1e179f3658662b834b0120ae","sha":"0926198bbcf61f4a1e179f3658662b834b0120ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commits/0926198bbcf61f4a1e179f3658662b834b0120ae"}],"sha":"eb113279e84bb674fffb37517ff9d946ae24f9bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commits/eb113279e84bb674fffb37517ff9d946ae24f9bb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47615094?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94","id":47615094,"login":"marventu94","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjE1MDk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commits/0926198bbcf61f4a1e179f3658662b834b0120ae/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T18:41:58Z","email":"47615094+marventu94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"marventu94"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T18:41:58Z","email":"47615094+marventu94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"marventu94"},"message":"feat(shell): avisar antes de pisar el tablero abierto en GIS\n\nAbrir un tablero GIS desde el home reemplaza la consulta, el layout y los\nfiltros de lo que haya en GIS, igual que una importación del Explorer,\npero lo hacía sin decir nada: el trabajo sin guardar se perdía en\nsilencio.\n\nAhora el guard de navegación pregunta con las mismas tres salidas que ya\nusa \"Explorar en GIS\" (cancelar / ir a GIS a guardar / abrir igual),\nleyendo el estado por el canal compartido de platform-bridge. Si el GIS\nno se abrió en esta página, o no tiene nada en riesgo, no pregunta nada.\n\nAl cubrirlo desde el guard, el aviso también aplica a una URL directa a\n/dashboards/:id, no solo a la tarjeta del home.","tree":{"sha":"2f187e6d320b1c5590934d89a9b8c13905ead0a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/git/trees/2f187e6d320b1c5590934d89a9b8c13905ead0a8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/git/commits/0926198bbcf61f4a1e179f3658662b834b0120ae","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47615094?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94","id":47615094,"login":"marventu94","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjE1MDk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commit/0926198bbcf61f4a1e179f3658662b834b0120ae","node_id":"C_kwDOSoZ88NoAKDA5MjYxOThiYmNmNjFmNGExZTE3OWYzNjU4NjYyYjgzNGIwMTIwYWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commit/2ca31026f4de0e83ada695718ff3f6eebc1ad8c0","sha":"2ca31026f4de0e83ada695718ff3f6eebc1ad8c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commits/2ca31026f4d