r}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94","id":47615094,"login":"marventu94","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjE1MDk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commits/e7f2822562b2360b1ad0b59b8fee4bb331bfba55/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T17:13:56Z","email":"47615094+marventu94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"marventu94"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T17:13:56Z","email":"47615094+marventu94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"marventu94"},"message":"feat(backend): entorno aislado de evaluación C1–C5\n\nAgrega el seed de los nueve tableros del ensayo (cuatro workspaces DRAFT\ndel Explorer, sus cuatro GIS derivados y C5) en un SQLite propio, con IDs\nestables para poder repetir el ensayo desde cero.\n\nLas consultas GIS se generan desde el mismo grafo que el workspace con la\nproyección completa del handoff, así no hay dos versiones de la misma\nconsulta que mantener a mano.","tree":{"sha":"4901a2e6f96c15db70ded03e4c29b684f9d05496","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/git/trees/4901a2e6f96c15db70ded03e4c29b684f9d05496"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/git/commits/e7f2822562b2360b1ad0b59b8fee4bb331bfba55","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47615094?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94","id":47615094,"login":"marventu94","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjE1MDk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commit/e7f2822562b2360b1ad0b59b8fee4bb331bfba55","node_id":"C_kwDOSoZ88NoAKGU3ZjI4MjI1NjJiMjM2MGIxYWQwYjU5YjhmZWU0YmIzMzFiZmJhNTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commit/c5992f0e3198a5de1852595452874d45a18a9b2d","sha":"c5992f0e3198a5de1852595452874d45a18a9b2d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commits/c5992f0e3198a5de1852595452874d45a18a9b2d"}],"sha":"e7f2822562b2360b1ad0b59b8fee4bb331bfba55","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commits/e7f2822562b2360b1ad0b59b8fee4bb331bfba55"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47615094?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94","id":47615094,"login":"marventu94","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjE1MDk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commits/c5992f0e3198a5de1852595452874d45a18a9b2d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T22:57:14Z","email":"47615094+marventu94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"marventu94"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T22:57:14Z","email":"47615094+marventu94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"marventu94"},"message":"chore: regenerar lockfile con packages/platform-bridge\n\npnpm-lock.yaml no tenia el importer de packages/platform-bridge (Item 1\ndel refactor): CI fallaba en `pnpm install --frozen-lockfile` con\nERR_PNPM_OUTDATED_LOCKFILE porque el paquete se habia enlazado a mano en\nnode_modules en su momento, sin correr un install real.\n\n`pnpm install` local tambien actualizo el pin de packageManager de\npnpm@11.10.0 a pnpm@12.3.4 (la version resuelta por corepack en esta\nmaquina). El diff del lockfile es grande (885+/725-) pero no es un cambio\nde versiones reales: pnpm 12 solo re-escribe las claves de resolucion de\npeer dependencies con mas detalle (agrega calificadores como\nsupports-color@8.1.1 que antes quedaban implicitos). Los paquetes en si\n-Angular 21.2.17/18, NestJS 11.1.27, etc.- no cambiaron, y el conteo de\n1619 entries coincide con el que ya habia pasado la politica de\nsupply-chain en el CI que fallo.\n\nVerificado bajo pnpm 12.3.4: `pnpm run` en los 7 paquetes,\n`pnpm install --frozen-lockfile` (el paso que fallaba en CI), `pnpm build`,\n`pnpm lint` (0 errores) y `pnpm test` (719 verdes) sobre Node 24.18.0.","tree":{"sha":"dc1e30c23d2773870034c42fe62af1757fb5215b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/git/trees/dc1e30c23d2773870034c42fe62af1757fb5215b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/git/commits/c5992f0e3198a5de1852595452874d45a18a9b2d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47615094?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94","id":47615094,"login":"marventu94","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjE1MDk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commit/c5992f0e3198a5de1852595452874d45a18a9b2d","node_id":"C_kwDOSoZ88NoAKGM1OTkyZjBlMzE5OGE1ZGUxODUyNTk1NDUyODc0ZDQ1YTE4YTliMmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commit/23a191be59d80a9823bd9d43d8dd0013d7e0e3a7","sha":"23a191be59d80a9823bd9d43d8dd0013d7e0e3a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commits/23a191be59d80a9823bd9d43d8dd0013d7e0e3a7"}],"sha":"c5992f0e3198a5de1852595452874d45a18a9b2d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commits/c5992f0e3198a5de1852595452874d45a18a