_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commits/09be045e53effc2394d8b4ca4212258cad04d250/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T22:32:28Z","email":"47615094+marventu94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"marventu94"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T22:32:28Z","email":"47615094+marventu94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"marventu94"},"message":"docs: registrar §5.2, §5.3 y §5.6 como ejecutados\n\nLas tres recomendaciones que habian quedado condicionales u observadas se\nejecutaron: strict en el backend (resulto gratis al medirlo), process.env\nfuera de QueryService, y las capacidades del endpoint descritas por el\nadapter en vez de ramificar en AppConfigService.","tree":{"sha":"50290695f4ee0c93ecb751cc385631bd948e3be9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/git/trees/50290695f4ee0c93ecb751cc385631bd948e3be9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/git/commits/09be045e53effc2394d8b4ca4212258cad04d250","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47615094?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94","id":47615094,"login":"marventu94","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjE1MDk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commit/09be045e53effc2394d8b4ca4212258cad04d250","node_id":"C_kwDOSoZ88NoAKDA5YmUwNDVlNTNlZmZjMjM5NGQ4YjRjYTQyMTIyNThjYWQwNGQyNTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commit/cce6112b246f9b4678aa1456ddc2953c9ae344f1","sha":"cce6112b246f9b4678aa1456ddc2953c9ae344f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commits/cce6112b246f9b4678aa1456ddc2953c9ae344f1"}],"sha":"09be045e53effc2394d8b4ca4212258cad04d250","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commits/09be045e53effc2394d8b4ca4212258cad04d250"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47615094?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94","id":47615094,"login":"marventu94","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjE1MDk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commits/cce6112b246f9b4678aa1456ddc2953c9ae344f1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T22:30:39Z","email":"47615094+marventu94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"marventu94"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T22:31:02Z","email":"47615094+marventu94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"marventu94"},"message":"refactor(backend): las capacidades del endpoint las describe el adapter\n\nCierra el hallazgo §5.6, que habia quedado documentado al verificar el\nitem 2. AppConfigService tenia cuatro ramas `backend === ''wikidata''`\nproduciendo metadata para el frontend: supportsWikibaseLabel, el modo de\nbusqueda, los predicados del panel describe y la clase preseleccionada.\n\nEs la misma forma de acoplamiento que el item 2 saco de SuggestionsService,\nsolo que en vez de decidir COMO consultar decidia COMO describir el backend.\nIgual que alla, sumar un backend obligaba a editar ifs en un servicio que\nno deberia saber que Wikidata existe.\n\n- SparqlEndpoint declara describeEndpoint(): EndpointDescriptor.\n- GenericSparqlAdapter devuelve los valores neutros (busqueda por SPARQL,\n  rdf:type y rdfs:comment, owl#Thing).\n- WikidataAdapter override con lo suyo: la API de wbsearchentities, las\n  listas de propiedades P18/P31/P2035/etc y Q5/human.\n- MillenniumDBAdapter declara capacidades minimas en vez de rechazar:\n  /api/config se pide al arrancar el frontend y tiene que responder aunque\n  el backend sea un stub.\n- AppConfigService inyecta el endpoint y compone; se borra\n  defaultSearchClassFor y la variable isWikidata.\n\nLo que NO se movio: prefixes.<backend>.json y class-colors.<backend>.json.\nEso no es una rama, es una convencion de archivos por nombre de backend, y\nya es domain-agnostic: para un backend nuevo se agrega un archivo.\n\n176 pruebas verdes. El spec de app-config assertaba la salida exacta\n(supportsWikibaseLabel, que describe.objects tenga P31, la clase owl#Thing\ndel generico), asi que sirve de prueba de que el descriptor no cambio el\ncontrato de /api/config.\n\nCon esto la afirmacion domain-agnostic de docs/design-decisions.md §9 es\nverdadera tambien para describir el backend, no solo para ejecutar y buscar.","tree":{"sha":"73e5632c6f34b1d54c9d7a545bc4cf70cd6ec410","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/git/trees/73e5632c6f34b1d54c9d7a545bc4cf70cd6ec410"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/git/commits/cce6112b246f9b4678aa1456ddc2953c9ae344f1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47615094?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94","id":47615094,"login":"marventu94","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjE1MDk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commit/cce6112b246f9b4678aa1456ddc2953c9ae344f1","node_id":"C_kwDOSoZ88NoAKGNjZTYxMTJiMjQ2ZjliNDY3OGFhMTQ1NmRkYzI5NTNjOWFlMzQ0ZjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commit/2e0672c6ece974dfcf346f4aa79390eac70b30c5","sha":"2e0672c6ece974dfcf346f4aa79390eac70b30c5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commits/2e0672c6ece974dfcf346f4aa79390eac70b30c5"}],"sha":"cce6112b246f9b4678aa1456ddc2953c9ae344f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commits/cce6112b246f9b4678aa1456ddc2953c9ae344f1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47615094?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94","id":47615094,"login":"marventu94","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjE1MDk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commits/2e0672c6ece974dfcf346f4aa79390eac70b30c5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T22:27:44Z","email":"47615094+marventu94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"marventu94"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T22:27:44Z","email":"47615094+marventu94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"marventu94"},"message":"chore(backend): activar strict y sacar process.env de QueryService\n\nDos puntos que el plan dejaba como opcionales (§5.2 y §5.3). El primero\nresulto gratis al medirlo.\n\nstrict:\n- El backend tenia strictNullChecks pero no strict, con noImplicitAny y\n  strictBindCallApply apagados, mientras los tres frontends corren con\n  strict + strictTemplates. Asimetria de rigor en el mismo repo.\n- Medido antes de tocar nada: `strict: true` + `noImplicitAny: true` +\n  `strictBindCallApply: true` agrega CERO errores nuevos. Los 2 que\n  aparecen (`@jest/globals` en dos specs) son preexistentes, de resolucion\n  de modulos, y no afectan ni al build (tsconfig.build.json excluye specs)\n  ni a los tests.\n\nprocess.env:\n- QueryService leia SPARQL_MAX_LIMIT, SPARQL_DEFAULT_LIMIT,\n  SPARQL_TIMEOUT_MS y SUMMARY_TOP_CATEGORICAL_LIMIT del entorno en CADA\n  request, aunque ConfigModule ya estaba configurado y el resto de los\n  servicios usa ConfigService. Ademas no era testeable sin manipular\n  variables globales del proceso.\n- Pasa a ConfigService con un helper intConfig(key, fallback).\n- El test de SUMMARY_TOP_CATEGORICAL_LIMIT deja de escribir process.env y\n  maneja la config del servicio, que era el punto.\n\nLos process.env que quedan son los que no tienen DI disponible y estan\nbien asi: bootstrap (main.ts, app.module.ts), factories de providers\n(sparql-endpoint.factory, sqlite.provider), los adapters (clases planas,\nno providers de Nest) y create-dashboard.dto (decoradores, que se evaluan\nantes de que exista el contenedor). QueryService era el unico servicio\ninyectable que leia el entorno directo.\n\n176 pruebas verdes, build OK, lint en 0 errores.","tree":{"sha":"2bee21d9e49713d777864dfe4519a7d92cfe57f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/git/trees/2bee21d9e49713d777864dfe4519a7d92cfe57f4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/git/commits/2e0672c6ece974dfcf346f4aa79390eac70b30c5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47615094?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94","id":47615094,"login":"marventu94","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjE1MDk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commit/2e0672c6ece974dfcf346f4aa79390eac70b30c5","node_id":"C_kwDOSoZ88NoAKDJlMDY3MmM2ZWNlOTc0ZGZjZjM0NmY0YWE3OTM5MGVhYzcwYjMwYzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commit/3c1d3d7a33d90ada11a40bd147da685bee311626","sha":"3c1d3d7a33d90ada11a40bd147da685bee311626","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commits/3c1d3d7a33d90ada11a40bd147da685bee311626"}],"sha":"2e0672c6ece974dfcf346f4aa79390eac70b30c5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commits/2e0672c6ece974dfcf346f4aa79390eac70b30c5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47615094?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94","id":47615094,"login":"marventu94","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjE1MDk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commits/3c1d3d7a33d90ada11a40bd147da685bee311626/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T21:14:34Z","email":"47615094+marventu94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"marventu94"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T21:14:34Z","email":"47615094+marventu94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"marventu94"},"message":"docs: cerrar el plan de calidad con el estado de los 6 items\n\nMarca los 6 items como ejecutados, con los numeros verificados (719\npruebas, lint en 0 errores, build de todo el workspace) y deja anotadas\nlas dos cosas que quedan pendientes porque necesitan una terminal\ninteractiva: regenerar el lockfile y el smoke test de start.sh.","tree":{"sha":"73a7222bb74113a9a2bf7233c55cb8c7224b9b75","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/git/trees/73a7222bb74113a9a2bf7233c55cb8c7224b9b75"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/git/commits/3c1d3d7a33d90ada11a40bd147da685bee311626","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47615094?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94","id":47615094,"login":"marventu94","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjE1MDk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commit/3c1d3d7a33d90ada11a40bd147da685bee311626","node_id":"C_kwDOSoZ88NoAKDNjMWQzZDdhMzNkOTBhZGExMWE0MGJkMTQ3ZGE2ODViZWUzMTE2MjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commit/2e5aa364d930de5e821ec82d232500a78e2caf96","sha":"2e5aa364d930de5e821ec82d232500a78e2caf96","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commits/2e5aa364d930de5e821ec82d232500a78e2caf96"}],"sha":"3c1d3d7a33d90ada11a40bd147da685bee311626","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commits/3c1d3d7a33d90ada11a40bd147da685bee311626"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47615094?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94","id":47615094,"login":"marventu94","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjE1MDk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commits/2e5aa364d930de5e821ec82d232500a78e2caf96/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T21:14:07Z","email":"47615094+marventu94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"marventu94"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T21:14:07Z","email":"47615094+marventu94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"marventu94"},"message":"ci: workflow de verificacion y ESLint en los tres frontends\n\nHabia 701 pruebas verdes y 12.200 lineas de test cuya ejecucion dependia\nde que alguien se acordara: no habia CI, ni hooks, ni un comando unico\npara correrlas. Y ESLint existia solo en el backend, asi que los 5\n`eslint-disable-next-line` de los frontends estaban inertes.\n\n- .github/workflows/ci.yml: install + build + lint + test. La version de\n  Node sale de .nvmrc por node-version-file y nunca literal: better-sqlite3\n  trae prebuilt por NODE_MODULE_VERSION.\n- Scripts build/test/lint en la raiz con `pnpm -r --if-present`, que\n  respeta el orden topologico (contracts y platform-bridge antes que las\n  apps que los consumen).\n- `ng test --watch=false` en los tres frontends: con `ng test` a secas la\n  corrida recursiva quedaba colgada en modo watch.\n- eslint.config.mjs en los tres frontends con typescript-eslint. NO se usa\n  angular-eslint: no esta en el store y sin poder correr `pnpm install` no\n  habria podido verificar la config antes de dejarla, que es exactamente\n  como se rompe un CI recien creado. Queda pendiente el lint de templates.\n- El `lint` del backend corria con --fix, o sea que en CI habria modificado\n  archivos. Se parte en `lint` (chequea) y `lint:fix`.\n- La familia no-unsafe-* del backend baja a warn, igual que\n  no-unsafe-argument, que ya estaba asi: son 55 avisos preexistentes sobre\n  respuestas de upstream y filas de SQLite tipadas como any.\n\nAl prender el lint aparecieron 2 errores reales, y se arreglaron en vez de\nbajar la regla para taparlos:\n\n- query.ts: `const self = this` (no-this-alias), resabio pre-arrow. Los 5\n  usos estaban en callbacks arrow, asi que this lexico alcanza; los golden\n  tests confirman que el SPARQL generado no cambio.\n- map-view.component.ts: `zoomToShowLayer?: Function`\n  (no-unsafe-function-type) pasa a la firma concreta que se invoca.\n\nLos no-unused-vars restantes eran parametros con prefijo _ (_node, _source,\n_options), que ya es la convencion del codigo: la config los ignora en vez\nde pedir cambiar 40 firmas.\n\nVerificado desde la raiz: `pnpm build` exit 0, `pnpm lint` exit 0 (108\nwarnings, 0 errores) y `pnpm test` 719 pruebas verdes.\n\nPendiente: regenerar pnpm-lock.yaml con `pnpm install` (requiere TTY) y\ncommitearlo, o el `--frozen-lockfile` del CI va a fallar por las\ndependencias nuevas.","tree":{"sha":"b110d9dd7ef42362d1e7ca43b08e93d821398326","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/git/trees/b110d9dd7ef42362d1e7ca43b08e93d821398326"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/git/commits/2e5aa364d930de5e821ec82d232500a78e2caf96","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47615094?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94","id":47615094,"login":"marventu94","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjE1MDk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commit/2e5aa364d930de5e821ec82d232500a78e2caf96","node_id":"C_kwDOSoZ88NoAKDJlNWFhMzY0ZDkzMGRlNWU4MjFlYzgyZDIzMjUwMGE3OGUyY2FmOTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commit/4ae89dc60005a246777d01dd1371c8c2049b4502","sha":"4ae89dc60005a246777d01dd1371c8c2049b4502","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commits/4ae89dc60005a246777d01dd1371c8c2049b4502"}],"sha":"2e5aa364d930de5e821ec82d232500a78e2caf96","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commits/2e5aa364d930de5e821ec82d232500a78e2caf96"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47615094?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94","id":47615094,"login":"marventu94","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjE1MDk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commits/4ae89dc60005a246777d01dd1371c8c2049b4502/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T21:07:26Z","email":"47615094+marventu94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"marventu94"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T21:07:26Z","email":"47615094+marventu94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"marventu94"},"message":"refactor(backend): searchEntities pasa a la interfaz SparqlEndpoint\n\nSuggestionsService inyectaba el adapter pero solo lo usaba para\ngetPredicates(). searchEntities ramificaba con\n`if (backend === ''wikidata'')`, hacia sus propias llamadas axios leyendo\nSPARQL_ENDPOINT_URL y las credenciales por su cuenta, y tenia\nhardcodeado el P31 de Wikidata en codigo supuestamente generico.\n\nEra el unico lugar donde no se cumplia la arquitectura domain-agnostic\nque docs/design-decisions.md §9 declara como decision de diseno. Agregar\nun backend obligaba a editar ese if/else en vez de agregar una clase.\n\n- SparqlEndpoint declara searchEntities(keyword, { limit, classUri }).\n- WikidataAdapter nuevo, extiende GenericSparqlAdapter: la API\n  wbsearchentities, el post-filtro por P31 y el caso especial de\n  owl#Thing viven ahi, que es donde corresponde.\n- GenericSparqlAdapter.searchEntities implementa la busqueda por regex\n  sobre labels reusando su propio manejo de URL, credenciales y\n  User-Agent en vez de instanciar axios de nuevo.\n- MillenniumDBAdapter devuelve NotImplementedError, como el resto del stub.\n- escapeSparqlLiteral e isValidUri pasan a adapters/sparql-text.ts: los\n  usan tanto los adapters como la validacion de borde.\n- SuggestionsService queda en 67 lineas (antes 236): recorta el limite,\n  valida el classUri con un 400 claro y delega.\n- El controller baja sus tres logs por request de log.log a log.debug\n  (loggeaba la query cruda en nivel info).\n\n176 pruebas verdes en el backend (antes 165) y build OK. Los casos del\ndetalle de Wikidata se movieron a wikidata.adapter.spec.ts, los del\nendpoint generico a generic-sparql.adapter.spec.ts y los de escapeo a\nsparql-text.spec.ts. Se cubrieron casos que antes no tenian test: bypass\nde owl#Thing, degradacion cuando falla el filtro por clase, descarte de\nURIs que cortarian el VALUES y respeto de una plantilla propia.\n\nQueda documentado un hallazgo nuevo que NO se toca acá: AppConfigService\ntambien ramifica por backend, pero para describir capacidades al\nfrontend, no para consultar. Ver docs/plan-calidad-software.md §5.6.","tree":{"sha":"743b824dc9be5b80da0dfe9f7aecccb806a5fc2e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/git/trees/743b824dc9be5b80da0dfe9f7aecccb806a5fc2e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/git/commits/4ae89dc60005a246777d01dd1371c8c2049b4502","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47615094?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94","id":47615094,"login":"marventu94","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjE1MDk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commit/4ae89dc60005a246777d01dd1371c8c2049b4502","node_id":"C_kwDOSoZ88NoAKDRhZTg5ZGM2MDAwNWEyNDY3NzdkMDFkZDEzNzFjOGMyMDQ5YjQ1MDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commit/2579480ceb756d5fdb9c8e3079491b35da25764e","sha":"2579480ceb756d5fdb9c8e3079491b35da25764e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commits/2579480ceb756d5fdb9c8e3079491b35da25764e"}],"sha":"4ae89dc60005a246777d01dd1371c8c2049b4502","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commits/4ae89dc60005a246777d01dd1371c8c2049b4502"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47615094?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94","id":47615094,"login":"marventu94","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjE1MDk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commits/2579480ceb756d5fdb9c8e3079491b35da25764e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T21:02:42Z","email":"47615094+marventu94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"marventu94"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T21:02:42Z","email":"47615094+marventu94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"marventu94"},"message":"fix(explorer): posiciones absolutas al crear el canvas con un grafo cargado\n\nAl volver al Explorer desde el GIS sin recargar, el canvas se creaba con\nun grafo ya cargado y todos los nodos aparecian apilados en la misma\ncolumna, sin relacion con sus coordenadas. Se acomodaba solo en cuanto el\ngrafo se re-renderizaba (alcanzaba un clic), asi que parecia cosmetico,\npero es la primera impresion al volver de una vista a la otra.\n\n`computeElements()` emitia las posiciones de los hijos relativas al centro\ndel padre (literalmente x=0). Cytoscape toma como absoluto todo lo que\nrecibe, y como la posicion de un compound se deriva del bounding box de\nsus hijos, cada nodo terminaba centrado en x~0.\n\nHabia tres lugares con la convencion de coordenadas: el arranque, que NO\nconvertia, y dos bloques de syncCytoscape que si. Ahora `computeElements`\nemite siempre absolutas y los dos bloques de conversion desaparecen: una\nsola convencion en todo el archivo y ~30 lineas menos.\n\nEl armado se extrajo a canvas-graph.elements.ts como funcion pura. Sin esa\ncostura el test de regresion exigia instanciar el componente con Cytoscape\nmockeado para verificar lo que en el fondo es geometria; el directorio ya\nusa este patron (canvas-graph.drop.ts, .styles.ts, .context-menus.ts).\n\n198 pruebas verdes en el Explorer (194 + 4 nuevas) y build OK.","tree":{"sha":"0991442f60c6c46a16286c695ae3da3c0566757c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/git/trees/0991442f60c6c46a16286c695ae3da3c0566757c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/git/commits/2579480ceb756d5fdb9c8e3079491b35da25764e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47615094?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94","id":47615094,"login":"marventu94","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjE1MDk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commit/2579480ceb756d5fdb9c8e3079491b35da25764e","node_id":"C_kwDOSoZ88NoAKDI1Nzk0ODBjZWI3NTZkNWZkYjljOGUzMDc5NDkxYjM1ZGEyNTc2NGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commit/9ae273a2ff3e527ff3aebf461afb1176ccc2e685","sha":"9ae273a2ff3e527ff3aebf461afb1176ccc2e685","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commits/9ae273a2ff3e527ff3aebf461afb1176ccc2e685"}],"sha":"2579480ceb756d5fdb9c8e3079491b35da25764e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commits/2579480ceb756d5fdb9c8e3079491b35da25764e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47615094?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94","id":47615094,"login":"marventu94","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjE1MDk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commits/9ae273a2ff3e527ff3aebf461afb1176ccc2e685/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T20:59:35Z","email":"47615094+marventu94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"marventu94"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T20:59:35Z","email":"47615094+marventu94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"marventu94"},"message":"fix(explorer): addEdge idempotente para el mismo par (property, target)\n\nElimina el unico TODO del codigo productivo. `addEdgeToList` apilaba\naristas repetidas (\"preserved legacy behavior\"): con el mismo par\n(property, target) quedaban dos Edge distintos y el canvas dibujaba dos\nflechas superpuestas.\n\nLa regla es angosta a proposito, y hay dos casos que NO se tocan:\n\n- La rama `source instanceof Node` crea una property nueva con\n  `newProp()`, asi que dos llamadas Node->Node son dos slots de predicado\n  distintos y ambos legitimos.\n- Una property con varios targets distintos sigue valiendo: es un caso\n  que `removeNodeFromGraph` ya contemplaba explicitamente.\n\nEl chequeo va en `addEdge` y no en `addEdgeToList`: si se rechazara ahi\nabajo, la rama `Node` ya habria creado una property huerfana via\n`newProp()` y `addEdge` devolveria una arista que no esta en la lista.\nSe devuelve la arista existente, que la firma `Edge | null` ya admitia.\n\nEl SPARQL generado no cambia: `Query.addTriple` ya deduplicaba por\nidentidad (s, p, o). Verificado con los golden tests, que era la guarda\ndel cambio. 194 pruebas verdes en el Explorer (191 + 3 nuevas).","tree":{"sha":"16eb9165ce82c27076c387a735ac894969f52368","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/git/trees/16eb9165ce82c27076c387a735ac894969f52368"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/git/commits/9ae273a2ff3e527ff3aebf461afb1176ccc2e685","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47615094?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94","id":47615094,"login":"marventu94","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjE1MDk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commit/9ae273a2ff3e527ff3aebf461afb1176ccc2e685","node_id":"C_kwDOSoZ88NoAKDlhZTI3M2EyZmYzZTUyN2ZmM2FlYmY0NjFhZmIxMTc2Y2NjMmU2ODU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commit/ef5922e8f79eb5a0b1ebb4552933c57c676c1ccc","sha":"ef5922e8f79eb5a0b1ebb4552933c57c676c1ccc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commits/ef5922e8f79eb5a0b1ebb4552933c57c676c1ccc"}],"sha":"9ae273a2ff3e527ff3aebf461afb1176ccc2e685","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commits/9ae273a2ff3e527ff3aebf461afb1176ccc2e685"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47615094?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94","id":47615094,"login":"marventu94","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjE1MDk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commits/ef5922e8f79eb5a0b1ebb4552933c57c676c1ccc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T20:58:33Z","email":"47615094+marventu94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"marventu94"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T20:58:33Z","email":"47615094+marventu94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"marventu94"},"message":"refactor: contrato de handoff Explorer<->GIS en un paquete compartido\n\nQueryHandoffService estaba copiado a mano en los dos remotes: ~90 lineas\nidenticas, incluidas las constantes que SON el contrato (clave de\nsessionStorage, TTL y nombre del evento de window). Cambiar cualquiera de\nlas tres en un lado y no en el otro rompia el handoff en runtime sin que\nlo detectara el compilador ni ningun test. gis-session-channel.ts tenia\nel mismo problema y sus comentarios ya habian divergido.\n\nEl comentario que justificaba la duplicacion decia que \"los servicios no\nse pueden compartir entre remotes\". Eso es cierto para la instancia de\nAngular, no para el codigo: el acoplamiento acá es via sessionStorage y\nwindow, asi que alcanza con compartir el contrato.\n\n- packages/platform-bridge: contrato + logica de lectura/escritura. Se\n  movio tambien la logica, no solo las constantes: dejar los ~50 renglones\n  de storage duplicados era la mitad del problema.\n- Los dos QueryHandoffService quedan en 49 lineas de envoltorio en\n  signals. Cada remote conserva su propia instancia.\n- Los 4 archivos originales siguen existiendo como re-export, asi que\n  ningun importador cambia (mismo patron que binding.model.ts con\n  @rdfgis/contracts).\n- El paquete va al skip de federation de ambos remotes: tiene codigo de\n  runtime y el host no lo declara, asi que compartirlo con\n  shareAll+ignoreUnusedDeps dejaria al remote sin resolver el specifier.\n\nVerificado: 519 pruebas verdes (191 Explorer + 328 GIS) sobre Node\n24.18.0, `pnpm build` OK en los dos remotes, y el contrato queda\nbundleado dentro de cada uno y fuera del import-map de federacion.\n\nPendiente: pnpm-lock.yaml no se actualizo (el install requiere TTY). Hay\nque correr `pnpm install` y commitear el lockfile antes de que el CI del\nItem 3 pueda usar --frozen-lockfile.","tree":{"sha":"a8be8be224c4478e281618af1270e2efbb25efe0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/git/trees/a8be8be224c4478e281618af1270e2efbb25efe0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/git/commits/ef5922e8f79eb5a0b1ebb4552933c57c676c1ccc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47615094?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94","id":47615094,"login":"marventu94","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjE1MDk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commit/ef5922e8f79eb5a0b1ebb4552933c57c676c1ccc","node_id":"C_kwDOSoZ88NoAKGVmNTkyMmU4Zjc5ZWI1YTBiMWViYjQ1NTI5MzNjNTdjNjc2YzFjY2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commit/d3aa850bdf474354e3ea185fe413161e2a621285","sha":"d3aa850bdf474354e3ea185fe413161e2a621285","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commits/d3aa850bdf474354e3ea185fe413161e2a621285"}],"sha":"ef5922e8f79eb5a0b1ebb4552933c57c676c1ccc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commits/ef5922e8f79eb5a0b1ebb4552933c57c676c1ccc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47615094?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94","id":47615094,"login":"marventu94","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjE1MDk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commits/d3aa850bdf474354e3ea185fe413161e2a621285/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T20:52:54Z","email":"47615094+marventu94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"marventu94"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T20:52:54Z","email":"47615094+marventu94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"marventu94"},"message":"chore: unificar el pnpm del workspace en una sola version\n\n`pnpm run` abortaba en la raiz, en backend/ y en packages/contracts/ con\nERR_PNPM_ABORTED_REMOVE_MODULES_DIR_NO_TTY: el chequeo previo de\ndependencias de pnpm 11 disparaba un install que queria purgar\nnode_modules, y sin TTY aborta. Los 3 frontends se salvaban solo porque\npineaban pnpm@10.33.4, que no hace ese chequeo.\n\nCon dos majors de pnpm conviviendo, el stack levantaba por casualidad:\nstart.sh entra por `npm run dev` y de los cuatro scripts dev:* solo\ndev:gis usaba pnpm, justo en un directorio con pnpm 10.\n\n- Se quita `packageManager` de los 3 frontends: la raiz queda como unica\n  fuente de verdad (pnpm@11.10.0), que ademas es la version con la que\n  esta hecho el install en disco (node_modules/.modules.yaml).\n- Los cuatro scripts dev:* de la raiz pasan a `pnpm run` (habia 3 con npm\n  y 1 con pnpm).\n- `verifyDepsBeforeRun: false` en pnpm-workspace.yaml. En .npmrc no\n  funciona: pnpm 11 lee estos settings desde el workspace, igual que\n  allowBuilds y patchedDependencies. La instalacion la maneja start.sh y\n  el CI parte siempre de un install limpio.\n- Se elimina frontend/rdf_explorer/.npmrc (package-manager-strict=false):\n  existia solo para tapar el split de versiones.\n\nVerificado: `pnpm run` anda en los 6 paquetes y en la raiz, y\n`pnpm test` en backend/ corre 165 pruebas verdes sobre Node 24.18.0.","tree":{"sha":"41c38807e935ded81d1827687f570503b70ced3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/git/trees/41c38807e935ded81d1827687f570503b70ced3f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/git/commits/d3aa850bdf474354e3ea185fe413161e2a621285","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47615094?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94","id":47615094,"login":"marventu94","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjE1MDk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commit/d3aa850bdf474354e3ea185fe413161e2a621285","node_id":"C_kwDOSoZ88NoAKGQzYWE4NTBiZGY0NzQzNTRlM2VhMTg1ZmU0MTMxNjFlMmE2MjEyODU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commit/9e1d9f0387351b6fb6d119874e7f00e4621b2f20","sha":"9e1d9f0387351b6fb6d119874e7f00e4621b2f20","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commits/9e1d9f0387351b6fb6d119874e7f00e4621b2f20"}],"sha":"d3aa850bdf474354e3ea185fe413161e2a621285","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commits/d3aa850bdf474354e3ea185fe413161e2a621285"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47615094?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94","id":47615094,"login":"marventu94","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjE1MDk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commits/9e1d9f0387351b6fb6d119874e7f00e4621b2f20/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T20:52:54Z","email":"47615094+marventu94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"marventu94"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T20:52:54Z","email":"47615094+marventu94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"marventu94"},"message":"docs: plan de calidad de software con el relevamiento y los 6 items\n\nRelevamiento de estructura, escalabilidad y clean code sobre todo el\nmonorepo (backend NestJS, 3 frontends Angular, packages/contracts).\n\nDocumenta los 12 hallazgos del relevamiento mas 2 encontrados al\nverificarlo, los 6 items que se ejecutan (con evidencia, pasos, criterio\nde aceptacion y esfuerzo) y las 8 decisiones de NO refactorizar con su\nfundamento, para no volver a analizarlas.\n\nIncluye anexo con los comandos de relevamiento para reproducir la linea\nbase y medir el progreso.","tree":{"sha":"6252f3182f251dd2bffad38676a0ccb4d244d444","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/git/trees/6252f3182f251dd2bffad38676a0ccb4d244d444"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/git/commits/9e1d9f0387351b6fb6d119874e7f00e4621b2f20","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent