d_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commits/6e8ce0b46c7297124237260cd55a0b4f8278742a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T20:42:23Z","email":"47615094+marventu94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"marventu94"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T20:42:23Z","email":"47615094+marventu94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"marventu94"},"message":"chore(scripts): herramienta para reacomodar los workspaces del Explorer\n\nLos workspaces demo del OVS no se armaron desde la herramienta: se generaron\ncon una grilla fija (dX 340 / dY 65-130) que ignora el alto real de cada nodo,\nasí que los nodos altos se pisaban entre sí (49 pares en 13 tableros) y no se\npodía agarrar el que quedaba tapado. Además guardaban zoom 1 con pan (0,0) y\nnodos en Y negativa: media pantalla del grafo arrancaba fuera de vista.\n\nEl script recalcula solo las posiciones con un layout por capas que usa la\ngeometría real de los nodos (título + hijos + padding, espejo de la hoja de\nestilos de Cytoscape), deja todo en coordenadas positivas y guarda un viewport\nque encuadra el grafo. Verifica que no queden solapamientos y hace backup del\n.sqlite antes de escribir. No toca nodos, aristas, filtros ni la query.","tree":{"sha":"69a671d021e12302eba368a8d86e98d55b616c0a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/git/trees/69a671d021e12302eba368a8d86e98d55b616c0a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/git/commits/6e8ce0b46c7297124237260cd55a0b4f8278742a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47615094?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94","id":47615094,"login":"marventu94","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjE1MDk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commit/6e8ce0b46c7297124237260cd55a0b4f8278742a","node_id":"C_kwDOSoZ88NoAKDZlOGNlMGI0NmM3Mjk3MTI0MjM3MjYwY2Q1NWEwYjRmODI3ODc0MmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commit/cd3d37fde308d5bee9c9ce400af5317f5ad4d024","sha":"cd3d37fde308d5bee9c9ce400af5317f5ad4d024","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commits/cd3d37fde308d5bee9c9ce400af5317f5ad4d024"}],"sha":"6e8ce0b46c7297124237260cd55a0b4f8278742a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commits/6e8ce0b46c7297124237260cd55a0b4f8278742a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47615094?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94","id":47615094,"login":"marventu94","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjE1MDk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commits/cd3d37fde308d5bee9c9ce400af5317f5ad4d024/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T20:42:16Z","email":"47615094+marventu94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"marventu94"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T20:42:16Z","email":"47615094+marventu94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"marventu94"},"message":"feat: avisar antes de pisar el tablero del GIS al exportar del Explorer\n\nExportar desde el Explorer reemplazaba en el GIS la consulta, el layout y los\nfiltros del tablero abierto sin decir nada, y encima el handoff dejaba\n`currentDashboardId` apuntando al tablero anterior: apretar Guardar (que viene\nen modo \"sobrescribir\") pisaba en la base el tablero guardado con la query\nimportada.\n\nAhora:\n\n- El Explorer avisa antes de publicar el handoff, con el nombre del tablero\n  abierto y tres salidas: cancelar, ir al GIS a guardarlo, o exportar igual.\n- El GIS pregunta al recibir una importación si hay algo que perder, con la\n  opción de guardar en el momento (mismo diálogo de guardado de siempre) y\n  aplicar después. No pregunta dos veces: si el Explorer ya confirmó, viaja\n  `overwriteConfirmed` en el payload.\n- Al aplicar una importación se desvincula el tablero, así la vista importada\n  es una vista nueva y Guardar ofrece guardar una copia.\n- No avisa si en el GIS está tal cual la exportación anterior: si avisara en\n  cada re-export, el aviso se volvería ruido que se clickea sin leer.\n\nEl estado del GIS llega al Explorer por un canal compartido en `window`\n(los servicios no se comparten entre remotes, igual que QueryHandoffService).\nVa en `window` y no en sessionStorage a propósito: así muere con la página y\nno queda un aviso fantasma después de un F5.\n\nEl botón \"Explorar en GIS\" además ya no se queda mudo cuando no puede\nexportar (sin consulta, grafo con varias consultas separadas, proyección\nvacía o navegación cancelada).","tree":{"sha":"40340897ac132454f15bdbf0652b6481903d6868","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/git/trees/40340897ac132454f15bdbf0652b6481903d6868"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/git/commits/cd3d37fde308d5bee9c9ce400af5317f5ad4d024","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47615094?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94","id":47615094,"login":"marventu94","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjE1MDk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commit/cd3d37fde308d5bee9c9ce400af5317f5ad4d024","node_id":"C_kwDOSoZ88NoAKGNkM2QzN2ZkZTMwOGQ1YmVlOWM5Y2U0MDBhZjUzMTdmNWFkNGQwMjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commit/7a4871a4b825cde8626eb214dccafa651a4a2d81","sha":"7a4871a4b825cde8626eb214dccafa651a4a2d81","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commits/7a4871a4b825cde8626eb214dccafa651a4a2d81"}],"sha":"cd3d37fde308d5bee9c9ce400af5317f5ad4d024","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commits/cd3d37fde308d5bee9c9ce400af5317f5ad4d024"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47615094?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94","id":47615094,"login":"marventu94","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjE1MDk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commits/7a4871a4b825cde8626eb214dccafa651a4a2d81/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T20:41:58Z","email":"47615094+marventu94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"marventu94"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T20:41:58Z","email":"47615094+marventu94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"marventu94"},"message":"feat(gis): popup de error al ejecutar una query\n\nLos errores de ejecución salían en un snackbar de 8s sin detalle. Con el\neditor colapsado, o con una query importada que corre sola, no quedaba ninguna\nseñal de que algo había fallado: la pantalla se veía igual que antes de\napretar.\n\nAhora sale un diálogo que hay que cerrar, con el mensaje traducido y el cuerpo\ncrudo del backend (por ejemplo \"INVALID_SPARQL: Cannot resolve relative\nIRI ...\"), tanto para el parseo local como para los 400/408/413/502.\n\nAdemás, mientras la query corre queda un cartel persistente: contra GraphDB\nuna consulta puede tardar minutos y no había nada que lo indicara.","tree":{"sha":"45f7912a315e49885f33f2e4eef34cc4152e4b8a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/git/trees/45f7912a315e49885f33f2e4eef34cc4152e4b8a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/git/commits/7a4871a4b825cde8626eb214dccafa651a4a2d81","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47615094?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94","id":47615094,"login":"marventu94","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjE1MDk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commit/7a4871a4b825cde8626eb214dccafa651a4a2d81","node_id":"C_kwDOSoZ88NoAKDdhNDg3MWE0YjgyNWNkZTg2MjZlYjIxNGRjY2FmYTY1MWE0YTJkODE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commit/54522c7dc5750ad30cd6d805712a23a3cae0a600","sha":"54522c7dc5750ad30cd6d805712a23a3cae0a600","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commits/54522c7dc5750ad30cd6d805712a23a3cae0a600"}],"sha":"7a4871a4b825cde8626eb214dccafa651a4a2d81","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commits/7a4871a4b825cde8626eb214dccafa651a4a2d81"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47615094?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94","id":47615094,"login":"marventu94","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjE1MDk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commits/54522c7dc5750ad30cd6d805712a23a3cae0a600/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T20:41:51Z","email":"47615094+marventu94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"marventu94"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T20:41:51Z","email":"47615094+marventu94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"marventu94"},"message":"fix(explorer): un solo bloque OPTIONAL para los opcionales encadenados\n\nSe emitía un `OPTIONAL { }` por triple. Con eso, si el primer bloque no\nmatchea, la variable queda sin ligar y el siguiente se evalúa con la variable\nlibre: matchea cualquier valor del grafo y multiplica filas que no tienen nada\nque ver con el nodo ancla.\n\nMedido en el E01 del OVS (misma query, LIMIT 100): antes 100 filas con 1 solo\n?realEstate distinto pareado con 97 geometrías ajenas; ahora 67 distintos con\nsu geometría real. El mapa mostraba un punto y coordenadas equivocadas.\n\nAhora los triples opcionales se agrupan por las variables que el patrón\nobligatorio no liga y se ordenan para que cada eslabón vaya después del que\nliga a su sujeto. Las ramas opcionales independientes (dos propiedades\nopcionales del mismo nodo) siguen en bloques separados, que es lo correcto.\n\n`toSparqlFullProjection()` acepta además un LIMIT explícito, que usa la\nexportación al GIS.","tree":{"sha":"044f45a46e647f28b005ff9141639a8da0be4669","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/git/trees/044f45a46e647f28b005ff9141639a8da0be4669"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/git/commits/54522c7dc5750ad30cd6d805712a23a3cae0a600","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47615094?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94","id":47615094,"login":"marventu94","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjE1MDk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commit/54522c7dc5750ad30cd6d805712a23a3cae0a600","node_id":"C_kwDOSoZ88NoAKDU0NTIyYzdkYzU3NTBhZDMwY2Q2ZDgwNTcxMmEyM2EzY2FlMGE2MDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commit/eb39e1c4f9b8e5bbc1a4e38e968e6bf490000134","sha":"eb39e1c4f9b8e5bbc1a4e38e968e6bf490000134","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commits/eb39e1c4f9b8e5bbc1a4e38e968e6bf490000134"}],"sha":"54522c7dc5750ad30cd6d805712a23a3cae0a600","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commits/54522c7dc5750ad30cd6d805712a23a3cae0a600"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47615094?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94","id":47615094,"login":"marventu94","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjE1MDk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commits/eb39e1c4f9b8e5bbc1a4e38e968e6bf490000134/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T20:41:42Z","email":"47615094+marventu94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"marventu94"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T20:41:42Z","email":"47615094+marventu94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"marventu94"},"message":"fix(explorer): no pedir label de los valores de literal\n\nLos Literal guardan su VALOR en `uris`, no un IRI. El prefetch de labels los\nmandaba igual y se serializaban como `<BASE>` (de `gr:priceType \"BASE\"`), con\nlo que el endpoint rechazaba la query entera:\n\n  POST /api/query/execute -> 400 INVALID_SPARQL\n  \"Cannot resolve relative IRI BASE because no base IRI was set.\"\n\nUn solo valor malo tiraba abajo el lote completo de hasta 100 labels y el\nerror quedaba tapado en un console.error, así que el grafo aparecia sin\netiquetas sin ninguna explicación.\n\nLos literales quedan fuera del prefetch y, como red de seguridad, se\ndescartan los valores que no son IRIs absolutos.","tree":{"sha":"ce580ac035d18f75b19b78a0aa294a060e9b6d52","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/git/trees/ce580ac035d18f75b19b78a0aa294a060e9b6d52"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/git/commits/eb39e1c4f9b8e5bbc1a4e38e968e6bf490000134","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47615094?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94","id":47615094,"login":"marventu94","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjE1MDk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://ap