GIS (una\n  sola fuente de verdad); se elimina el campo literalAliases. Verificado:\n  la query GIS generada es idéntica a la anterior.\n- loadWorkspaceAsTabs: workspaces de un solo panel muestran el nombre del\n  tablero en la pestaña (antes el seed/legados mostraban un nombre corto\n  distinto, p.ej. ''Batallas WWII'' vs ''Batallas de la Segunda Guerra\n  Mundial''). El seed ahora nombra el panel con explorerName.\n- Tests: 3 nuevos para toSparqlFullProjection + 2 para el sync de nombre\n  (178/178 en rdf_explorer).","tree":{"sha":"1848528942370dbd9ac72d7eba1551ab067d94f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/git/trees/1848528942370dbd9ac72d7eba1551ab067d94f5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/git/commits/725c4604420f7fb7624d5fd7244489ca618852fd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47615094?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94","id":47615094,"login":"marventu94","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjE1MDk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commit/725c4604420f7fb7624d5fd7244489ca618852fd","node