/scripts/seed-demo-dashboards.ts: construye 5 workspaces del\n  Explorer + 5 equivalentes GIS con las clases del dominio, valida volumen y\n  cobertura contra el endpoint y escribe data/<backend>.sqlite (idempotente,\n  --dry-run / --no-validate)\n- Se versiona backend/data/wikidata.sqlite con los tableros ya cargados: al\n  levantar el proyecto con la config por defecto (Wikidata) hay datos\n  interesantes para explorar\n- Query.toSparql() declara PREFIX xsd cuando la query contiene ^^xsd:dateTime\n  (los filtros de fecha lo serializan sin pasar por curieLocal y sparqljs\n  rechazaba la query con \"Unknown prefix: xsd\"); cubierto por golden tests\n- Docs: README (sección Tableros demo) y AGENTS.md (comando seed + nota xsd)","tree":{"sha":"809a43b513d3eb1fd25aca90ba0fd3e4d326857c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/git/trees/809a43b513d3eb1fd25aca90ba0fd3e4d326857c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/git/commits/e513fd4b0f52a8b467a15b3b081a11508f127f57","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47615094?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94","id":47615094,"login":"marventu94","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjE1MDk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/subs