{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47615094?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94","id":47615094,"login":"marventu94","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjE1MDk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commit/10e4814e72a6781a955dbbc3ad025919f8a4b0b0","node_id":"C_kwDOSoZ88NoAKDEwZTQ4MTRlNzJhNjc4MWE5NTVkYmJjM2FkMDI1OTE5ZjhhNGIwYjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commit/26fe9a24663851bbadc030a9a441d2f24cc3ec91","sha":"26fe9a24663851bbadc030a9a441d2f24cc3ec91","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commits/26fe9a24663851bbadc030a9a441d2f24cc3ec91"}],"sha":"10e4814e72a6781a955dbbc3ad025919f8a4b0b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commits/10e4814e72a6781a955dbbc3ad025919f8a4b0b0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47615094?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94","id":47615094,"login":"marventu94","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjE1MDk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commits/26fe9a24663851bbadc030a9a441d2f24cc3ec91/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-30T12:40:44Z","email":"47615094+marventu94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"marventu94"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-30T12:40:44Z","email":"47615094+marventu94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"marventu94"},"message":"feat(gis): el grafo se actualiza en el lugar y se acomoda a mano\n\nvisibleQueryResult$ y lotState$ dependen de _selectedNode$ por el pinning\ndel lote, asi que cada click re-emitia y renderGraph() destruia la\ninstancia de cytoscape para reconstruirla. Eso reacomodaba los nodos,\nperdia zoom y pan, y aplicaba el atenuado sobre una instancia recien\ncreada mientras arrancaba el layout: de ahi que clickear se sintiera\nraro. Ahora syncGraph() crea la instancia una sola vez y difunde\ncambios; si la topologia no cambio solo refresca datos, y si cambio\nagrega y quita elementos corriendo el layout con los nodos previos\nbloqueados, para que solo se ubiquen los nuevos.\n\nArrastre suave: al agarrar un nodo se enciende la simulacion de cola con\ninfinite:true y se apaga al soltar. cola escribe las posiciones\nsalteando el nodo agarrado, asi que ese va exacto donde lo soltas y los\nvecinos se acomodan por fisica. Con Shift se mueve solo el nodo, y en\ndagre/circle/grid no se enciende porque una relajacion les desarmaria el\norden. Lo que el usuario acomodo a mano se bloquea durante el arrastre y\nse persiste en GraphViewState junto a la camara.\n\nSe elimina el auto-colapso de hubs, que escondia vecinos al cargar sin\nhaberlo pedido y hacia que el click significara dos cosas distintas\nsegun el nodo. El estado visual pasa de mutar opacity inline a clases,\nlo que ademas le da al nodo seleccionado un borde propio.\n\nAristas: cola gana flow para reducir cruces, mas nodeSpacing, edgeLength\nexplicito y nodeDimensionsIncludeLabels; se agrega selector :loop porque\ntodos los self-loops usaban el mismo angulo y quedaban encimados. Se\nquita animationDuration de cola, que no es una opcion suya y hacia\nencuadrar a los 600 ms mientras la simulacion seguia hasta 4 s.\n\nEl chip informa lote y truncado juntos, y el tamano del nodo pasa a usar\nel grado dibujado: con el total, un hub recortado se veia gordo pero con\npocas aristas. El grado real queda en el tooltip del nodo.\n\nDe paso: se instancia con el layout guardado y no con el default, los\nlisteners del container se registran una sola vez con su cleanup, y el\nfoco por viewport usa la bounding box en vez del centro del nodo.","tree":{"sha":"9b914863419e192d798e9dae38efa719e9e57986","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/git/trees/9b914863419e192d798e9dae38efa719e9e57986"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/git/commits/26fe9a24663851bbadc030a9a441d2f24cc3ec91","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47615094?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94","id":47615094,"login":"marventu94","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjE1MDk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commit/26fe9a24663851bbadc030a9a441d2f24cc3ec91","node_id":"C_kwDOSoZ88NoAKDI2ZmU5YTI0NjYzODUxYmJhZGMwMzBhOWE0NDFkMmYyNGNjM2VjOTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commit/914b1b161721dd89233dc54ef21cf80142b83af0","sha":"914b1b161721dd89233dc54ef21cf80142b83af0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commits/914b1b161721dd89233dc54ef21cf80142b83af0"}],"sha":"26fe9a24663851bbadc030a9a441d2f24cc3ec91","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commits/26fe9a24663851bbadc030a9a441d2f24cc3ec91"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47615094?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94","id":47615094,"login":"marventu94","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjE1MDk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commits/914b1b161721dd89233dc54ef21cf80142b83af0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-30T11:29:38Z","email":"47615094+marventu94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"marventu94"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-30T11:29:38Z","email":"47615094+marventu94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"marventu94"},"message":"fix(gis): la timeline se ajusta al cuadrante y la rueda hace zoom\n\nvis-timeline se instanciaba sin height, asi que se auto-dimensionaba al\ncontenido apilado y crecia mas alto que el cuadrante: el eje de fechas\nquedaba empujado fuera de vista y el unico scroll era el del host, que\narrastraba tambien la toolbar. Ahora la timeline se clava al alto del\ncontenedor y vis expone su propia barra interna solo para los items.\n\nLa rueda pasa a hacer zoom temporal como el mapa. Requiere preferZoom\njunto con la ausencia de zoomKey: con zoomKey presente el handler del\nCore vuelve a scrollear en vez de dejar zoomear al Range.\n\nSe elimina PriceChartComponent, que ocupaba 120px fijos del cuadrante\nsin aportar: el backend llena numericValue con el anio de la propia\nfecha, un chicken-and-egg entre ViewChild y el @if impedia que el canvas\nse dibujara nunca, y el detail-panel ya lista todos los atributos. En su\nlugar, tooltips que leen los atributos numericos del nodo -m2, precio o\ncualquier magnitud, en cualquier grafo- y etiquetas de grupo legibles\ncon conteo en vez del nombre crudo de la variable SPARQL.\n\nDe paso: initTimeline() pasa antes de las suscripciones, porque los\nBehaviorSubject emiten sincronicamente y con un queryResult ya presente\nse perdia el encuadre inicial; y se saca el margin-left:auto duplicado\nque hacia saltar el boton \"Aplicar rango\" segun hubiera chip o no.","tree":{"sha":"41b788de7756353fadaf0f30fba25d56168e63dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/git/trees/41b788de7756353fadaf0f30fba25d56168e63dd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/git/commits/914b1b161721dd89233dc54ef21cf80142b83af0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47615094?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94","id":47615094,"login":"marventu94","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjE1MDk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commit/914b1b161721dd89233dc54ef21cf80142b83af0","node_id":"C_kwDOSoZ88NoAKDkxNGIxYjE2MTcyMWRkODkyMzNkYzU0ZWYyMWNmODAxNDJiODNhZjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commit/e69d0790f32bac28bbd11e9ac0fdfc265c34e8d3","sha":"e69d0790f32bac28bbd11e9ac0fdfc265c34e8d3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commits/e69d0790f32bac28bbd11e9ac0fdfc265c34e8d3"}],"sha":"914b1b161721dd89233dc54ef21cf80142b83af0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commits/914b1b161721dd89233dc54ef21cf80142b83af0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47615094?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94","id":47615094,"login":"marventu94","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjE1MDk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commits/e69d0790f32bac28bbd11e9ac0fdfc265c34e8d3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-29T23:54:08Z","email":"47615094+marventu94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"marventu94"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-29T23:54:08Z","email":"47615094+marventu94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"marventu94"},"message":"feat(gis): lotes globales por filas con pinning y chips de cobertura\n\nCuando el resultado supera el tamano de lote (100/300/500 filas,\ndefault 300), las 4 vistas muestran el mismo lote de filas en el orden\nde la query y el navbar permite navegar entre lotes. La seleccion\nqueda pineada y se inyecta en el lote visible aunque pertenezca a otro,\nasi el linking & brushing no se rompe nunca. Los nodos visibles son\nlos URIs de las filas del lote mas sus vecinos a 1 salto (intermedios).\n\nChips de cobertura por vista (mapa/timeline/grafo) que avisan cuanta\ninformacion queda fuera, contando solo entidades principales (nodos\ncon datos propios): los nodos estructurales del modelo ya no inflan\nel ''sin coordenada/sin fecha''. La timeline distingue ''la query no\ndevolvio fechas'' de ''este lote no tiene nodos con fecha''.\n\nSe elimina el selector de LIMIT del editor: ApiService pide el\nmaxLimit que publica el backend en /api/config y el volumen se pagina\nen cliente con los lotes.","tree":{"sha":"fe8e9f3f7e4673d95d0f91a8f39d4e05c3d60605","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/git/trees/fe8e9f3f7e4673d95d0f91a8f39d4e05c3d60605"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/git/commits/e69d0790f32bac28bbd11e9ac0fdfc265c34e8d3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47615094?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94","id":47615094,"login":"marventu94","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjE1MDk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commit/e69d0790f32bac28bbd11e9ac0fdfc265c34e8d3","node_id":"C_kwDOSoZ88NoAKGU2OWQwNzkwZjMyYmFjMjhiYmQxMWU5YWMwZmRmYzI2NWMzNGU4ZDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commit/67135c5692467d0d779381f1c4f63d70dbc5a667","sha":"67135c5692467d0d779381f1c4f63d70dbc5a667","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commits/67135c5692467d0d779381f1c4f63d70dbc5a667"}],"sha":"e69d0790f32bac28bbd11e9ac0fdfc265c34e8d3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commits/e69d0790f32bac28bbd11e9ac0fdfc265c34e8d3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47615094?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94","id":47615094,"login":"marventu94","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjE1MDk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commits/67135c5692467d0d779381f1c4f63d70dbc5a667/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-29T23:53:54Z","email":"47615094+marventu94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"marventu94"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-29T23:53:54Z","email":"47615094+marventu94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"marventu94"},"message":"fix(backend): degrada WKT invalido a literal en vez de abortar la query\n\nUn literal tipado wktLiteral con datos sucios (p.ej. ''POINT(None None)'')\nhacia que parseWktPoint lanzara y toda la query respondiera 500. Ahora\nnormalizeValue lo degrada a literal plano conservando valor y datatype:\nel nodo queda sin coordenada y la query completa con normalidad.","tree":{"sha":"65a4c90d7c19ee1fac5eeb88f763a8e262dafd02","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/git/trees/65a4c90d7c19ee1fac5eeb88f763a8e262dafd02"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/git/commits/67135c5692467d0d779381f1c4f63d70dbc5a667","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47615094?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94","id":47615094,"login":"marventu94","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjE1MDk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marventu94","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commit/67135c5692467d0d779381f1c4f63d70dbc5a667","node_id":"C_kwDOSoZ88NoAKDY3MTM1YzU2OTI0NjdkMGQ3NzkzODFmMWM0ZjYzZDcwZGJjNWE2Njc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commit/13d361844a48b36f91f55b85505d19f6d608fa67","sha":"13d361844a48b36f91f55b85505d19f6d608fa67","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marventu94/RDFGISExplorer/commits/13d361844a48b36f91f55b85505d19f6d608fa67"}],"sha":"67135c5692467d0d779