ate":"2026-05-28T13:39:26Z","email":"142720236+Hardik0110@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Hardik Kubavat"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-28T13:39:26Z","email":"142720236+Hardik0110@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Hardik Kubavat"},"message":"Profile + Link: open the OAuth flow inline instead of bouncing to /app\n\nThe + Link buttons on the Profile linked-accounts panel used to send\npost-onboarding users to /onboarding/link-account, where the\nOnboardingLayout immediately redirected wizardStep=''done'' users to\n/app. Fix it without duplicating OAuth code:\n\n- ProfilePage LinkedAccountsPanel: + Link button is now a Button with\n  onClick that stashes /app/profile in sessionStorage and navigates to\n  /onboarding/link-account\n- OnboardingLayout: relax the done-user redirect when the current path\n  is /onboarding/link-account. Hides the wizard progress bar in that\n  case and swaps the step counter for a ''Back to profile'' link.\n- LinkAccountStep.handleContinue: checks for the sessionStorage flag\n  first; if present, navigates there and clears the flag without\n  advancing the wizard. Fallback: if user is already done and there\n  is no flag, route to /app/profile instead of trying to advance.","tree":{"sha":"62a01ab7641b61580e0631f2fe04aad274916cd8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hardik0110/Microchore-Frontend/git/trees/62a01ab7641b61580e0631f2fe04aad274916cd8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hardik0110/Microchore-Frontend/git/commits/5d749a1698ac29a96e9d01f6824ad00167b7d8ef","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/142720236?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hardik0110/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hardik0110/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hardik0110/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hardik0110/gi