Z","email":"142720236+Hardik0110@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Hardik Kubavat"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-28T12:14:45Z","email":"142720236+Hardik0110@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Hardik Kubavat"},"message":"Perf + SEO: lazy-load every route bundle, add OG and Twitter meta tags\n\nRoutes are now React.lazy() chunks. Initial bundle on the landing page\ndrops to the vendor index chunk + HomePage chunk; every other page (auth,\nonboarding, app, company, admin) only loads when navigated to. The\nSuspense fallback is a small brand spinner.\n\nindex.html gets theme-color, color-scheme, canonical link, full Open\nGraph block, and Twitter card tags so SEO score lifts and link previews\nlook correct when the site is shared.\n\nLighthouse run on a dev server (the original 4 MB payload) is misleading\nbecause Vite serves unminified modules with HMR runtime. Re-test against\n''npm run build && npm run preview'' or the live Vercel deploy for the\nreal numbers.","tree":{"sha":"7fa724ed52e85834f887717f4283e49618989492","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hardik0110/Microchore-Frontend/git/trees/7fa724ed52e85834f887717f4283e49618989492"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hardik0110/Microchore-Frontend/git/commits/147fbb1992a061b7a4e18515a98a0cc9c3c76408","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/142720236?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hardik0110/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hardik0110/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hardik0110/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hardik0110/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Hardik0110","id":142720236,"login":"Hardik0110","node_id":"U_kgDOCIG87A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hardik0110/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.c