r_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hardik0110/Microchore-Frontend/commits/f056dc54ed720626f46672bf083d4b20ee94b66d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-28T11:10:08Z","email":"142720236+Hardik0110@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Hardik Kubavat"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-28T11:10:08Z","email":"142720236+Hardik0110@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Hardik Kubavat"},"message":"P1: notification urgency tone, slots-left urgency, animated rating reveal\n\n- HeaderNotifications badge bg switches brand -> warning -> danger based on\n  age of oldest unread (24h, 72h thresholds). At danger the badge gently\n  pulses to draw the eye.\n- Marketplace TaskCard swaps the ''X left'' tag to a danger-toned pulsing\n  ''Only X left'' when remaining <= 3, leaning on goal-gradient urgency.\n- Feedback StarRating now stagger-springs each star in on mount with a\n  small rotate-in, instead of popping fully formed. Filled stars come in\n  first, then the unfilled trail. No hiding behind a click - feedback is\n  utility, animation is just polish.","tree":{"sha":"c683bc71ab907ba61c4ee5a0b0a24e3f2412b82c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hardik0110/Microchore-Frontend/git/trees/c683bc71ab907ba61c4ee5a0b0a24e3f2412b82c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hardik0110/Microchore-Frontend/git/commits/f056dc54ed720626f46672bf083d4b20ee94b66d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/142720236?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hardik0110/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hardik0110/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hardik0110/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hardik0110/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Hardik0110","id":142720236,"login":"Hardik0110","node_id":"U_kgDOCIG87A