aude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohsalsaleem/salmo/commits/9671cb1d0e022277335b8e0a63c064b201580ab2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-26T02:27:17Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-26T02:27:55Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"framework: liveness + watched/unwatched lifecycle symbols\n\nAdds Signal.subtle.watched and Signal.subtle.unwatched as the option\nkeys the proposal uses to hook into a signal going live and going dark.\n\nLiveness is propagated through the graph:\n  - Watcher.watch increments the watched Signal''s liveCount; the bump\n    cascades up through every dep (Computed → its deps → ...).\n  - Watcher.unwatch decrements symmetrically.\n  - Computed recompute computes the dep delta and only fires watched/\n    unwatched for deps that actually appeared or disappeared, so a\n    re-run with an unchanged dep set is silent.\n\nhasSinks and introspectSinks now report only live observers — non-live\ntracking edges (e.g. from a Computed read with no watcher anywhere)\ndon''t count, matching the proposal.\n\nConformance: 62/70 → 67/70.","tree":{"sha":"ce16b8abdd0d71f6f3c334e76543c5da65cec4b2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohsalsaleem/salmo/git/trees/ce16b8abdd0d71f6f3c334e76543c5da65cec4b2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohsalsaleem/salmo/git/commits/9671cb1d0e022277335b8e0a63c064b201580ab2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cla