{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohsalsaleem/salmo/commits/5e4b127b66e49725fc721155a16e3d38b23e7459/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-26T02:21:53Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-26T02:21:53Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"framework: Signal.is{State,Computed} + prohibited-context + equals leak fix\n\n  - Signal.isState / Signal.isComputed predicates.\n  - State/Computed read & set throw inside a Watcher notify callback;\n    user has to schedule a microtask if they want to react.\n  - equals() now runs inside the recomputing computed''s tracking\n    context so signals it reads become its own deps (e.g. an epsilon\n    in a near-equal check), not deps of whoever called us.\n\nUpdated our own watcher test to match the spec-strict prohibition.\nConformance: 58/70 → 62/70.","tree":{"sha":"5173e7238d33ba4833a45240bf8ad15d18a94c6e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohsalsaleem/salmo/git/trees/5173e7238d33ba4833a45240bf8ad15d18a94c6e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohsalsaleem/salmo/git/commits/5e4b127b66e49725fc721155a16e3d38b23e7459","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mohsalsaleem/salmo/commit/5e4b127b66e49725fc721155a16e3d38b23e7459","node_id":"C_kwDOSorhyNoAKDVlNGIxMjdiNjZlNDk3MjVmYzcyMTE1NWExNmUzZDM4YjIzZTc0NTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mohsalsaleem/salmo/commit/a0f3bdd7f6dfc81ccd484e87ede86aef155d33e2","sha":"a0f3bdd7f6dfc81ccd484e87ede86aef155d33e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohsalsaleem/salmo/commits/a0f3bdd7f6dfc81ccd484e87ede86aef155d33e2"}],"sha":"5e4b127b66e49725fc721155a16e3d38b23e7459","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohsalsaleem/salmo/commits/5e4b127b66e49725fc721155a16e3d38b23e7459"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohsalsaleem/salmo/commits/a0f3bdd7f6dfc81ccd484e87ede86aef155d33e2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-26T02:16:35Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-26T02:16:35Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"framework: 3-state lazy validation + custom equality\n\nReworks Computed from \"push DIRTY everywhere on set\" to the\nclean/check/dirty model used by Solid/Vue/Preact/the polyfill:\n\n  - state.set marks direct sub computeds DIRTY and transitive sub\n    computeds CHECK (and notifies watchers once).\n  - On read, a CHECK computed re-validates its deps by version\n    number; only an actual value change promotes it to DIRTY.\n  - On recompute, the computed''s new value is compared to its old\n    via its configured `equals`; only an actual change bumps its\n    own version, so downstream CHECK consumers can short-circuit.\n\nState and Computed both accept `{equals}` in their options bag\n(default Object.is). currentComputed returns undefined (not null)\nto match the proposal.\n\nConformance: 43/70 → 58/70. Closes most of the custom-equality and\nequal-value-bailout suites; remaining failures cluster in cached\nerrors, watched/unwatched lifecycle, and guard predicates.","tree":{"sha":"e52e5543cc5cc19b63ee981748fcd93c8e28d0c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohsalsaleem/salmo/git/trees/e52e5543cc5cc19b63ee981748fcd93c8e28d0c3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohsalsaleem/salmo/git/commits/a0f3bdd7f6dfc81ccd484e87ede86aef155d33e2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,