ic"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohsalsaleem/salmo/commits/1c3abf22c839df6134d3a1777aeb56c2047b3460/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-26T02:10:22Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-26T02:10:22Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"framework: Signal.subtle introspection + untrack + currentComputed\n\nAdds the introspection layer the proposal exposes for framework\nauthors:\n  - Signal.subtle.introspectSources(watcher|computed)\n  - Signal.subtle.introspectSinks(state|computed)\n  - Signal.subtle.hasSinks(state|computed)\n  - Signal.subtle.untrack(fn)\n  - Signal.subtle.currentComputed()\n\nCheap exposures of state we already track internally + two utilities\non the currentObserver. TypeError on wrong-shaped arguments matches\nthe spec.\n\nConformance: 10/39 → 43/70 (the previously-unloadable graph / preact /\nvue ports now register; conformance/src/index.js was added so the\nupstream tests that import the directory rather than wrapper.js resolve\nto the same shim).","tree":{"sha":"fc06c9f8fe58848a35ce4cbdd2ba5181f86f7411","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohsalsaleem/salmo/git/trees/fc06c9f8fe58848a35ce4cbdd2ba5181f86f7411"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohsalsaleem/salmo/git/commits/1c3abf22c839df6134d3a1777aeb56c2047b3460","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mohsalsaleem/salmo/commit/1c3abf22c839df6134d3a1777aeb56c2047b3460","node_id":"C_kwDOSorhyNoAKDFjM2FiZjIyYzgzOWRmNjEzNGQzYTE3NzdhZWI1NmMyMDQ3YjM0NjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mohsalsaleem/salmo/commit/c6b100c57fee501a2a80128d72d72e29e8ef3cfd","sha":"c6b100c57fee501a2a80128d72d72e29e8ef3cfd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohsalsaleem/salmo/commits/c6b100c57fee501a2a80128d72d72e29e8ef3cfd"}],"sha":"1c3abf22c839df6134d3a1777aeb56c2047b3460","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohsalsaleem/salmo/commits/1c3abf22c839df6134d3a1777aeb56c2047b3460"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohsalsaleem/salmo/commits/c6b100c57fee501a2a80128d72d72e29e8ef3cfd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-26T01:58:34Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-26T01:58:34Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"framework: wire up TC39 Signals conformance suite (baseline 10/39)\n\nVendors the test suite from proposal-signals/signal-polyfill (Apache-2.0,\nLICENSE included) under framework/conformance/. A one-line shim\n(conformance/src/wrapper.js) re-exports our Signal under the path those\ntests import, so the upstream suite runs unmodified against ours.\n\n  npm run test:conformance\n\nBaseline: 10/39 tests passing. Three suites (graph, ported/preact,\nported/vue) fail to load entirely because they reference Signal.subtle\nsurface we haven''t built. conformance/README.md catalogues the gap by\ncategory so each can be closed independently.\n\nThis is the honest correctness signal — failures here mean we diverge\nfrom the proposal as encoded by the reference polyfill, not from our\nown opinions about how the framework should behave.","tree":{"sha":"2296a68670584ee74bec7869229ab94efec1ed9a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohsalsaleem/salmo/git/trees/2296a68670584ee74bec7869229ab94efec1ed9a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohsalsaleem/salmo/git/commits/c6b100c57fee501a2a80128d72d72e29e8ef3cfd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mohsalsaleem/salmo/commit/c6b100c57fee501a2a80128d72d72e29e8ef3cfd","node_id":"C_kwDOSorhyNoAKGM2YjEwMGM1N2ZlZTUwMWEyYTgwMTI4ZDcyZDcyZTI5ZThlZjNjZmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mohsalsaleem/salmo/commit/d2c35b55de15bad54565c876329e7e900b161cb3","sha":"d2c35b55de15bad54565c876329e7e900b161cb3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohsalsaleem/salmo/commits/d2c35b55de15bad54565c876329e7e900b161cb3"}],"sha":"c6b100c57fee501a2a80128d72d72e29e8ef3cfd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohsalsaleem/salmo/commits/c6b100c57fee501a2a80128d72d72e29e8ef3cfd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohsalsaleem/salmo/commits/d2c35b55de15bad54565c876329e7e900b161cb3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-26T01:48:44Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-26T01:48:44Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"site: render work grid through the framework + add stack filter\n\nscripts/index.js defines <x-work-board>, a self-hydrating Custom\nElement that reads the canonical card data from the existing static\n<article> markup (still served as the no-JS fallback) and re-renders\nit via the framework''s html`` template. Click a tech chip → only\nmatching cards remain visible (driven by a Signal.State).\n\nframework: defineComponent gains two related behaviours so this\npattern works cleanly —\n  - setup() runs BEFORE the host''s children are cleared, so a\n    component can self-hydrate from its no-JS fallback DOM\n  - if setup() returns a view, the framework replaces children;\n    if it returns null/undefined, it leaves them intact (enhance\n    mode for components that only attach handlers)\nTests cover both modes.","tree":{"sha":"ade33de30cc8fa1277fa2df54dcb7b8365ab6ba3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohsalsaleem/salmo/git/trees/ade33de30cc8fa1277fa2df54dcb7b8365ab6ba3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohsalsaleem/salmo/git/commits/d2c35b55de15bad54565c876329e7e900b161cb3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mohsalsaleem/salmo/commit/d2c35b55de15bad54565c876329e7e900b161cb3","node_id":"C_kwDOSorhyNoAKGQyYzM1YjU1ZGUxNWJhZDU0NTY1Yzg3NjMyOWU3ZTkwMGIxNjFjYjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mohsalsaleem/salmo/commit/aa6abc8014b37292d51c3a90bf3cbf8547ec82c7","sha":"aa6abc8014b37292d51c3a90bf3cbf8547ec82c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohsalsaleem/salmo/commits/aa6abc8014b37292d51c3a90bf3cbf8547ec82c7"}],"sha":"d2c35b55de15bad54565c876329e7e900b161cb3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohsalsaleem/salmo/commits/d2c35b55de15bad54565c876329e7e900b161cb3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohsalsaleem/salmo/commits/aa6abc8014b37292d51c3a90bf3cbf8547ec82c7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-26T01:31:19Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-26T01:31:19Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"framework: TypeScript types via JSDoc + tsc --emitDeclarationOnly\n\nSource stays plain ESM JS — no build step for runtime. JSDoc annotates\nthe public surface (Signal<T>, Computed<T>, effect, html, withScope,\ndefineComponent) so:\n\n- `npm run typecheck` checks the source against strict TS\n- `npm run types` emits .d.ts files into types/ for downstream\n  TypeScript consumers (wired through package.json exports + types)\n- test/types.test-d.ts smoke-tests the consumer API surface","tree":{"sha":"680eedf836375e4d66fee5a9b5919260d02ccc5b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohsalsaleem/salmo/git/trees/680eedf836375e4d66fee5a9b5919260d02ccc5b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohsalsaleem/salmo/git/commits/aa6abc8014b37292d51c3a90bf3cbf8547ec82c7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mohsalsaleem/salmo/commit/aa6abc8014b37292d51c3a90bf3cbf8547ec82c7","node_id":"C_kwDOSorhyNoAKGFhNmFiYzgwMTRiMzcyOTJkNTFjM2E5MGJmM2NiZjg1NDdlYzgyYzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mohsalsaleem/salmo/commit/c009e2d99df0e7314d01a399a170de3bbf8f70bb","sha":"c009e2d99df0e7314d01a399a170de3bbf8f70bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohsalsaleem/salmo/commits/c009e2d99df0e7314d01a399a170de3bbf8f70bb"}],"sha":"aa6abc8014b37292d51c3a90bf3cbf8547ec82c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohsalsaleem/salmo/commits/aa6abc8014b37292d51c3a90bf3cbf8547ec82c7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohsalsaleem/salmo/commits/c009e2d99df0e7314d01a399a170de3bbf8f70bb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-26T01:18:52Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-26T01:18:52Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"framework: defineComponent (Custom Elements) + barrel index\n\ndefineComponent({ tag, setup, shadow? }) wraps `class extends HTMLElement`:\n  - connectedCallback opens an AbortController and a withScope, then\n    appends setup()''s template into the host (or shadowRoot)\n  - disconnectedCallback aborts the controller (tearing down all effects\n    and event listeners) and clears the rendered DOM\n\nThe component IS a real Custom Element — the lifecycle is the platform''s,\ndisposal is the platform''s, and the framework only contributes the\nreactive-scope glue.","tree":{"sha":"d7d356958f53a83fdf31e92913f2fa6f20adc3e7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohsalsaleem/salmo/git/trees/d7d356958f53a83fdf31e92913f2fa6f20adc3e7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohsalsaleem/salmo/git/commits/c009e2d99df0e7314d01a399a170de3bbf8f70bb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mohsalsaleem/salmo/commit/c009e2d99df0e7314d01a399a170de3bbf8f70bb","node_id":"C_kwDOSorhyNoAKGMwMDllMmQ5OWRmMGU3MzE0ZDAxYTM5OWExNzBkZTNiYmY4ZjcwYmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mohsalsaleem/salmo/commit/b02f2d1f9b696bf807d9745827959bd5babc686f","sha":"b02f2d1f9b696bf807d9745827959bd5babc686f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohsalsaleem/salmo/commits/b02f2d1f9b696bf807d9745827959bd5babc686f"}],"sha":"c009e2d99df0e7314d01a399a170de3bbf8f70bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohsalsaleem/salmo/commits/c009e2d99df0e7314d01a399a170de3bbf8f70bb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohsalsaleem/salmo/commits/b02f2d1f9b696bf807d9745827959bd5babc686f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-26T01:17:17Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-26T01:17:17Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"framework: html\\`\\` template + reactive scope\n\n- html\\`\\` tagged template that parses through <template> and binds\n  reactive holes via effect(). Supports primitive/signal/function\n  interpolation, reactive attributes, event handlers, arrays of nodes\n  and DocumentFragments.\n- scope.js: withScope(signal, fn). Effects and event listeners created\n  inside an html template pick up the surrounding AbortSignal so a\n  component disconnect tears down the whole reactive subtree.\n- Two cross-impl workarounds documented inline:\n  - duck-type by nodeType (instanceof DocumentFragment is unreliable\n    when DOM impls use different class identities — e.g. happy-dom)\n  - manual removeEventListener on signal abort (not every DOM impl\n    honours addEventListener({signal}))","tree":{"sha":"23787313abffc5bec2d875bceb2f35dc1d85dc9a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohsalsaleem/salmo/git/trees/23787313abffc5bec2d875bceb2f35dc1d85dc9a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohsalsaleem/salmo/git/commits/b02f2d1f9b696bf807d9745827959bd5babc686f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mohsalsaleem/salmo/commit/b02f2d1f9b696bf807d9745827959bd5babc686f","node_id":"C_kwDOSorhyNoAKGIwMmYyZDFmOWI2OTZiZjgwN2Q5NzQ1ODI3OTU5YmQ1YmFiYzY4NmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mohsalsaleem/salmo/commit/d5913bc0536a8fe90ed8426d606b5cd442286c5a","sha":"d5913bc0536a8fe90ed8426d606b5cd442286c5a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohsalsaleem/salmo/commits/d5913bc0536a8fe90ed8426d606b5cd442286c5a"}],"sha":"b02f2d1f9b696bf807d9745827959bd5babc686f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohsalsaleem/salmo/commits/b02f2d1f9b696bf807d9745827959bd5babc686f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohsalsaleem/salmo/commits/d5913bc0536a8fe90ed8426d606b5cd442286c5a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-26T01:03:45Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-26T01:03:45Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"framework: effect() built on Watcher + Computed\n\nEffects are the framework-level primitive. The proposal intentionally\nleaves them out; instead you compose them from Computed (for dep\ntracking) + Watcher (for invalidation notification) + a scheduler\n(microtask, batching, etc).\n\nTests cover: immediate first run, microtask-deferred re-runs,\nbatching multiple sets in a tick, disposal, and dependency churn\nacross branches.","tree":{"sha":"959fed50139b48565b21d88bcfee7b5ca2490a80","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohsalsaleem/salmo/git/trees/959fed50139b48565b21d88bcfee7b5ca2490a80"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohsalsaleem/salmo/git/commits/d5913bc0536a8fe90ed8426d606b5cd442286c5a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mohsalsaleem/salmo/commit/d5913bc0536a8fe90ed8426d606b5cd442286c5a","node_id":"C_kwDOSorhyNoAKGQ1OTEzYmMwNTM2YThmZTkwZWQ4NDI2ZDYwNmI1Y2Q0NDIyODZjNWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mohsalsaleem/salmo/commit/5dd2df80cd29e85429edff6e1cf82f43847ce57b","sha":"5dd2df80cd29e85429edff6e1cf82f43847ce57b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohsalsaleem/salmo/commits/5dd2df80cd29e85429edff6e1cf82f43847ce57b"}],"sha":"d5913bc0536a8fe90ed8426d606b5cd442286c5a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohsalsaleem/salmo/commits/d5913bc0536a8fe90ed8426d606b5cd442286c5a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohsalsaleem/salmo/commits/5dd2df80cd29e85429edff6e1cf82f43847ce57b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-26T01:03:04Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-26T01:03:04Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"framework: Signal.subtle.Watcher + State.set equality\n\n- Signal.subtle.Watcher: one-shot sync notify, watch/unwatch/getPending,\n  per the TC39 proposal. notify fires in an untracked context.\n- Signal.State.set short-circuits on Object.is-equal values so\n  dependents are not invalidated unnecessarily.\n\nThis is the last primitive we need before effect() — effects are just\na Computed + Watcher with a microtask scheduler on top.","tree":{"sha":"8e79c571588b4e2bb87a50ffef902ad788ee355f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohsalsaleem/salmo/git/trees/8e79c571588b4e2bb87a50ffef902ad788ee355f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohsalsaleem/salmo/git/commits/5dd2df80cd29e85429edff6e1cf82f43847ce57b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.co