":{"date":"2026-05-26T00:43:23Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-26T00:43:23Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Fix signals sketch: filter list updates correctly\n\ntoNodes checked instanceof Node before instanceof DocumentFragment,\nbut DocumentFragment extends Node — so fragments matched the wrong\nbranch and were stored whole. Once inserted, fragments empty out,\nso subsequent removeChild calls threw and the list silently froze\n(while sibling reactive bindings like the count kept working).\n\nCheck DocumentFragment first so we unwrap to its children.","tree":{"sha":"ddb35e542ee9fcb34c50addc6440a003e62b5702","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohsalsaleem/salmo/git/trees/ddb35e542ee9fcb34c50addc6440a003e62b5702"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohsalsaleem/salmo/git/commits/573389d9cdc56d6bf266f093183302eeb286c235","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mohsalsaleem/salmo/commi