inzzz@kevinzzzdeMacBook-Pro.local","name":"kevinzzz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-27T09:36:03Z","email":"kevinzzz@kevinzzzdeMacBook-Pro.local","name":"kevinzzz"},"message":"feat: Go control-plane strangler fig migration — PR-A through PR-F\n\nPR-A Shadow Proxy: shadow dispatch, header sanitizer, 12 tests\nPR-B Parity Harness: captureResponseWriter, parity bridge, 10 tests\nPR-C Evidence Bundle Gate: JSONL writer, gate report, sensitive redaction, 12 tests\nPR-D Header Canary: canary decision, strip headers, 17 tests\nPR-E Percentage Canary: fnv-based deterministic bucketing, 16 tests\nPR-F Cutover Readiness: phase aggregates, evaluator, 22 tests\n\nConcurrency hardening: circuit breaker, rate limit, upstream pool, 14 tests\nTotal: 160 PASS (gatewayhttp 115, transport 14, tests 31), go vet clean","tree":{"sha":"c721dda150f78b6775aab3e0ad82d168a1b1cf14","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opencampuslife/open-campus/git/trees/c721dda150f78b6775aab3e0ad82d168a1b1cf14"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opencampuslife/open-campus/git/commits/9dea55c2284d5f07553a251d3092c9be47186dd5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/opencampuslife/open-campus/commit/9dea55c2284d5f07553a251d3092c9be47186dd5","node_id":"C_kwDOSose9NoAKDlkZWE1NWMyMjg0ZDVmMDc1NTNhMjUxZDMwOTJjOWJlNDcxODZkZDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/opencampuslife/open-campus/commit/766fe44e12f7dbf35e86a1f29065a4abbf769aac","sha":"766fe44e12f7dbf35e86a1f29065a4abbf769aac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opencampuslife/open-campus/commits/766fe44e12f7dbf35e86a1f29065a4abbf769aac"}],"sha":"9dea55c2284d5f07553a251d3092c9be47186dd5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opencampuslife/open-campus/commits/9dea55c2284d5f07553a251d3092c9be47186dd5"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opencampuslife/open-campus/commits/766fe44e12f7dbf35e86a1f29065a4abbf769aac/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-27T07:42:59Z","email":"kevinzzz@kevinzzzdeMacBook-Pro.local","name":"kevinzzz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-27T07:42:59Z","email":"kevinzzz@kevinzzzdeMacBook-Pro.local","name":"kevinzzz"},"message":"feat: Go gateway concurrency hardening, YAML config fix, code health tooling\n\nP0 concurrency hardening (control-plane):\n- transport/upstream_pool.go: connection pool with max conns, max in-flight,\n  idle timeout, health check, graceful close\n- gatewayhttp/circuit_breaker.go: 3-state circuit breaker (closed/open/half-open)\n- gatewayhttp/ratelimit.go: token bucket rate limiter middleware, global+per-route\n- router.go: integrate UpstreamPool, CircuitBreaker, RateLimiter\n- config.go: add upstream-max-conns, upstream-max-in-flight, rate-limit-rps,\n  circuit-failure-threshold, circuit-cooldown-sec flags\n\nYAML config fix:\n- Convert cutover_policy.yaml, observability_contract.yaml from JSON to YAML\n- Add regression check in validate.py for JSON-formatted YAML files\n- Update load_json_yaml in check_cutover_readiness.py and check_route_contract.py\n\nCode health tooling (tools/):\n- check_package_boundary.py: enforce no sys.path mutations in services/*/src\n- check_gateway_freeze.py: prevent new Python gateway route branches\n- check_ci_policy.py: production JSON, DB URL safety, provider isolation checks\n\nDocumentation:\n- code-health-review-2026-05-27.md\n- service-test-matrix.md\n- paper.docx + paper.html + generate_paper.py\n- Updated AGENTS.md with health hardening checks\n- Updated Makefile with health, release-check, gateway freeze targets\n\nContracts:\n- gateway_freeze_allowlist.json\n- package_boundary_allowlist.json (frozen pre-migration sys.path debt)\n- python_control_plane_allowlist.json\n\ngitignore: add docs/codegraph.html (exceeds GitHub 100MB limit)","tree":{"sha":"f71f983837b6f469ccf0e77b872e128f511192cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opencampuslife/open-campus/git/trees/f71f983837b6f469ccf0e77b872e128f511192cb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opencampuslife/open-campus/git/commits/766fe44e12f7dbf35e86a1f29065a4abbf769aac","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/opencampuslife/open-campus/commit/766fe44e12f7dbf35e86a1f29065a4abbf769aac","node_id":"C_kwDOSose9NoAKDc2NmZlNDRlMTJmN2RiZjM1ZTg2YTFmMjkwNjVhNGFiYmY3NjlhYWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/opencampuslife/open-campus/commit/8bba8ddf4499a3cde887dd370a1426c01b0d6fbb","sha":"8bba8ddf4499a3cde887dd370a1426c01b0d6fbb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opencampuslife/open-campus/commits/8bba8ddf4499a3cde887dd370a1426c01b0d6fbb"}],"sha":"766fe44e12f7dbf35e86a1f29065a4abbf769aac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opencampuslife/open-campus/commits/766fe44e12f7dbf35e86a1f29065a4abbf769aac"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opencampuslife/open-campus/commits/8bba8ddf4499a3cde887dd370a1426c01b0d6fbb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-26T20:44:13Z","email":"kevinzzz@kevinzzzdeMacBook-Pro.local","name":"kevinzzz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-26T20:44:13Z","email":"kevinzzz@kevinzzzdeMacBook-Pro.local","name":"kevinzzz"},"message":"docs: rewrite README with Go control-plane migration context","tree":{"sha":"9c7f1c89e359c9b95a9281c39ad8ec1100480102","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opencampuslife/open-campus/git/trees/9c7f1c89e359c9b95a9281c39ad8ec1100480102"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opencampuslife/open-campus/git/commits/8bba8ddf4499a3cde887dd370a1426c01b0d6fbb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/opencampuslife/open-campus/commit/8bba8ddf4499a3cde887dd370a1426c01b0d6fbb","node_id":"C_kwDOSose9NoAKDhiYmE4ZGRmNDQ5OWEzY2RlODg3ZGQzNzBhMTQyNmMwMWIwZDZmYmI","parents":[{"h