product domain, logo, and slug lookup\n\n* fix(projects): trim a pasted product URL to its hostname\n\n* refactor(projects): consolidate logo validation, harden slug filter, fix batch meta\n\n- Fold logo URL checks into assertProjectShape so create and update share one gate\n- Enforce per-slug max length (100) in the slugs filter and align the\n  slugs string cap (10,100) with 100 slugs x 100 chars\n- Return hasMore: false for slug batches since there is no cursor to\n  continue with\n- Align the UI logo URL error message with the server messages\n- Render project/proposal logos only after an http(s) URL check\n- Restore the 30s visibility test timeout\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Elliot Braem <elliot@ejlbraem.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqx6j4CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAp6gQAB6uqo0zelVf/n6N+LtDcBFY\nbuGdj3td00pCUKiIxq8vPNbU++XF2QBE8nNAmiXSu6GqBCi0s0hoTfwPVhBVqhsW\ngzpwPj4ayqZOJgqd8JU4veWy1MsYjoE70GMz2YhiaDF7/tSKCB3WB5QOmsQGMeWk\nTlTykyktkm3+4cDUM5cvJcaJZn+SG3QtsmuwqJj2hsP5qJ9oKoX/gHBziHmF9WIK\n8SblHEFWhyXfZv0mFXaPuSJJgZgqj6CBiUw5u/W0JC4B7VdS2XrppEvSrglUpoH0\n+WZVQhHNxhDTVh7jAPGvzZ4F+AtrukGuTjtVMOPk6NEzTyvL5wLl7FGKCO/uLn3W\nbxwkaOyeF7bVoEkbtnS7uroYACvH9rBeQGb3uGQNDdaOymuOx90UwGY7PIKEatzt\nOA0jay1+euP/Ydhb8mUzKYRK2a/mA+x1llt9TQ/5EeMdPcsNZ1AUSNg2tf1mNtoY\n4XAyUkZMmb4AjDnqhoYT02wEDY2KofK9nrI5jXsnDfWEb8280GhvRF/tLbbxO1nB\n3TKVmHYnGWLtTdd7DCmPbdfagm2VZYFdruvbWFWH29NSa+dGaOg5em35alI3GxQ0\nwt4SHV3lWxKrqvS00H7wfxKAeFfEVbSkkEjbqfk9zMM5Kjkc92GrvVAVODeVRYsq\nLZVzRslLhRGPqnpfwnS0\n=i+HL\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-08T14:30:17Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gr