rs/ayushsingh82/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayushsingh82/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayushsingh82/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayushsingh82/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ayushsingh82","id":121667116,"login":"ayushsingh82","node_id":"U_kgDOB0B-LA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayushsingh82/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayushsingh82/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayushsingh82/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayushsingh82/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayushsingh82/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayushsingh82","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/nearbuilders.org/commits/25d10d5df84123dc7bffc885802965cdae577760/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T11:57:06Z","email":"121667116+ayushsingh82@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ayush Singh"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T11:57:06Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Enforce shadcn/no-arbitrary-values across UI (#252)\n\n* fix(ui): replace arbitrary font-size values with theme scale tokens\n\nAdds text-2xs (11px), text-3xs (10px), text-4xs (8px), and text-13\n(13px) theme tokens for compact UI text (badges, timestamps, secondary\nlabels) that recur across the app but sit below Tailwind''s default\ntext-xs step, then swaps every arbitrary text-[Npx] bracket value onto\nthe matching token. Purely a class-name substitution — every token\nvalue equals the exact pixel value it replaces, so rendered output is\nunchanged.\n\nPart of #244.\n\n* fix(ui): replace arbitrary letter-spacing and line-height values with theme tokens\n\nAdds tracking-6, tracking-12, tracking-18 (letter-spacing steps beyond\nTailwind''s built-in tracking-wider/tracking-widest, used repeatedly on\nuppercase eyebrow labels) and leading-tighter (1.1, for large display\nheadings) theme tokens, then swaps the arbitrary tracking-[...] and\nleading-[...] bracket values onto them. Token values match the\nreplaced values exactly.\n\nPart of #244.\n\n* fix(ui): replace arbitrary layout values with scale utilities and shared min-h utilities\n\nExtracts the min-h-[calc(100dvh-4rem)] / min-h-[calc(100dvh-48px)]\npattern (repeated verbatim across route pages) into min-h-page and\nmin-h-page-compact theme utilities, and swaps arbitrary min-h/min-w/\nmax-w/max-h/w/h/top/left pixel values onto Tailwind''s dynamic spacing\nscale (n * 4px), which reproduces the exact original pixel values.\nGrid-template-column splits and a handful of viewport-relative or\nRadix-runtime-driven values that have no scale equivalent are kept as\nnarrow, documented exceptions.\n\nPart of #244.\n\n* fix(ui): replace arbitrary radii, rings, borders, shadow, and blur values with scale tokens\n\nAdds a radius-2xs (4px) theme token for the one recurring off-scale\nradius, and swaps arbitrary rounded-[Npx] values onto it or onto the\ntheme''s existing radius-sm (8px) / radius-md (12px) steps where they\nalready match exactly. shadcn/ui''s standard 3px focus ring, decorative\nthick borders/rings, and a handful of radii and shadows that sit\ndeliberately between scale steps (e.g. 10px between rounded-sm and\nrounded-md) are kept as narrow, documented exceptions rather than\nforced onto a mismatched value.\n\nPart of #244.\n\n* fix(ui): replace arbitrary transition and duration values with theme scale\n\nAdds a duration-120 theme token for a hover/tap micro-interaction\ntiming repeated across four components, preserving the exact original\n120ms value rather than approximating it with a stock scale step.\nAn SVG-specific stroke-dashoffset transition and a shorthand\ntransition/ring combination that Tailwind''s named transition\nutilities don''t cover are kept as narrow, documented exceptions.\n\nPart of #244.\n\n* fix(ui): document narrow exceptions for arbitrary CSS properties\n\nTap-highlight suppression, cross-browser scrollbar hiding, and a\nCSS-mask-based recolorable logo each rely on CSS properties with no\nTailwind utility at all. No values change here — each is annotated\nwith a documented, narrowly scoped lint exception explaining why it\ncan''t be expressed on the scale.\n\nPart of #244.\n\n* chore(ui): enable shadcn/no-arbitrary-values lint rule\n\nAll 306 original findings across 65 files are resolved (306/306),\neither converted to theme scale tokens/utilities or left as one of 74\nnarrow, documented exceptions. Flips shadcn/no-arbitrary-values from\nunset to error for real.\n\nbun run --cwd ui lint and the root bun run lint both pass clean.\n\nCloses #244.","tree":{"sha":"93bcbccfe2eef66b5e0ba8ffaa80abb5d3f1f6a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/nearbuilders.org/git/trees/93bcbccfe2eef66b5e0ba8ffaa80abb5d3f1f6a9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/nearbuilders.org/git/commits/25d10d5df84123dc7bffc885802965cdae577760","verification":{"payload":"tree 93bcbccfe2eef66b5e0ba8ffaa80abb5d3f1f6a9\nparent f8b466671edc45ace883b6948c7999783e156b9b\nauthor Ayush Singh <121667116+ayushsingh82@users.noreply.github.com> 1790251026 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790251026 +0500\n\nEnforce shadcn/no-arbitrary-values across UI (#252)\n\n* fix(ui): replace arbitrary font-size values with theme scale tokens\n\nAdds text-2xs (11px), text-3xs (10px), text-4xs (8px), and text-13\n(13px) theme tokens for compact UI text (badges, timestamps, secondary\nlabels) that recur across the app but sit below Tailwind''s default\ntext-xs step, then swaps every arbitrary text-[Npx] bracket value onto\nthe matching token. Purely a class-name substitution — every token\nvalue equals the exact pixel value it replaces, so rendered output is\nunchanged.\n\nPart of #244.\n\n* fix(ui): replace arbitrary letter-spacing and line-height values with theme tokens\n\nAdds tracking-6, tracking-12, tracking-18 (letter-spacing steps beyond\nTailwind''s built-in tracking-wider/tracking-widest, used repeatedly on\nuppercase eyebrow labels) and leading-tighter (1.1, for large display\nheadings) theme tokens, then swaps the arbitrary tracking-[...] and\nleading-[...] bracket values onto them. Token values match the\nreplaced values exactly.\n\nPart of #244.\n\n* fix(ui): replace arbitrary layout values with scale utilities and shared min-h utilities\n\nExtracts the min-h-[calc(100dvh-4rem)] / min-h-[calc(100dvh-48px)]\npattern (repeated verbatim across route pages) into min-h-page and\nmin-h-page-compact theme utilities, and swaps arbitrary min-h/min-w/\nmax-w/max-h/w/h/top/left pixel values onto Tailwind''s dynamic spacing\nscale (n * 4px), which reproduces the exact original pixel values.\nGrid-template-column splits and a handful of viewport-relative or\nRadix-runtime-driven values that have no scale equivalent are kept as\nnarrow, documented exceptions.\n\nPart of #244.\n\n* fix(ui): replace arbitrary radii, rings, borders, shadow, and blur values with scale tokens\n\nAdds a radius-2xs (4px) theme token for the one recurring off-scale\nradius, and swaps arbitrary rounded-[Npx] values onto it or onto the\ntheme''s existing radius-sm (8px) / radius-md (12px) steps where they\nalready match exactly. shadcn/ui''s standard 3px focus ring, decorative\nthick borders/rings, and a handful of radii and shadows that sit\ndeliberately between scale steps (e.g. 10px between rounded-sm and\nrounded-md) are kept as narrow, documented exceptions rather than\nforced onto a mismatched value.\n\nPart of #244.\n\n* fix(ui): replace arbitrary transition and duration values with theme scale\n\nAdds a duration-120 theme token for a hover/tap micro-interaction\ntiming repeated across four components, preserving the exact original\n120ms value rather than approximating it with a stock scale step.\nAn SVG-specific stroke-dashoffset transition and a shorthand\ntransition/ring combination that Tailwind''s named transition\nutilities don''t cover are kept as narrow, documented exceptions.\n\nPart of #244.\n\n* fix(ui): document narrow exceptions for arbitrary CSS properties\n\nTap-highlight suppression, cross-browser scrollbar hiding, and a\nCSS-mask-based recolorable logo each rely on CSS properties with no\nTailwind utility at all. No values change here — each is annotated\nwith a documented, narrowly scoped lint exception explaining why it\ncan''t be expressed on the scale.\n\nPart of #244.\n\n* chore(ui): enable shadcn/no-arbitrary-values lint rule\n\nAll 306 original findings across 65 files are resolved (306/306),\neither converted to theme scale tokens/utilities or left as one of 74\nnarrow, documented exceptions. Flips shadcn/no-arbitrary-values from\nunset to error for real.\n\nbun run --cwd ui lint and the root bun run lint both pass clean.\n\nCloses #244.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqtRASCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA728QAETSLmmITFF4hx0OQ8ZjGnRI\n48ONUFMWpBBFzdNGNQLJFQ4wATaDMfpK/IR89k3S6XeHBEk8o9HAAScKtbUMZh4p\nZBbhs+wkNQENdjDND6UrwsHNw2vKgahxWX+sdjDFNGr+QvAdM54/ytdpgNePSFYf\nb61pdC/VRGEWaXEwe+wtByIX5d8Z/sNyeOnagr18IaApPKGbww5/DziYwYXBBWZV\nTJvr2qFVU9+dS9pHEne6Aji62dOdpwExogWXAXtn48k9HQVRXU0yhzyiV25QzAAV\naC2DrCNI2/E4b+bm9VMbulL/g2qzbXAIbK/E7ZpuuaAcRE2V2Nk3LKzh6wbyAzEO\nC8fH2/+++MBJZ9nm7FOTbwNGAzFGkyMMk2R3LwDxChxVrX5FMZB9wUUxh6K4Xzu/\no5L68Ex+Nt1aK1GRV1PWV+jIbQH8cGHOvUWlR/Hqid7tOYr4OgC/eaR9TafvLeKm\nmJfqqttjJ16wHLY+5DBdN0oDnVIcWLAbuNGsAXgXloNp+qFFKD8x7u3WoNz8pXY8\nSmt5Oj9QmEOh5iY2pTiajAotKqSIhFYaXCcOwQMkUCgY1Hhrir8TPUsnBBpAZwjA\nxSSX40AXdAzfhE3r/9ErxAtXe7bG8kPLB1sxOIMYQlCddEsU0vSThbHxBvPIlBvD\nQVOq31He6vuP6ndtm1HW\n=8/mb\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-24T11:57:06Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"htt