titch-format brand tokens from the stylesheet so agents can paste a DESIGN.md from /brand.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix(ui): resolve brand asset URLs without window.open\n\nTanStack location.href is path-only, so new URL(path, location.href) crashed the layout. Open brand via Link and resolve assets against the real origin.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"338ed401df60f2116379935ad7d913a429b47906","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/nearbuilders.org/git/trees/338ed401df60f2116379935ad7d913a429b47906"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/nearbuilders.org/git/commits/ef4be2a04d2c0550f9d45465663a8d0f8115fcee","verification":{"payload":"tree 338ed401df60f2116379935ad7d913a429b47906\nparent 49ca52ae545dc31e0a00d5903990dd4a375e717e\nauthor Misbah Ansari <150408924+MisbahAnsar@users.noreply.github.com> 1790115629 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790115629 -0500\n\nFeat/brand page (#242)\n\n* feat(ui): add a brand page and logo context menu\n\nPublish the site logo, icons, colors, and type from the existing assets, and let a right-click on the logo open, copy, or download them.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix(ui): open brand page from logo context menu\n\nElliot feedback: the first menu action should open /brand and read Open brand in new tab.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* feat(ui): add Copy to DESIGN.md on the brand page\n\nExport Stitch-format brand tokens from the stylesheet so agents can paste a DESIGN.md from /brand.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix(ui): resolve brand asset URLs without window.open\n\nTanStack location.href is path-only, so new URL(path, location.href) crashed the layout. Open brand via Link and resolve assets against the real origin.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-auth