","node_id":"C_kwDOSoxJW9oAKGVmNGJlMmEwNGQyYzA1NTBmOWQ0NTQ2NTY2M2E4ZDBmODExNWZjZWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/NEARBuilders/nearbuilders.org/commit/49ca52ae545dc31e0a00d5903990dd4a375e717e","sha":"49ca52ae545dc31e0a00d5903990dd4a375e717e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/nearbuilders.org/commits/49ca52ae545dc31e0a00d5903990dd4a375e717e"}],"sha":"ef4be2a04d2c0550f9d45465663a8d0f8115fcee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/nearbuilders.org/commits/ef4be2a04d2c0550f9d45465663a8d0f8115fcee"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121667116?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayushsingh82/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayushsingh82/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayushsingh82/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayushsingh82/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ayushsingh82","id":121667116,"login":"ayushsingh82","node_id":"U_kgDOB0B-LA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayushsingh82/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayushsingh82/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayushsingh82/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayushsingh82/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayushsingh82/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayushsingh82","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/nearbuilders.org/commits/49ca52ae545dc31e0a00d5903990dd4a375e717e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T18:30:51Z","email":"121667116+ayushsingh82@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ayush Singh"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T18:30:51Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: keep project-creator validation in sync with the selected kind (#241)\n\n* fix: keep project-creator validation in sync with the selected kind\n\nThe Create button''s validation trusted the form''s own `kind` field\ninstead of the route''s kind. Clicking between format buttons\n(Project/Idea/Scope/Result) fired handleChange before navigation\ncompleted, which wrote the new kind''s values into the previous kind''s\nlocalStorage draft. Restoring that draft later left the form''s kind\nout of sync with the page being rendered, so the button stayed\ndisabled and named a field that wasn''t even on screen.\n\n- Validate against the route''s kind, not the form''s, so the message\n  can''t name a field from a different kind than what''s rendered.\n- Drop the redundant onClick handleChange on the create-mode kind\n  switcher; the route change already remounts and reinitializes the\n  form with the correct kind.\n\n* fix: project creator\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Zeeshan Ahmad <itexpert120@outlook.com>","tree":{"sha":"a6171b9f562fa69ad81edb4086dae6d803802b00","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/nearbuilders.org/git/trees/a6171b9f562fa69ad81edb4086dae6d803802b00"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/nearbuilders.org/git/commits/49ca52ae545dc31e0a00d5903990dd4a375e717e","verification":{"payload":"tree a6171b9f562fa69ad81edb4086dae6d803802b00\nparent c10a608b37cfdba555b0e324d380453da86e3267\nauthor Ayush Singh <121667116+ayushsingh82@users.noreply.github.com> 1790101851 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790101851 +0500\n\nfix: keep project-creator validation in sync with the selected kind (#241)\n\n* fix: keep project-creator validation in sync with the selected kind\n\nThe Create button''s validation trusted the form''s own `kind` field\ninstead of the route''s kind. Clicking between format buttons\n(Project/Idea/Scope/Result) fired handleChange before navigation\ncompleted, which wrote the new kind''s values into the previous kind''s\nlocalStorage draft. Restoring that draft later left the form''s kind\nout of sync with the page being rendered, so the button stayed\ndisabled and named a field that wasn''t even on screen.\n\n- Validate against the route''s kind, not the form''s, so the message\n  can''t name a field from a different kind than what''s rendered.\n- Drop the redundant onClick handleChange on the create-mode kind\n  switcher; the route change already remounts and reinitializes the\n  form with the correct kind.\n\n* fix: project creator\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Zeeshan Ahmad <itexpert120@outlook.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqsslbCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAZfoQAFhEZQFUpwV244NcO+utTW+S\neio0uj4IFAgNORRrvgW7e9OhsbwvwFYdUB3prPVOvSXkS2QZziOkd8V9k0jkaaXh\nzYcxe96L6iKZICUZ4g37307FALEzsYcYxI/HPZexdLVNlY8fWSzG3++dD+anqD1y\nTWa6lpHK3pHwrAbzKcQz5feEOPwFYg6xo5rFtQDxNa7M4oRGoIckSxJKoQtSEs8T\nqYWBybzewOc+yz9zIJ04zxOo9p7p7bezXpOdl85LUkeLWZlBCz/6GxW8dkb0iYhj\n5hP6BBkYAD+RUSfFfJ2B2k9JsFhluxjpRxw3flKJH4HUsINerleopjD3J/EsEAnB\nz9CrBcmL4MQMg1ZC2j4pnJ0EXelLhNW/gJFYAEInC2mTZdXlpWggiXvgrDW76d/A\niNW//+92SaAQvrzXuDQt+sjmiW0/pc5cCPKpeoxvTkDSPxSRIDcloVNQSPq5QETk\nCEIdtE6fODCp345FDkfCrvAVXOaOE1OsUOe5VQp6EnTkBFy7VmjjkZREdT/Y0RlL\nKfXn+gBkE/0nRlZ/crb6JYwndRlfBcFtxKOydT0AmtWIORooW0UhKE4xuABid4mi\nOQPmxgj2R378rL54cMFRyUBXa2LSMBhtTbY5HEVhGPdp6cLF+jyqe/6m22HfZ75u\nykmprC90AAq6CULCO+lk\n=I0QF\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-22T18:30:52Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://a