bcbfcd6ec40431819889"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/190800512?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lokmali/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lokmali/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lokmali/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lokmali/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Lokmali","id":190800512,"login":"Lokmali","node_id":"U_kgDOC19igA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lokmali/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lokmali/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lokmali/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lokmali/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lokmali/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lokmali","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/nearbuilders.org/commits/ae20e3097573edb32e60d284c286e64a0c9ad551/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T17:39:48Z","email":"malilokesh000@gmail.com","name":"Lokesh"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T17:39:48Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: align Nostr identity and binding with active NEAR wallet (#227)\n\n* feat: load nostr plugin remotely from nostr.nearbuilders.org (#223)\n\nSupersedes #162. Drops the local nostr-bindings/nostr-comments plugins and\nthe host-API proxy layer in favor of the canonical remote plugin\n(bos://nearbuilding.near/nostr.nearbuilders.org).\n\n- bos.config.json: plugin-level extends for nostr (vars defaulted upstream)\n- ui: NostrFeed (project-page comments) and NostrLink (settings identity\n  section) now call the namespaced plugin client directly\n  (apiClient.nostr.listComments/createComment/getBinding/createChallenge/\n  verifyBinding/prepareBindingWrite/listRelays)\n- ui: ported canonical client-side nostr lib (keys/relay/bind/types);\n  all Nostr signing stays in-browser, binding KV write goes through the\n  user''s HOT wallet\n- adds nostr-tools for client-side signing\n\nRelates to #134\n\n* fix: match canonical client signer exactly (local-key only, kind 1)\n\nCanonical ui/src/lib/nostr is local-key only with zero NIP-07 code; the\nplugin publishes kind 1111 itself on rebuild. Drop the speculative\nextension-signing layer and match tag order 1:1.\n\n* fix: override clientName variable + restore extension signer option\n\n- bos.config.json: variables.clientName = ''nearbuilders.org'' so the\n  plugin''s #t filter matches the app''s client tag (issue #223 optional\n  override; without it feed reads would come back empty)\n- restore NIP-07 extension signer per #162/#223 scope: detectNostrExtension,\n  connectExtensionAndStore (pubkey-only persistence), Signer union used by\n  both comment and binding signers\n\n* fix: align Nostr identity with connected NEAR account (#225)\n\n* fix: submit Nostr binding with active SIWN wallet\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Jean-Philippe Martel <jean@Jean-Philippes-Mac-mini-2.local>","tree":{"sha":"27b2010abe54780d3069d4949f308bbfbae59f41","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/nearbuilders.org/git/trees/27b2010abe54780d3069d4949f308bbfbae59f41"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/nearbuilders.org/git/commits/ae20e3097573edb32e60d284c286e64a0c9ad551","verification":{"payload":"tree 27b2010abe54780d3069d4949f308bbfbae59f41\nparent 233bf301c07e6c942a21b3aee32b8cfd881c1f5c\nauthor Lokesh <malilokesh000@gmail.com> 1789493988 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789493988 -0500\n\nfix: align Nostr identity and binding with active NEAR wallet (#227)\n\n* feat: load nostr plugin remotely from nostr.nearbuilders.org (#223)\n\nSupersedes #162. Drops the local nostr-bindings/nostr-comments plugins and\nthe host-API proxy layer in favor of the canonical remote plugin\n(bos://nearbuilding.near/nostr.nearbuilders.org).\n\n- bos.config.json: plugin-level extends for nostr (vars defaulted upstream)\n- ui: NostrFeed (project-page comments) and NostrLink (settings identity\n  section) now call the namespaced plugin client directly\n  (apiClient.nostr.listComments/createComment/getBinding/createChallenge/\n  verifyBinding/prepareBindingWrite/listRelays)\n- ui: ported canonical client-side nostr lib (keys/relay/bind/types);\n  all Nostr signing stays in-browser, binding KV write goes through the\n  user''s HOT wallet\n- adds nostr-tools for client-side signing\n\nRelates to #134\n\n* fix: match canonical client signer exactly (local-key only, kind 1)\n\nCanonical ui/src/lib/nostr is local-key only with zero NIP-07 code; the\nplugin publishes kind 1111 itself on rebuild. Drop the speculative\nextension-signing layer and match tag order 1:1.\n\n* fix: override clientName variable + restore extension signer option\n\n- bos.config.json: variables.clientName = ''nearbuilders.org'' so the\n  plugin''s #t filter matches the app''s client tag (issue #223 optional\n  override; without it feed reads would come back empty)\n- restore NIP-07 extension signer per #162/#223 scope: detectNostrExtension,\n  connectExtensionAndStore (pubkey-only persistence), Signer union used by\n  both comment and binding signers\n\n* fix: align Nostr identity with connected NEAR account (#225)\n\n* fix: submit Nostr binding with active SIWN wallet\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Jean-Philippe Martel <jean@Jean-Philippes-Mac-mini-2.local>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqqYLkCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAUEQQADxIv6WT0Ikh7jo8tPlNrru8\n1b5WvNmD+jq+SJXNsTATQYumtFB27hjsKw+1SXA0HG9l4GlOY1RcVuweTuQL4jQk\nbtshAAyb88AwLG80lNeYd2h0jEMVnUq37//l0WUIJaRo7QJRAfWP2ZeA3HGNBxqu\n7HRMc3naiuiLVpBpb4V6hCC4kVuTQFJqHtFNVBMyYvUeEcLSsosuQ6WAVBQiKJmQ\nttg85ECaa+owDOsFH2L7G0NX0oiE4RAaWX/Vi24f4Pk/8lI3JLcrsL89KedJMWDt\n15TnpBHBu9ByCZ0yvzC4O+kdU4z6wSQ8ysRy3Za84nNKAzhghk9VAeXlo51tj4iT\n9W+C