min":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayushsingh82/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayushsingh82/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayushsingh82","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/nearbuilders.org/commits/371c904ea79ecb8ebac4f6f1639c01aad5713a7f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T21:38:35Z","email":"121667116+ayushsingh82@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ayush Singh"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T21:38:35Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: let builders withdraw a pending nomination or an approved profile (#218)\n\nCloses #186. Two self-service paths so someone can back out of the\nbuilders directory without an admin.\n\nWithdraw a pending nomination:\n- new POST /v1/proposals/{pluginId}/{entityId}/withdraw (auth, not admin)\n- only while the proposal is still pending, and only for the creator or\n  the account the nomination is for\n- marks the proposal removed and writes a \"withdrawn\" audit entry;\n  idempotent. Rides the existing proposal lifecycle — modelled on reject.\n- UI: \"Withdraw nomination\" + confirm dialog on the pending-profile view,\n  shown only to the owner/creator\n\nWithdraw an approved profile:\n- new withdrawn_at column on builders + POST /v1/builders/me/withdraw and\n  /restore (owner only)\n- while withdrawn: excluded from GET /v1/builders (directory + global\n  search) and GET /v1/builders/{account} 404s for everyone but the owner\n  and admins\n- nothing is deleted; the owner can list it again anytime. Permanent\n  delete stays the existing admin-only DELETE /v1/builders/{account}.\n- UI: \"Withdraw your profile\" section on the edit page + an owner banner\n  on the profile page\n\nNo admin screen, per maintainer feedback on the issue.","tree":{"sha":"7595ced50c702665c1f6f6a35bb62179e0203fba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/nearbuilders.org/git/trees/7595ced50c702665c1f6f6a35bb62179e0203fba"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/nearbuilders.org/git/commits/371c904ea79ecb8ebac4f6f1639c01aad5713a7f","verification":{"payload":"tree 7595ced50c702665c1f6f6a35bb62179e0203fba\nparent 1a45b320b2d1a2bf2b676f9aee13338240532f0d\nauthor Ayush Singh <121667116+ayushsingh82@users.noreply.github.com> 1788471515 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788471515 -0500\n\nfeat: let builders withdraw a pending nomination or an approved profile (#218)\n\nCloses #186. Two self-service paths so someone can back out of the\nbuilders directory without an admin.\n\nWithdraw a pending nomination:\n- new POST /v1/proposals/{pluginId}/{entityId}/withdraw (auth, not admin)\n- only while the proposal is still pending, and only for the creator or\n  the account the nomination is for\n- marks the proposal removed and writes a \"withdrawn\" audit entry;\n  idempotent. Rides the existing proposal lifecycle — modelled on reject.\n- UI: \"Withdraw nomination\" + confirm dialog on the pending-profile view,\n  shown only to the owner/creator\n\nWithdraw an approved profile:\n- new withdrawn_at column on builders + POST /v1/builders/me/withdraw and\n  /restore (owner only)\n- while withdrawn: excluded from GET /v1/builders (directory + global\n  search) and GET /v1/builders/{account} 404s for everyone but the owner\n  and admins\n- nothing is deleted; the owner can list it again anytime. Permanent\n  delete stays the existing admin-only DELETE /v1/builders/{account}.\n- UI: \"Withdraw your profile\" section on the edit page + an owner banner\n  on the profile page\n\nNo admin screen, per maintainer feedback on the issue.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqmejbCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAruYQACfax2IEzBpEJGTqnDQon8nw\nZPhbBfJoM7hd7973J3KTJc84572NAzli7zyVXVXfYYM2P0CqO2NMAGE1bdv2kL0B\nndDyQp32jT38KLEPGY9FP9Mu8JLo2EDD7jwRbmcafVCZorwRIpEcXT691dtRxDc2\nY+HpU3BbDWsfb4NIs4oXGp52