_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayushsingh82/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayushsingh82/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayushsingh82","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/nearbuilders.org/commits/7a34cb5421f10b62223223138ea794edfcd8ed74/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-30T22:50:33Z","email":"121667116+ayushsingh82@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ayush Singh"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-30T22:50:33Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: global search command palette in the header (#216)\n\nAdds a ⌘K / Ctrl-K command palette, also opened by a search control\nnext to the logo on desktop and a search icon in the mobile header,\nthat searches across Builders, Projects, and Events from one place\ninstead of guessing which page to open first.\n\n- Builders and Projects use their existing search/query endpoints;\n  Events are filtered client-side since the events plugin has no\n  text-search endpoint yet (mirrors how /events already works).\n- Results are grouped by type, fully keyboard-navigable (arrows /\n  Enter / Esc), and open the relevant detail page on select.\n- Client-only: no API or plugin changes. Built on the existing Radix\n  dialog, no new dependency.\n\nActivity is intentionally left out of this first pass: it has no\ntext-search endpoint and no per-item detail route to open. Raised as\nan open question on the issue.\n\nPart of #179","tree":{"sha":"4b13ebac4358fac9ba3b3750db19b9790a3ea95d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/nearbuilders.org/git/trees/4b13ebac4358fac9ba3b3750db19b9790a3ea95d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/nearbuilders.org/git/commits/7a34cb5421f10b62223223138ea794edfcd8ed74","verification":{"payload":"tree 4b13ebac4358fac9ba3b3750db19b9790a3ea95d\nparent 5fb06740296da782da62ada3dc9cd7c14753ceec\nauthor Ayush Singh <121667116+ayushsingh82@users.noreply.github.com> 1788130233 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788130233 +0500\n\nfeat: global search command palette in the header (#216)\n\nAdds a ⌘K / Ctrl-K command palette, also opened by a search control\nnext to the logo on desktop and a search icon in the mobile header,\nthat searches across Builders, Projects, and Events from one place\ninstead of guessing which page to open first.\n\n- Builders and Projects use their existing search/query endpoints;\n  Events are filtered client-side since the events plugin has no\n  text-search endpoint yet (mirrors how /events already works).\n- Results are grouped by type, fully keyboard-navigable (arrows /\n  Enter / Esc), and open the relevant detail page on select.\n- Client-only: no API or plugin changes. Built on the existing Radix\n  dialog, no new dependency.\n\nActivity is intentionally left out of this first pass: it has no\ntext-search endpoint and no per-item detail route to open. Raised as\nan open question on the issue.\n\nPart of #179","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqlLO5CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAABpEQAKRFtDPJo+/swSKC4Xj8ROC0\nBwCjVJKw/myKqDjv58iTV74UscZTnTesTrMi07iIHZFMrbyOVO85ocR7oCAV38xe\nRX8EkGWXT8MEIFDlxYpGpIKME61r54+irYP3qHuZdvEfpaEPCd6QKzn0KU5IxxV4\n7svcpJP6x37MTP1LyBJb9P2Rj9QtRQezh9P75nyr4gMR43ErCqyrkn+ysO1C8szL\nM/nysm9c+QudTp4z4wKIQirehEK/owhadwYBNMgUUTvUcjIeNYPcHj/nz7xgzsDb\nrAtmPO9SZqXW4xkbC/JZDl9A4nGA/K6I3rq3UmWhPoYmOL0OuJJvkwHi2JDx0W1O\n3IE39s/OJ+LVHTseT51QEZPsorBRM+1H1Vzqxh57alknj+c6yGNnc2dMA7CaiRAf\nWjmilnQirUE0KGWW9amTQRpaIgHuNPZ1F7asHj0KQ3gIKBzO//lyykJ/BXQCiTvc\nz+Nmu3tHnPqHUswkCg4Jll00drYAGxoU6jlqt//4+WE4L02bpCZXIWSGAFkvBOnG\nAbF0/Wnnk5CPAQPRTW47882yj+dsvGae96XJVuED/tkuYeWtUofkPRyF4SJ3hxkS\nkAaE3u5nenuhZC4qVARyOedhfrEhpqOy57QlXMewPy1iP/RwGOTmvKcOtAJsGkXq\nlZFxVcpjJG1100gR5NDD\n=kjrb\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-30T22:50:34Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubu