login":"ayushsingh82","node_id":"U_kgDOB0B-LA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayushsingh82/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayushsingh82/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayushsingh82/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayushsingh82/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayushsingh82/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayushsingh82","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/nearbuilders.org/commits/5fb06740296da782da62ada3dc9cd7c14753ceec/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-30T22:50:09Z","email":"121667116+ayushsingh82@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ayush Singh"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-30T22:50:09Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: add quick actions and social layer to project and event cards (#210)\n\n* feat: add quick actions and social layer to project and event cards\n\n- Bookmark (localStorage) and Share (copy link) icon buttons on project\n  directory rows, hover-revealed, executing without opening the detail panel\n- Bookmark and Add-to-Calendar (.ics download) on event cards, plus an\n  attendee-avatar stack replacing the plain participant count\n- Interactive vs informational card treatment was already correct across\n  dashboard, project lists, and event lists — no changes needed there\n- Project card owner/collaborator avatars intentionally skipped per\n  @itexpert120: no collaborator data exists yet (blocked on #146)\n\nFixes #197\n\n* feat: move bookmarks from localStorage to a real API\n\nAdds a bookmarks plugin (modeled on the existing votes plugin) with a\nPostgres-backed bookmarks table, wired through the API gateway behind\nrequireAuth. ui/src/lib/bookmarks.ts now calls the API instead of\nlocalStorage; bookmark buttons are disabled for anonymous sessions,\nmatching the existing vote-button convention.\n\n* chore: update bun.lock for bookmarks plugin workspace\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Elliot Braem <elliot@ejlbraem.com>\nCo-authored-by: Zeeshan Ahmad <itexpert120@outlook.com>","tree":{"sha":"1aaf02b5af2f2fd3b9b8bc0f34ef434e15d5c08d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/nearbuilders.org/git/trees/1aaf02b5af2f2fd3b9b8bc0f34ef434e15d5c08d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/nearbuilders.org/git/commits/5fb06740296da782da62ada3dc9cd7c14753ceec","verification":{"payload":"tree 1aaf02b5af2f2fd3b9b8bc0f34ef434e15d5c08d\nparent 2cbce40b5a3f40b1ba81198d9e74f44758e3470e\nauthor Ayush Singh <121667116+ayushsingh82@users.noreply.github.com> 1788130209 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788130209 +0500\n\nfeat: add quick actions and social layer to project and event cards (#210)\n\n* feat: add quick actions and social layer to project and event cards\n\n- Bookmark (localStorage) and Share (copy link) icon buttons on project\n  directory rows, hover-revealed, executing without opening the detail panel\n- Bookmark and Add-to-Calendar (.ics download) on event cards, plus an\n  attendee-avatar stack replacing the plain participant count\n- Interactive vs informational card treatment was already correct across\n  dashboard, project lists, and event lists — no changes needed there\n- Project card owner/collaborator avatars intentionally skipped per\n  @itexpert120: no collaborator data exists yet (blocked on #146)\n\nFixes #197\n\n* feat: move bookmarks from localStorage to a real API\n\nAdds a bookmarks plugin (modeled on the existing votes plugin) with a\nPostgres-backed bookmarks table, wired through the API gateway behind\nrequireAuth. ui/src/lib/bookmarks.ts now calls the API instead of\nlocalStorage; bookmark buttons are disabled for anonymous sessions,\nmatching the existing vote-button convention.\n\n* chore: update bun.lock for bookmarks plugin workspace\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Elliot Braem <elliot@ejlbraem.com>\nCo-authored-by: Zeeshan Ahmad <itexpert120@outlook.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqlLOhCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAczwQAIdPIErz5/jr8Y3uxhAjkmmv\nZRP2Lg6BkbyfU9WbadRabnKOZ9Cfdz92eShQJXT26kUZmqLOTMdwmuWt1/1fvFgn\nLXE21T3kZE1wEQHSKCJSZK7SE1/L9zIpp14mbLprs27ESxE0MkHtYPeVovym28Fg\nM828G0sR7FANUPCQwG2rxRGKTHGSWbJqIStAeSH8/bEUGM1eh1OfgWKIt/5zQly4\nuhYTrmwSiHylxgY8dQjFwzXjFSymNH1rB7LaeuAc+BFVLKKljDYPUatukhXKbz5C\nNHkMLVWMZIgDFwOKrIOUixKZN25MOR4TmJTnimSoUpWuQZIsGXWcB3+hCaG5bdG3\nhgXeSVftpcrda+QJHGaeOrFUjUEtqRIDR200LFSmpgHpZC1MeKolE8gFCWImhQ9d\n8DO6gRtIqwfaav0aLYaZNcUY5SQPI+I3jKTW5VC4Wu7/IaOWny0bdvVLyIleJ49G\njUrW2VMWf8WDF2/8CsrHTA7TNmF+8uGcBLA6nfFyH3ZtdsfE8eaNdt7pr2NQkDuM\nrHOGH0CMZo5owFG8vPSGbKTYtHnyvex2y6Zc5pHvVjxdwHv94ex4EzcMvWnzJTdO\nD/eh2pMKXe83U5C9Aj5ttc/SSutOOAFtHCxsc7bsvp9UiHsg6DJWX1FUAX5EYOw7\n3iUVQyQ49MVz62JHwaEF\n=LCio\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-30T22:50:09Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/NEARBuilders/nearbuilders.org/commit/5fb06740296da782da62ada3dc9cd7c14753ceec","node_id":"C_kwDOSoxJW9oAKDVmYjA2NzQwMjk2ZGE3ODJkYTYyYWRhM2RjOWNkN2MxNDc1M2NlZWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/NEARBuilders/nearbuilders.org/commit/2cbce40b5a3f40b1ba81198d9e74f44758e3470e","sha":"2cbce40b5a3f40b1ba81198d9e74f44758e3470e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/nearbuilders.org/commits/2cbce40b5a3f40b1ba81198d9e74f44758e3470e"}],"sha":"5fb06740296da782da62ada3dc9cd7c14753ceec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/nearbuilders.org/commits/5fb06740296da782da62ada3dc9cd7c14753ceec"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121667116?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayushsingh82/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayushsingh82/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayushsingh82/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayushsingh82/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ayushsingh82","id":121667116,"login":"ayushsingh82","node_id":"U_kgDOB0B-LA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayushsingh82/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayushsingh82/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayushsingh82/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayushsingh82/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayushsingh82/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayushsingh82","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/nearbuilders.org/commits/2cbce40b5a3f40b1ba81198d9e74f44758e3470e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-26T19:10:03Z","email":"121667116+ayushsingh82@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ayush Singh"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-26T19:10:03Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: avoid throwing builder existence check during proposal approval (#214)\n\ngetBuilder() throws NOT_FOUND for a pending nomination that isn''t a\nbuilder yet, and every-plugin logs a console.error box for any thrown\nORPCError at the plugin boundary regardless of whether the caller\ncatches it. Approving a new builder nomination was tripping that path\non every single approval, producing the noisy \"Builder not found\"\nserver logs reported in #95.\n\nSwap the existence check to listBuilders (which never throws) so a\nnew nomination never exercises the throwing path at all.","tree":{"sha":"c9250e9f85fd2279cf860df458a030e099ab22b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/nearbuilders.org/git/trees/c9250e9f85fd2279cf860df458a030e099ab22b3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/nearbuilders.org/git/commits/2cbce40b5a3f40b1ba81198d9e74f44758e3470e","verification":{"payload":"tree c9250e9f85fd2279cf860df458a030e099ab22b3\nparent 3485674ed727025e96a718a6b296d10be2b1b5a2\nauthor Ayush Singh <121667116+ayushsingh82@users.noreply.github.com> 1787771403 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787771403 +0500\n\nfix: avoid throwing builder existence check during proposal approval (#214)\n\ngetBuilder() throws NOT_FOUND for a pending nomination that isn''t a\nbuilder yet, and every-plugin logs a console.error box for any thrown\nORPCError at the plugin boundary regardless of whether the caller\ncatches it. Approving a new builder nomination was tripping that path\non every single approval, producing the noisy \"Builder not found\"\nserver logs reported in #95.\n\nSwap the existence check to listBuilders (which never throws) so a\nnew nomination never exercises the throwing path at all.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqjzoLCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAew8QAKTOKbqrlQaPn59B/NRRfhwR\nObNGqjucOB1g22iuMVhL397DJvEf0FImFOkOUune740iaekClHbTrJMAgPgDYk6d\nTFjX/MhwD0OoJYnN09DgAlqEkWqp3deim3asz4pKULse75f0hnJMaOMNoBitrgPU\nYFJMTUMWk6OsQebvA5fAMjqF4pC6msLbmfvBaWv4/OetqUcBBZZ5xvHUVUaDZqMv\