:"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/NEARBuilders/nearbuilders.org/commit/3485674ed727025e96a718a6b296d10be2b1b5a2","node_id":"C_kwDOSoxJW9oAKDM0ODU2NzRlZDcyNzAyNWU5NmE3MThhNmIyOTZkMTBiZTJiMWI1YTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/NEARBuilders/nearbuilders.org/commit/6bc912e43315586eb061e5880e35acc0ed33fe2e","sha":"6bc912e43315586eb061e5880e35acc0ed33fe2e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/nearbuilders.org/commits/6bc912e43315586eb061e5880e35acc0ed33fe2e"}],"sha":"3485674ed727025e96a718a6b296d10be2b1b5a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/nearbuilders.org/commits/3485674ed727025e96a718a6b296d10be2b1b5a2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16282460?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/elliotBraem","id":16282460,"login":"elliotBraem","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjgyNDYw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/nearbuilders.org/commits/6bc912e43315586eb061e5880e35acc0ed33fe2e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-21T17:55:32Z","email":"elliot@ejlbraem.com","name":"Elliot Braem"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-21T17:55:32Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(ci): commit auth-export types to fix CI typecheck failure (#212)\n\n* fix(ci): commit auth-export types to fix CI typecheck failure\n\nbos types gen fetches contract.d.ts from the remote auth plugin but\nfails to create auth-export.d.ts — the remote manifest doesn''t\nadvertise additionalExports. In CI (fresh checkout) the file doesn''t\nexist, so auth-types.gen.ts imports a missing module and tsc fails\nwith TS2307. Locally it passes because a prior bos dev/sync created\nthe file on disk.\n\nFix: commit .bos/generated/auth/auth-export.d.ts (stable type\ndeclarations). Also fix .gitignore to use .bos/* instead of .bos so\nthe existing sync-snapshot.json and infra-state.json exceptions\nactually work (git cannot re-include files when the parent dir is\nexcluded).\n\n* update","tree":{"sha":"80c668d186b8c26fbc7fe6710b05412e94edc120","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/nearbuilders.org/git/trees/80c668d186b8c26fbc7fe6710b05412e94edc120"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/nearbuilders.org/git/commits/6bc912e43315586eb061e5880e35acc0ed33fe2e","verification":{"payload":"tree 80c668d186b8c26fbc7fe6710b05412e94edc120\nparent 529fd7416f39c6ac050143a465cbc9d6a1965890\nauthor Elliot Braem <elliot@ejlbraem.com> 1787334932 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787334932 -0500\n\nfix(ci): commit auth-export types to fix CI typecheck failure (#212)\n\n* fix(ci): commit auth-export types to fix CI typecheck failure\n\nbos types gen fetches contract.d.ts from the remote auth plugin but\nfails to create auth-export.d.ts — the remote manifest doesn''t\nadvertise additionalExports. In CI (fresh checkout) the file doesn''t\nexist, so auth-types.gen.ts imports a missing module and tsc fails\nwith TS2307. Locally it passes because a prior bos dev/sync created\nthe file on disk.\n\nFix: commit .bos/generated/auth/auth-export.d.ts (stable type\ndeclarations). Also fix .gitignore to use .bos/* instead of .bos so\nthe existing sync-snapshot.json and infra-state.json exceptions\nactually work (git cannot re-include files when the parent dir is\nexcluded).\n\n* update","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqiJEUCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAApEQQAFb7sOupUrL83T4nfDnBoerK\n76pbSGo90QttPFTXSadHj0+eNlu/HHL2JhLNuGVw6b3cPPvFeevgG/T0D076NYmo\nt+E/i5MvwWDRk5xEmI8funPRy1kM4bx/NykDinVIOeRKMq2w3eywElKZhG+9VhsV\nKUKEdfbtdiIaExRivxzsN/yrlzg12KPNcmUitZ07qWlEb7IaaZ/TUEl64gTXY8ju\nPG5CUwbLTAz5YRGse8L+t76ZjauX1TbQZlp/mCKqHuHWCXSblkzgztS/5WoKqEZW\nxuIF5Yzv8Ksa4csrMrXY9QtyHPhECHkDFfJIQWwTQd+VGfoclJQDBYqFiSHkQwAx\nfgTX6ItNmehbOj1CvPZ1W1MRZG1bn+7Tm3nn2GoxKSX0t2oTdancwetf4AjL4lT4\nYUOmWZ4D8CYTEiXmCGMUutlnSP7qjnfUtSCL4Aagz1FzZJmZWvAWbOsBqAFXPnH4\nMEt2u9M4GN2xo81A9+GodmmC5b7quCUtRyg2EbtpqRRU9kXGoZ9hU//3N9o4CeB3\nfz+K/iURs0jLHBNq/1Dn8vEC+bDwYgYVvzkLxDMdZly5qWzyey0qb1z3TYInDIJk\nZ2Xaqvp0TGZ92JD+i/0ODByDKg84rvwykjc9Hbitg22A41vk1cHBw8WHCMdW7Mf8\nj6jQhCXjxiQpc7tIMWP+\n=ULgK\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-21T17:55:33Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/NEARBuild