hness now uses whichever is more recent: the project record''s\n  last edit, or the linked repo''s last GitHub commit (fetched via the\n  public GitHub commits API), scoped to single-project views only to\n  avoid hitting GitHub''s unauthenticated rate limit across a card list.\n- Adds a \"Recent commits\" timeline section to the project detail page.\n\nPartial progress on #147: edit-history and feedback-round tracking\ndon''t exist anywhere in the current data model, so the timeline is\ncommits-only for now (see issue comment for details).\n\n* fix: drop commits timeline, keep only the relative last-updated fix\n\nPer itexpert120: no need for update history, just a recent last\nupdated is enough. Removes the \"Recent commits\" section and its\nnow-unused query/import; the relative-time \"Updated\" label and the\nGitHub-commit freshness fallback stay.","tree":{"sha":"7f37c7cf2e23314cf9267206b58d161dd7dd89c5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/nearbuilders.org/git/trees/7f37c7cf2e23314cf9267206b58d161dd7dd89c5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/nearbuilders.org/git/commits/0efb76f3bd8e92c56730510b8885945bdde6e04b","verification":{"payload":"tree 7f37c7cf2e23314cf9267206b58d161dd7dd89c5\nparent 91381b05f8c0fec89947d82992c92e124ef09dd3\nauthor Ayush Singh <121667116+ayushsingh82@users.noreply.github.com> 1787159791 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787159791 +0500\n\nfix: show relative last-updated time on project cards (#208)\n\n* feat: show relative last-updated time and commit timeline on project cards\n\n- Project cards now show \"Updated {relative time} ago\" (previously\n  shown nowhere on the card).\n- Freshness now uses whichever is more recent: the project record''s\n  last edit, or the linked repo''s last GitHub commit (fetched via the\n  public GitHub commits API), scoped to single-project views only to\n  avoid hitting GitHub''s unauthenticated rate limit across a card list.\n- Adds a \"Recent commits\" timeline section to the project detail page.\n\nPartial progress on #147: edit-history and feedback-round tracking\ndon''t exist anywhere in the current data model, so the timeline is\ncommits-only for now (see issue comment for details).\n\n* fix: drop commits timeline, keep only the relative last-updated fix\n\nPer itexpert120: no need for update history, just a recent last\nupdated is enough. Removes the \"Recent commits\" section and its\nnow-unused query/import; the relative-time \"Updated\" label and the\nGitHub-commit freshness fallback stay.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqheTvCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAADvEQAKhgbEvpoMrWw6hYFfFVmxeY\n+gFm7X0+JdFGyloEvJJSy07ogLN8TO8YHFZd1VuDwKp9Jmdl4ClBczIg4BYchKpM\nNtwB4BDQKkUM+qBzeNEYolaZYcpX4hLn/I3AiQ3lzrzG9H/M2F36lBdb7JDort9X\nPqKTOj9NHITVYVGW36mYYF2XrqQ6uLyKJTKt0dOUiWf0e8F/akdLYviAKv3MaS3u\n4Wn08Izq7HEAym0QO2HKyOHlAlyozkoMfXZpop10R1NCo9bwH8o0rEmoJnhbykfL\nwV3gtp4w709k21fsdKgyxv1B+dDrtphahb9/+oZhu4FUGisnGn+sEQ79CfAqSinw\nCtEmWg49YOyvE984azrwq/zt3B0KJ8xLUnTTBoYszlhNRdNPPccYUT7JsjZ9jgRa\nGgj5Mu/IAAxqGtRvC3qvhupihpi5JCgBUi45KWDdwY+DLIk5OauGcBQ2hNIxVXVF\neOWGrLBI0jM/RgWvDjbwR63B0tya4QNRbBWmp4BzoytdA6j4A9Q9VYNjaFxh4g0F\nGswbVRLItZ7yDRXGc5KkrE7Bn+ln56LSupdGR115QEMJBaOVwx3sa4JLz1IKTAxc\nhYNFaBn60fgZiBabFAH5T9Wg3M+fend67Z/Qi/35Q5WXpYhMLqgQfX4lsr/H2YLw\nDA9y/mvEbK6pIXHUAHI3\n=Thqg\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-19T17:16:32Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs