nt hero headline from clipping at small widths (#192)\n\nleading-none set the H1 line-height to 1, which left no room for\nascenders/descenders across the three stacked headline lines,\nmaking the text look visually cut off. Use a small positive\nline-height and text-wrap: balance so the headline wraps and\nrenders cleanly at all common viewport widths.\n\nFixes #182","tree":{"sha":"d0ad0230da9ce06bfe6743e5949f2af156675dc1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/nearbuilders.org/git/trees/d0ad0230da9ce06bfe6743e5949f2af156675dc1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/nearbuilders.org/git/commits/866d2db4981dcc558e8dc7c7c77864464724d620","verification":{"payload":"tree d0ad0230da9ce06bfe6743e5949f2af156675dc1\nparent 8606f320f9a6379cef33bf40de3ce011669f268f\nauthor Ayush Singh <121667116+ayushsingh82@users.noreply.github.com> 1786569941 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786569941 +0500\n\nfix: prevent hero headline from clipping at small widths (#192)\n\nleading-none set the H1 line-height to 1, which left no room for\nascenders/descenders across the three stacked headline lines,\nmaking the text look visually cut off. Use a small positive\nline-height and text-wrap: balance so the headline wraps and\nrenders cleanly at all common viewport widths.\n\nFixes #182","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqfOTVCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAJvIQAKPlvdyM5Xzni/w+QAlo+JYZ\njPVktJDpvmOc2JkOr0RTyYtZL/EVKgCJkXXmBZZOAwWPYG20R+/PrDWzlZkn/jJs\nGYnJOFYp3bJvJiWvPYudTB4COIYrAbF7ET6N1LaZC9JZMsf+WusWCItRwOshRncz\nO1cZslLQOiqubmfwv4bVfu1dNWLjvA5+59OM53fl1TDfrk4EmQwWbI+t6J5PHUgL\ngZCyCJVBCMd1tboSJuxep/ZMqMXA3jOACSo9jJ5x0j6aalwkHfLIPKFG91+gfOkv\n5ved4FjzxZuWF63giMAm1kpcbmDEbBd43GTxfbPBu8XgxalDOF9D7sEpXSAIOAQ7\nR7fRcDPAth2RKpiqB5mPTgQKXwjYXmztE1nPN5yf8l5sHDdOR6AtwoCG/6iBBMMZ\n4y4+4sI1Ksl+YD72z425KMJrAmcNh/9YsSLvLuQCmYii+kYo6wH0kpDOEpzX6g5B\nIwpVt/3Z80TaJ7OvPC9xlfs8vNW647bYvaNfTlOxIViFPHL56opaJBw1byy+Nrg1\nCKHmGmGdV2QYSoSv5Zx4jO314sF