ml_url":"https://github.com/ayushsingh82","id":121667116,"login":"ayushsingh82","node_id":"U_kgDOB0B-LA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayushsingh82/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayushsingh82/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayushsingh82/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayushsingh82/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayushsingh82/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayushsingh82","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/nearbuilders.org/commits/380b52daf80130ae82e6dd09e2ad88e245ee2444/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-10T17:46:31Z","email":"121667116+ayushsingh82@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ayush Singh"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-10T17:46:31Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(ui): stop pending-review states from reading as approved (#158)\n\n\"Pending review\" states used brand-cyan, which resolves to the exact\nsame hex value as brand-green (#00d9a3) in both light and dark theme.\nTesters misread the pending state as already-approved because of it.\n\nAffected: the dashboard''s builder-status badge and \"Waiting for\nreview\" notice, and the \"Your profile is under review\" screen shown\nright after submitting a builder application (which also swapped its\nCircleCheck icon for Clock3, since a checkmark reads as done/approved\nregardless of color).\n\nNow uses brand-cobalt, the only genuinely distinct brand color\ndeclared for this purpose.\n\nCloses #141","tree":{"sha":"a40354155689d4aeb7e0437059f7fe56626df243","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/nearbuilders.org/git/trees/a40354155689d4aeb7e0437059f7fe56626df243"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/nearbuilders.org/git/commits/380b52daf80130ae82e6dd09e2ad88e245ee2444","verification":{"payload":"tree a4035