//api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/nearbuilders.org/commits/2c798ae173b66dfde2319494baf01a48e2b721d2"}],"sha":"3f3996bbb42564a91cc2a63ca598cd1e50bac111","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/nearbuilders.org/commits/3f3996bbb42564a91cc2a63ca598cd1e50bac111"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/134085495?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Skytonet2/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Skytonet2/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Skytonet2/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Skytonet2/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Skytonet2","id":134085495,"login":"Skytonet2","node_id":"U_kgDOB_37dw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Skytonet2/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Skytonet2/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Skytonet2/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Skytonet2/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Skytonet2/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Skytonet2","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/nearbuilders.org/commits/2c798ae173b66dfde2319494baf01a48e2b721d2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-03T16:06:39Z","email":"134085495+Skytonet2@users.noreply.github.com","name":"SKYTONET"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-03T16:06:39Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"format long JSX line in near-profile (#100)\n\nCI on the merge of #99 failed because the break-all class pushed the\n<p className=\"...\"> line past biome''s 100-char lineWidth. Split the\nelement onto three lines to match the formatter''s expected output.\n\nNothing behavioural changes; this only unblocks Deploy so the mobile\nhorizontal-scroll fix from #99 can ship.","tree":{"sha":"9c426dd1f5f291eb3c58aa3b3e0400eaf612d541","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/nearbuilders.org/git/trees/9c426dd1f5f291eb3c58aa3b3e0400eaf612d541"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/nearbuilders.org/git/commits/2c798ae173b66dfde2319494baf01a48e2b721d2","verification":{"payload":"tree 9c426dd1f5f291eb3c58aa3b3e0400eaf612d541\nparent beaf5c6ea7afe14804ca1044bf43cb49b72238b3\nauthor SKYTONET <134085495+Skytonet2@users.noreply.github.com> 1785773199 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785773199 -0500\n\nformat long JSX line in near-profile (#100)\n\nCI on the merge of #99 failed because the break-all class pushed the\n<p className=\"...\"> line past biome''s 100-char lineWidth. Split the\nelement onto three lines to match the formatter''s expected output.\n\nNothing behavioural changes; this only unblocks Deploy so the mobile\nhorizontal-scroll fix from #99 can ship.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqcLyPCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAL8gQABsI6hg9LVbloX23lV53vbhR\n5sVMGaGje/KqqHgh1nCueoqnaVYh0kHm0DZyhQnoi31UB7GX7laS7Pc/7lGx0QUm\n0mfEgK4eDGTBt8J3mUifgH7lFsVNMxUPhgVAMV6xuac3prGQ/Jq23wVWHnnZitYU\nsDglLfVLtU3h6Xi0rgZs8yiIA4KdU2vgAd4Kse+VySIL4ZWPimddZYv4q1AmyEFB\nF837PXlKsr91pAxsmA7r6EWJ3P2MntY+w/kBp+yqHV+wguVpeU3D79WDPn77Y9N4\nMu+xcpBQHTVEI5zsktgFgKV5/7ChOtb6ovH5rTMWA4LxB4XFHLUkVLDPwstiA2VJ\nGKvqzm1INelD4ADb8JCnLfB3n9gDcJ0VVGXEGHGkP7bXz3n1SQ32UiCPusgdso+H\ng893ZSj5Q7FDcAmdwjSiMspEUc8a5jZaNPewfbHeX5E+u0F4yVSMp0yFVmO7/rUi\nfwLPikDmqEraWmJCWInIOvN3vewo2mP7dRaGcrsJrJMi9rohxdJpb5ecotSy6hcN\nacbXOkm99g5HUlkHb+AW5XxrID+9GsDy4Dd80VMTEkzl6pAVPNyn18uRMLzRjfPr\nrX/3pLeyy2iLa4ehvsleQjGiJhDgkwNRcXnnj+ijT54p1T6sBRj0zmyZ0P52Q9lX\ns4Gbds90EPhTuRL5Wln0\n=G0yT\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-03T16:20:03Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/NEARBuilders/nearbuilders.org/commit/2c798ae173b66dfde2319494baf01a48e2b721d2","node_id":"C_kwDOSoxJW9oAKDJjNzk4YWUxNzNiNjZkZmRlMjMxOTQ5NGJhZjAxYTQ4ZTJiNzIxZDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/NEARBuilders/nearbuilders.org/commit/beaf5c6ea7afe14804ca1044bf43cb49b72238b3","sha":"beaf5c6ea7afe14804ca1044bf43cb49b72238b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/nearbuilders.org/commits/beaf5c6ea7afe14804ca1044bf43cb49b72238b3"}],"sha":"2c798ae173b66dfde2319494baf01a48e2b721d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/nearbuilders.org/commits/2c798ae173b66dfde2319494baf01a48e2b721d2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/134085495?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Skytonet2/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Skytonet2/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Skytonet2/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Skytonet2/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Skytonet2","id":134085495,"login":"Skytonet2","node_id":"U_kgDOB_37dw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Skytonet2/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Skytonet2/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Skytonet2/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Skytonet2/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Skytonet2/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Skytonet2","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/nearbuilders.org/commits/beaf5c6ea7afe14804ca1044bf43cb49b72238b3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-31T05:10:22Z","email":"134085495+Skytonet2@users.noreply.github.com","name":"SKYTONET"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-31T05:10:22Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Fix mobile horizontal scroll on dashboard (#93) (#99)\n\n* fix mobile horizontal scroll on dashboard (#93)\n\nUnbreakable NEAR account IDs (especially 64-char implicit accounts)\nrendered in font-mono elements without word-break controls were forcing\ntheir containing cards wider than the viewport, producing page-level\nhorizontal scroll on mobile.\n\n- add break-all on the two accountId mono displays in BuilderProfileCard\n- add break-all on the @accountId label in NearProfile card variant\n- add overflow-x-clip on the root layout as a defensive safety net so\n  any future accidental overflow in a route cannot leak to page scroll\n  (clip, not hidden, to preserve the sticky header)\n\n* add min-w-0 to dashboard grid children (real root cause of #93)\n\nVerified on the live authenticated dashboard: horizontal scroll came\nfrom truncated project descriptions inside grid items with default\nmin-width: auto. `truncate` sets white-space: nowrap, so the item''s\nmin-content resolves to the full unwrapped text width (~2200 px on a\n375 px viewport). The grid track expands to fit, blowing the page\nhorizontally.\n\nFix: min-w-0 on the four grid children so they can shrink below their\ncontent min-content width and truncate can actually take effect.\nMeasured before/after on the live page:\n  docScrollWidth: 2371 -> 375, horizontalScroll: true -> false\n\nThe earlier commit''s `break-all` on account-id mono spans stays — it''s\nstill needed for long/implicit accounts (truncate isn''t applied\nthere). The overflow-x-clip safety net on the layout also stays.","tree":{"sha":"131c20738f8bd98c1ae3b64e710944cc7d1732eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/nearbuilders.org/git/trees/131c20738f8bd98c1ae3b64e710944cc7d1732eb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/nearbuilders.org/git/commits/beaf5c6ea7afe14804ca1044bf43cb49b72238b3","verification":{"payload":"tree 131c20738f8bd98c1ae3b64e710944cc7d1732eb\nparent a855a2b3f7c4aeaab9f0967edeb2a3d5cc56c681\nauthor SKYTONET <134085495+Skytonet2@users.noreply.github.com> 1785474622 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785474622 -0500\n\nFix mobile horizontal scroll on dashboard (#93) (#99)\n\n* fix mobile horizontal scroll on dashboard (#93)\n\nUnbreakable NEAR account IDs (especially 64-char implicit accounts)\nrendered in font-mono elements without word-break controls were forcing\ntheir containing cards wider than the viewport, producing page-level\nhorizontal scroll on mobile.\n\n- add break-all on the two accountId mono displays in BuilderProfileCard\n- add break-all on the @accountId label in NearProfile card variant\n- add overflow-x-clip on the root layout as a defensive safety net so\n  any future accidental overflow in a route cannot leak to page scroll\n  (clip, not hidden, to preserve the sticky header)\n\n* add min-w-0 to dashboard grid children (real root cause of #93)\n\nVerified on the live authenticated dashboard: horizontal scroll came\nfrom truncated project descriptions inside grid items with default\nmin-width: auto. `truncate` sets white-space: nowrap, so the item''s\nmin-content resolves to the full unwrapped text width (~2200 px on a\n375 px viewport). The grid track expands to fit, blowing the page\nhorizontally.\n\nFix: min-w-0 on the four grid children so they can shrink below their\ncontent min-content width and truncate can actually take effect.\nMeasured before/after on the live page:\n  docScrollWidth: 2371 -> 375, horizontalScroll: true -> false\n\nThe earlier commit''s `break-all` on account-id mono spans stays — it''s\nstill needed for long/implicit accounts (truncate isn''t applied\nthere). The overflow-x-clip safety net on the layout also stays.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqbC4+CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAPZUQAD36bR+Cxl+wGuJDmUvem8ou\nJcwu43o/VuOeYhTiKCFT5TsAyq8Cv4fA3X2MNnS3yltoaARnoRCud5SfJ56up/gj\n2RgQiEGl4clbv/ne98asNcOcLsI/xEIilWUUwup/XEt/OBVYWwkbCUzlcdeMAkmh\nlQtYBGsX7UF6QP9llVUAc3mN54mxsbcgbcWhVoE/P78g8EHG99IVB6KXx9wTMq+/\nSTwCyt4R7NSvoDKpijSSDxAOQ09YhA2A77IpWCik6fMQBKCVmE82LOSeOwogFKnE\npGcwUOpwWEoDz0ZC6rmla/2Z2+SvK0TPb/PhwxITVYhqzcNOxaBVRsU7UHThMjH9\nSwVEXxVeVToBCEC9fj87HrzKsR0TwptsoU/r0Udae9ZM+Sx1JDDAUyx7Dt3T4ZEE\nCoUrpirAsIbMyuBWueUR1tA0vcZqDt17u6gifF016qHXIptx2DbCrPgFgaUI/znT\nFqIIYu8hKO1JCwbSbwYNwOYPUl6b5Rp6toqpujrdXesYRHTMyYVoYY/TVdiDR8Dl\n30+bPO656j5o8Ueqvcm+jCutid6OnCKP3FGCWYQ0LzbZMZlM3fIR0bkQM6+3yGkj\nLSh2CRIu0+TO9IdQL2cZKYXyIg0gwHCQEIJiIGe8dlz1mmFwp3N13l0rycD9nd6k\nlbSBu5RP5GQEABEyUpE+\n=KTUM\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-31T05:10:23Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.c