hahini/xdata-web-modernized/git/trees/8ab4d4a48bfe8022c76cd6e08c2fffe019d2fa4d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/git/commits/85ff50f9d5404e96b7650ff641780039907e9990","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commit/85ff50f9d5404e96b7650ff641780039907e9990","node_id":"C_kwDOSo2_sdoAKDg1ZmY1MGY5ZDU0MDRlOTZiNzY1MGZmNjQxNzgwMDM5OTA3ZTk5OTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commit/423d6456c53bc4f9ff39bf909263ecfa3bdbe505","sha":"423d6456c53bc4f9ff39bf909263ecfa3bdbe505","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/423d6456c53bc4f9ff39bf909263ecfa3bdbe505"}],"sha":"85ff50f9d5404e96b7650ff641780039907e9990","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/85ff50f9d5404e96b7650ff641780039907e9990"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/423d6456c53bc4f9ff39bf909263ecfa3bdbe505/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-30T13:40:12Z","email":"home@imac.com","name":"HomeIMAC"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-30T13:40:12Z","email":"home@imac.com","name":"HomeIMAC"},"message":"fix+docs: quiet dormant SMT fallback; expand handbook with verified datagen\n\n- DatasetGenerationService: the SMT-equivalence rung is intentionally dormant\n  in the grading path (ADR 0002) and abstains to INCONCLUSIVE. Stop logging\n  that expected fallback at ERROR with a full stack trace on every grading;\n  log it at DEBUG with an explanatory message. No behavior change (all 85\n  backend tests green).\n- User guide: document that the Dataset Playground is Z3-backed and requires\n  table-qualified columns, show a successful generation on a custom schema\n  (boundary values 50000/50001) and the live effect of mutation-type toggles.\n  Also publish the guide at the repo root.\n\nVerified the SMT solver end-to-end on a brand-new \"Company DB\" schema with 5\ndifferent query types (WHERE, JOIN, GROUP BY, multiple tables); Z3 produces\ncorrect discriminating datasets. Mutation-type checkboxes pass through to the\nengine and change the output (Selection: 9 rows incl. boundary; off: 3 rows).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"889aa7614223f5491423e95aed27e1854a13d346","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/git/trees/889aa7614223f5491423e95aed27e1854a13d346"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/git/commits/423d6456c53bc4f9ff39bf909263ecfa3bdbe505","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commit/423d6456c53bc4f9ff39bf909263ecfa3bdbe505","node_id":"C_kwDOSo2_sdoAKDQyM2Q2NDU2YzUzYmM0ZjlmZjM5YmY5MDkyNjNlY2ZhM2JkYmU1MDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commit/763621ed23953cf56aa2de62860455ca82e75aaa","sha":"763621ed23953cf56aa2de62860455ca82e75aaa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/763621ed23953cf56aa2de62860455ca82e75aaa"}],"sha":"423d6456c53bc4f9ff39bf909263ecfa3bdbe505","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/423d6456c53bc4f9ff39bf909263ecfa3bdbe505"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/763621ed23953cf56aa2de62860455ca82e75aaa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-30T13:12:04Z","email":"home@imac.com","name":"HomeIMAC"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-30T13:12:04Z","email":"home@imac.com","name":"HomeIMAC"},"message":"docs: add screenshot-based user handbook (PDF)\n\nA 16-page LaTeX user guide covering the admin, instructo