rents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commit/890786ea20cb58044b870ed123390ea3bc754385","sha":"890786ea20cb58044b870ed123390ea3bc754385","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/890786ea20cb58044b870ed123390ea3bc754385"}],"sha":"ceebf511f62a5071f3994b970b4bbb20a7ede8e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/ceebf511f62a5071f3994b970b4bbb20a7ede8e2"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/890786ea20cb58044b870ed123390ea3bc754385/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-30T11:48:14Z","email":"home@imac.com","name":"HomeIMAC"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-30T11:48:14Z","email":"home@imac.com","name":"HomeIMAC"},"message":"test/lint: align backend assertions with English messages; fix useMemo deps\n\nThe i18n commit translated runtime messages to English, but several tests\nstill asserted the old German strings, failing the CI test run:\n- SqlSandboxServiceTest: \"leer\"/\"Nur Lesezugriffe\" -> \"empty\"/\"read access\".\n- 7 *SecurityTest classes asserted the German access-denied message; update\n  to \"Access denied: you do not have the required permissions.\"\n\nFrontend: wrap the derived `courses` array in useMemo in CourseMaterials\nand Gradebook so the react-hooks/exhaustive-deps warning no longer fails\nthe CI build (CI=true treats warnings as errors).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"dfd0024c328712d0c01c80abd75285053d647bb8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/git/trees/dfd0024c328712d0c01c80abd75285053d647bb8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/git/commits/890786ea20cb58044b870ed123390ea3bc754385","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commit/890786ea20cb58044b870ed123390ea3bc754385","node_id":"C_kwDOSo2_sdoAKDg5MDc4NmVhMjBjYjU4MDQ0Yjg3MGVkMTIzMzkwZWEzYmM3NTQzODU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commit/e7a474712e45fafdb6a62451dde123b00464b9d5","sha":"e7a474712e45fafdb6a62451dde123b00464b9d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/e7a474712e45fafdb6a62451dde123b00464b9d5"}],"sha":"890786ea20cb58044b870ed123390ea3bc754385","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/890786ea20cb58044b870ed123390ea3bc754385"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/e7a474712e45fafdb6a62451dde123b00464b9d5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-30T11:37:17Z","email":"home@imac.com","name":"HomeIMAC"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-30T11:37:17Z","email":"home@imac.com","name":"HomeIMAC"},"message":"ci: fix backend deps and frontend lockfile so CI passes\n\n- .gitignore: re-include all files under backend/libs-repo (the bare\n  directory negation left *.jar ignored), so the vendored local Maven\n  repo is complete in git.\n- Commit the previously-ignored vendored jars (derby 10.8, brics\n  automaton, jsqlparser 5.0) that are not on Maven Central; without them\n  `mvn test` could not resolve dependencies on CI.\n- Regenerate frontend package-lock.json from a clean install so it is\n  internally consistent (the committed lock was missing the nested\n  yaml@2.x entry, breaking `npm ci`).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c04859c38ef4ba4eee88e5fff2d38c45a507dc8e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/git/trees/c04859c38ef4ba4eee88e5fff2d38c45a507dc8e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/git/commits/e7a474712e45fafdb6a62451dde123b00464b9d5","verification":