 labels, date locales (de-DE -> en-US), index.html lang/title\nand noscript, SQL autocomplete detail, and the login demo SQL.\n\nBackend (strings that surface in the UI): controller/service error and\nsuccess messages, GlobalExceptionHandler responses, achievement/badge\nnames and descriptions, the leaderboard self-label (\"Du\" -> \"You\"), and\nthe public sandbox demo data.\n\nVerified live across login, instructor, user-management and student\nviews (screenshots under docs/audit/screenshots/).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d9ffdd069fc57f4a5567fed2698086961fe8a420","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/git/trees/d9ffdd069fc57f4a5567fed2698086961fe8a420"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/git/commits/152192fdfdefbfedfa39d6e555a7362023fafe5d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commit/152192fdfdefbfedfa39d6e555a7362023fafe5d","node_id":"C_kwDOSo2_sdoAKDE1MjE5MmZkZmRlZmJmZWRmYTM5ZDZlNTU1YTczNjIwMjNmYWZlNWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commit/e7aef057b731d56035b0116fe1469fb0c41905be","sha":"e7aef057b731d56035b0116fe1469fb0c41905be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/e7aef057b731d56035b0116fe1469fb0c41905be"}],"sha":"152192fdfdefbfedfa39d6e555a7362023fafe5d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/152192fdfdefbfedfa39d6e555a7362023fafe5d"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/e7aef057b731d56035b0116fe1469fb0c41905be/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-22T18:29:23Z","email":"home@imac.com","name":"HomeIMAC"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-22T18:29:23Z","email":"home@imac.com","name":"HomeIMAC"},"message":"refactor: remove TUTOR role, keep ADMIN/INSTRUCTOR/STUDENT\n\nThere is no teaching-assistant user in the project and the TUTOR role\nwas unused, so drop it across backend and frontend:\n\n- AccessControlService: remove isTutor()\n- CourseAccessGuard: requireInstructorOrAdmin() no longer allows TUTOR\n- SecurityConfiguration: drop TUTOR from assignments/schemas/evaluation\n- AuthContext/App: remove isTutor flag and TUTOR routing\n- InstructorDashboard: drop tutor-only view variant\n- UserManager: remove TUTOR option from role selectors\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"80ebfb4f10d70c0ce162efdffd1d122356a8c037","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/git/trees/80ebfb4f10d70c0ce162efdffd1d122356a8c037"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/git/commits/e7aef057b731d56035b0116fe1469fb0c41905be","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commit/e7aef057b731d56035b0116fe1469fb0c41905be","node_id":"C_kwDOSo2_sdoAKGU3YWVmMDU3YjczMWQ1NjAzNWIwMTE2ZmUxNDY5ZmIwYzQxOTA1YmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commit/2f398455105c77720f164ef820d1dcc3103578b1","sha":"2f398455105c77720f164ef820d1dcc3103578b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/2f398455105c77720f164ef820d1dcc3103578b1"}],"sha":"e7aef057b731d56035b0116fe1469fb0c41905be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/e7aef057b731d56035b0116fe1469fb0c41905be"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/2f398455105c77720f164ef820d1dcc3103578b1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-21T20:59:38Z","email":"home@imac.com","name":"HomeIMAC"},"comment_c