ed by .x-code / DiffTable, for a\nconsistent look in both modes. (Login console, student results, SQL-Lab and the\npublic sandbox were already clean and are left unchanged.)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4d840ebda36ec7f4e8df44a5d21aa0898b11ba3c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/git/trees/4d840ebda36ec7f4e8df44a5d21aa0898b11ba3c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/git/commits/402eec09571e21b61befe6af3a5d15fa8f75e612","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commit/402eec09571e21b61befe6af3a5d15fa8f75e612","node_id":"C_kwDOSo2_sdoAKDQwMmVlYzA5NTcxZTIxYjYxYmVmZTZhZjNhNWQxNWZhOGY3NWU2MTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commit/bc319bedc5951a24f99e445de185b263c5441acc","sha":"bc319bedc5951a24f99e445de185b263c5441acc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/bc319bedc5951a24f99e445de185b263c5441acc"}],"sha":"402eec09571e21b61befe6af3a5d15fa8f75e612","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/402eec09571e21b61befe6af3a5d15fa8f75e612"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/bc319bedc5951a24f99e445de185b263c5441acc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-21T20:22:26Z","email":"home@imac.com","name":"HomeIMAC"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-21T20:22:26Z","email":"home@imac.com","name":"HomeIMAC"},"message":"feat: rich, course-scoped Anfechtungen view + light/dark polish\n\nInstructors couldn''t make sense of regrade requests: a flat global list with\nalmost no context, and (bug) it returned ALL courses'' requests regardless of\nmembership.\n\nBackend:\n- /evaluation/regrade-requests: scope to the instructor''s own courses (admins\n  see all) and enrich each item with course/assignment/question, description,\n  maxMarks and the stored mark breakdown (markInfoJson).\n- New instructor-only GET /evaluation/submissions/{id}/result-comparison\n  (course-access checked) so the teacher sees expected-vs-actual output for a\n  disputed submission. Shared SubmissionComparisonService extracts the read-only\n  run + multiset-diff logic (also now used by the student endpoint — no\n  duplication). Reference SQL is never returned, only its output.\n\nFrontend:\n- RegradeRequests redesigned: course filter, count badge, per-request card with\n  avatar, course·assignment·question breadcrumb and current-grade chip; an\n  expandable \"Kontext\" showing the task statement, the student query, the mark\n  breakdown (MarkInfoDisplay) and the expected↔actual diff (DiffTable).\n- DiffTable extracted to its own component (reused by student + instructor).\n\nDesign system (both modes): subtle ambient background depth, a refined .x-code\nblock (replaces harsh black/green terminal) and a legible .note-amber box.\n\nBackend 85/85 tests green; tsc clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3d750cce4b6d883302ef9352a74a85d3b7637c86","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/git/trees/3d750cce4b6d883302ef9352a74a85d3b7637c86"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/git/commits/bc319bedc5951a24f99e445de185b263c5441acc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commit/bc319bedc5951a24f99e445de185b263c5441acc","node_id":"C_kwDOSo2_sdoAKGJjMzE5YmVkYzU5NTFhMjRmOTllNDQ1ZGUxODViMjYzYzU0NDFhY2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commit/cc2d146690ed64984051b1297576f48d85f427d9","sha":"cc2d146690ed64984051b1297576f48d85f427d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/cc2d146690ed64984051b1297576f48d85f427d9"}],"sha":"bc319bedc5951a24f99e445de185b263c5441acc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/bc319bedc5951a24f99e445de185b263c5441acc"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/cc2d146690ed64984051b1297576f48d85f427d9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-21T20:22:02Z","email":"home@imac.com","name":"HomeIMAC"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-21T20:22:02Z","email":"home@imac.com","name":"HomeIMAC"},"message":"test: align CourseControllerSecurityTest with instructor course creation\n\nFollow-up to letting instructors create courses: the slice test still expected\ninstructor→403 and used a non-binding \"name\" JSON key (should be \"courseName\"),\nso admin create now hit the new validation (400). Update both: instructors now\nsucceed (200, auto-enrolled), and stub the uniqueness lookup.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"47aaf77a1d3af33ecacac680c7f5f95d7da4f2e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/git/trees/47aaf77a1d3af33ecacac680c7f5f95d7da4f2e5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/git/commits/cc2d146690ed64984051b1297576f48d85f427d9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commit/cc2d146690ed64984051b1297576f48d85f427d9","node_id":"C_kwDOSo2_sdoAKGNjMmQxNDY2OTBlZDY0OTg0MDUxYjEyOTc1NzZmNDhkODVmNDI3ZDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commit/3356d9c57bc117c465c78a42cfbd442888b1c1e3","sha":"3356d9c57bc117c465c78a42cfbd442888b1c1e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/3356d9c57bc117c465c78a42cfbd442888b1c1e3"}],"sha":"cc2d146690ed64984051b1297576f48d85f427d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/cc2d146690ed64984051b1297576f48d85f427d9"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/3356d9c57bc117c465c78a42cfbd442888b1c1e3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-21T19:53:50Z","email":"home@imac.com","name":"HomeIMAC"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-21T19:53:50Z","email":"home@imac.com","name":"HomeIMAC"},"message":"feat: let instructors create their own courses\n\nCourse creation was admin-only (createCourse called requireAdmin), even though\nthe method already auto-enrolls an instructor into a course they create. Relax\nthe gate to the class-level @PreAuthorize (ADMIN or INSTRUCTOR), validate name +\ncourse-id and reject duplicate ids with a clear 400.\n\nFrontend: the instructor \"Kurse\" tab gains a \"Neuen Kurs erstellen\" form\n(name + id) that posts to /admin/courses and refreshes; the creator is auto-\nenrolled and the course immediately appears in their course picker. Students\nremain blocked by role.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9ea4613e0993bc9b1f57d9bca1209231cc60eaa8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/git/trees/9ea4613e0993bc9b1f57d9bca1209231cc60eaa8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/git/commits/3356d9c57bc117c465c78a42cfbd442888b1c1e3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commit/3356d9c57bc117c465c78a42cfbd442888b1c1e3","node_id":"C_kwDOSo2_sdoAKDMzNTZkOWM1N2JjMTE3YzQ2NWM3OGE0MmNmYmQ0NDI4ODhiMWMxZTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commit/cdfc51e9190f7ab968744a9bb7c6674d92086ac4","sha":"cdfc51e9190f7ab968744a9bb7c6674d92086ac4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/cdfc51e9190f7ab968744a9bb7c6674d92086ac4"}],"sha":"3356d9c57bc117c465c78a42cfbd442888b1c1e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/3356d9c57bc117c465c78a42cfbd442888b1c1e3"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/cdfc51e9190f7ab968744a9bb7c6674d92086ac4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-21T19:44:18Z","email":"home@imac.com","name":"HomeIMAC"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-21T19:44:18Z","email":"home@imac.com","name":"HomeIMAC"},"message":"docs: concept — per-assignment stored dataset & external generation\n\nDesign note: bind an assignment to one schema + a once-generated dataset used on\na scratch DB at grading time, and offload heavy SMT/mutant generation to an\nexternal platform with import. Phased roadmap (A implemented).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"720f4ad8ee0c22cadc728bd5f06a2140a9dcc4c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/git/trees/720f4ad8ee0c22cadc728bd5f06a2140a9dcc4c2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/git/commits/cdfc51e9190f7ab968744a9bb7c6674d92086ac4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commit/cdfc51e9190f7ab968744a9bb7c6674d92086ac4","node_id":"C_kwDOSo2_sdoAKGNkZmM1MWU5MTkwZjdhYjk2ODc0NGE5YmI3YzY2NzRkOTIwODZhYzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commit/edf1985bc099a8c1df7f0ae60226af870771ac18","sha":"edf1985bc099a8c1df7f0ae60226af870771ac18","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/edf1985bc099a8c1df7f0ae60226af870771ac18"}],"sha":"cdfc51e9190f7ab968744a9bb7c6674d92086ac4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/cdfc51e9190f7ab968744a9bb7c6674d92086ac4"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/edf1985bc099a8c1df7f0ae60226af870771ac18/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-21T19:43:57Z","email":"home@imac.com","name":"HomeIMAC"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-21T19:43:57Z","email":"home@imac.com","name":"HomeIMAC"},"message":"feat: task context (description/sample-data/result-diff), per-assignment dataset grading & assignment validation\n\nBundled because these share core files (AssignmentManager, AssignmentController,\nAssignmentService, types):\n\nTask context for students:\n- New Question.description (V23) — a real task statement, shown above the editor.\n- GET /student/assignments/{id}/sample-data — a few real rows per table (read-only,\n  allow-listed table names) → \"Beispieldaten\" toggle.\n- GET /student/submissions/{id}/result-comparison — expected vs. own output diff\n  (runs reference + student query read-only on the assignment DB, never leaks the\n  reference SQL; gated by gradesReleased) → diff panel.\n\nPer-assignment fixed dataset grading (Phase A):\n- New Assignment.seedSql (V24). When set, TestDataExecutionStage seeds an ephemeral\n  scratch DB with it and decides EQUIVALENT/NOT_EQUIVALENT there — deterministic,\n  no per-submission generation, no live DB needed. SchemaRef carries the seed.\n- Instructor wizard: \"Testdaten\" textarea + \".sql laden\" import.\n\nAssignment-create validation (fixes the confusing 403):\n- Client-side checks (course selected, name, connection) with clear messages;\n  empty-state when the instructor has no course; backend returns 400 (not 403)\n  for a blank courseId.\n\ndescription/difficulty/seed are copied on duplicate; StudentControllerSecurityTest\ngains the SchemaService mock. Backend 85/85 tests green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bfbe364e9641403ae4bd032e4e726cd8be1867a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/git/trees/bfbe364e9641403ae4bd032e4e726cd8be1867a8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/git/commits/edf1985bc099a8c1df7f0ae60226af870771ac18","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commit/edf1985bc099a8c1df7f0ae60226af870771ac18","node_id":"C_kwDOSo2_sdoAKGVkZjE5ODViYzA5OWE4YzFkZjdmMGFlNjAyMjZhZjg3MDc3MWFjMTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commit/ed138171958e9ea99f78e381f1b7a52af62dc966","sha":"ed138171958e9ea99f78e381f1b7a52af62dc966","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/ed138171958e9ea99f78e381f1b7a52af62dc966"}],"sha":"edf1985bc099a8c1df7f0ae60226af870771ac18","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/edf1985bc099a8c1df7f0ae60226af870771ac18"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/ed138171958e9ea99f78e381f1b7a52af62dc966/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-21T19:43:22Z","email":"home@imac.com","name":"HomeIMAC"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-21T19:43:22Z","email":"home@imac.com","name":"HomeIMAC"},"message":"fix(ui): friendly validation & error messages in instructor forms\n\nTrim + clear messages and stop dumping raw backend errors into toasts:\n- InstructorDashboard announcement: trim title/content before validating.\n- DbConnectionManager: friendly connection-test failure messages (no raw dump).\n- CourseMaterials: require content, validate LINK URLs, friendly error.\n- RegradeRequests: validate the 0–100 mark range, friendly error.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8ca493008249654cf9ef6de1722cbdb5df1826ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/git/trees/8ca493008249654cf9ef6de1722cbdb5df1826ad"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/git/commits/ed138171958e9ea99f78e381f1b7a52af62dc966","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commit/ed138171958e9ea99f78e381f1b7a52af62dc966","node_id":"C_kwDOSo2_sdoAKGVkMTM4MTcxOTU4ZTllYTk5Zjc4ZTM4MWYxYjdhNTJhZjYyZGM5NjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commit/f33918bbf854041320423c3f4697a7622cf911ed","sha":"f33918bbf854041320423c3f4697a7622cf911ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/f33918bbf854041320423c3f4697a7622cf911ed"}],"sha":"ed138171958e9ea99f78e381f1b7a52af62dc966","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/ed138171958e9ea99f78e381f1b7a52af62dc966"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/f33918bbf854041320423c3f4697a7622cf911ed/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-21T17:11:13Z","email":"home@imac.com","name":"HomeIMAC"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-21T17:11:13Z","email":"home@imac.com","name":"HomeIMAC"},"message":"refactor(ui): unify buttons, form fields & cards on the design system\n\nMany instructor/admin components styled buttons, inputs, labels and cards with\nbespoke inline Tailwind, so they looked inconsistent. Migrate them to the\ncanonical classes already defined in public/index.html (btn-primary/secondary/\ndanger/ghost, icon-btn, x-input/x-select/x-label, x-card, x-tab). No new CSS.\n\nFixes the two reported issues:\n- DbConnectionManager \"Neue Verbindung\"/\"Speichern\" no longer carry a glow\n  shadow (shadow-lg shadow-blue-100) — now plain btn-primary like everywhere.\n- AssignmentManager \"Name des Assignments\" and \"Deadline\" are aligned again:\n  the labels had different markup (one flex, one block) and bespoke input\n  paddings; both now use x-label + x-input so heights/baselines match.\n\nAlso fixes a real bug in UserManager where `icon-btnhover:…` (missing space)\nmeant the icon-btn class never applied on four action buttons.\n\nRemoved glow shadows, oversized radii (rounded-[20px]/[32px]) and inconsistent\ninput paddings across AssignmentManager, SchemaManager, SqlLab, DatasetPlayground,\nAssignmentStats (tabs -> x-tab), ConfirmationModal and Layout. Login/TrySql and\nalready-compliant components left untouched.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cea940e0b668f372563369e68cd8227409909715","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/git/trees/cea940e0b668f372563369e68cd8227409909715"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/git/commits/f33918bbf854041320423c3f4697a7622cf911ed","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commit/f33918bbf854041320423c3f4697a7622cf911ed","node_id":"C_kwDOSo2_sdoAKGYzMzkxOGJiZjg1NDA0MTMyMDQyM2MzZjQ2OTdhNzYyMmNmOTExZWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commit/791fe914427a6bedf55bbb6c55f85cd33f6313b9","sha":"791fe914427a6bedf55bbb6c55f85cd33f6313b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/791fe914427a6bedf55bbb6c55f85cd33f6313b9"}],"sha":"f33918bbf854041320423c3f4697a7622cf911ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/f33918bbf854041320423c3f4697a7622cf911ed"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/791fe914427a6bedf55bbb6c55f85cd33f6313b9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-21T16:37:25Z","email":"home@imac.com","name":"HomeIMAC"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-21T16:37:25Z","email":"home@imac.com","name":"HomeIMAC"},"message":"chore: repo hygiene — ignore IDE/tooling, add PR doc\n\n- .gitignore: ignore .idea/ and *.iml (IDE, machine-specific — dataSources.xml\n  even carried a JDBC URL) plus .agents/ and .claude/ (local Claude Code /\n  agent artifacts, including binary .skill packages).\n- Untrack the previously committed .idea/ files and xdata-web.iml (kept locally).\n- Add the branch PR description (docs/PULL_REQUEST.md).\n\nNote: .github/workflows/ci.yml is ready locally but not committed — the push\ntoken lacks the `workflow` scope. Add that scope (or commit it via the GitHub\nUI) to land the CI pipeline.\n\nLeft untouched (separate, needs confirmation): docs/audit/screenshots/*.png and\nthe legacy benchmark archives. libs-repo jars stay — they are pom dependencies.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2278d8f5234ad30e2c9a1b15132237d5ad9a28f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/git/trees/2278d8f5234ad30e2c9a1b15132237d5ad9a28f8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/git/commits/791fe914427a6bedf55bbb6c55f85cd33f6313b9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commit/791fe914427a6bedf55bbb6c55f85cd33f6313b9","node_id":"C_kwDOSo2_sdoAKDc5MWZlOTE0NDI3YTZiZWRmNTViYmI2YzU1Zjg1Y2QzM2Y2MzEzYjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commit/44976d31c104c7034834ed1f1b41db03c951c827","sha":"44976d31c104c7034834ed1f1b41db03c951c827","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/44976d31c104c7034834ed1f1b41db03c951c827"}],"sha":"791fe914427a6bedf55bbb6c55f85cd33f6313b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/791fe914427a6bedf55bbb6c55f85cd33f6313b9"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/44976d31c104c7034834ed1f1b41db03c951c827/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-21T16:27:39Z","email":"home@imac.com","name":"HomeIMAC"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-21T16:27:39Z","email":"home@imac.com","name":"HomeIMAC"},"message":"feat: assignment default-schema picker, teacher-set difficulty, UX fixes\n\nMotivated by the 3-role test in docs/anforderungen-rollen.md.\n\nDefault schema (closes the dead schema explorer): the instructor wizard now has\na \"Standard-Schema\" dropdown (loads /schemas/course/{id}); the assignment card\nshows the schema name. Backend was already wired (Assignment.defaultSchemaId),\nso this is frontend-only — students now get a live schema explorer + Monaco\nautocomplete (verified: GET /schemas/4/metadata fires, ER panel renders).\n\nTeacher-controlled difficulty: new Flyway V22 adds a nullable difficulty column\nto xdata_queries; Question gains the field; QuestionController PUT binds it;\nStudentController exposes it in the sanitized payload; duplicateAssignment copies\nit (and the previously-dropped tags/hints). The instructor question form gets an\nEasy/Medium/Hard select (or Auto), and StudentDashboard prefers the teacher value\nover the marks-derived fallback (verified: a 10-pt question shows EASY).\n\nUX: \"Alle speichern\" reports partial failures; the reference-solution validation\nmessage (plain-string body) is surfaced instead of swallowed; the run preview is\ncleared on submit so it no longer lingers next to \"Letztes Ergebnis\".\n\nBackend: 85/85 tests pass; Flyway V22 applies cleanly.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"44fc770bff8b1cd525dc0e48d4933b4a25a3c3be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/git/trees/44fc770bff8b1cd525dc0e48d4933b4a25a3c3be"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/git/commits/44976d31c104c7034834ed1f1b41db03c951c827","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commit/44976d31c104c7034834ed1f1b41db03c951c827","node_id":"C_kwDOSo2_sdoAKDQ0OTc2ZDMxYzEwNGM3MDM0ODM0ZWQxZjFiNDFkYjAzYzk1MWM4Mjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commit/b472e2ba1279f03bbeb3ea5dcb46eaf160df1726","sha":"b472e2ba1279f03bbeb3ea5dcb46eaf160df1726","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/b472e2ba1279f03bbeb3ea5dcb46eaf160df1726"}],"sha":"44976d31c104c7034834ed1f1b41db03c951c827","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/44976d31c104c7034834ed1f1b41db03c951c827"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/b472e2ba1279f03bbeb3ea5dcb46eaf160df1726/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-21T15:40:39Z","email":"home@imac.com","name":"HomeIMAC"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-21T15:40:39Z","email":"home@imac.com","name":"HomeIMAC"},"message":"feat(ui): live-query login redesign + drop Dataset Playground default\n\n- Login: the form is now the query. Credentials render live into an auth.sql\n  console (login_id + masked password), and submitting \"runs\" it — the console\n  result line reflects the real auth outcome (1 row / authenticated, or\n  0 rows / access denied, plus a running state). Tightened type hierarchy,\n  added an eyebrow and a mobile query strip, aria-live status, htmlFor labels.\n- Dataset Playground: removed the hardcoded default query\n  (SELECT * FROM students WHERE age > 20;); the editor starts empty with a\n  non-submitted placeholder hint instead.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4374e47f8070b6514f3ee16866bf81f3675f0c8b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/git/trees/4374e47f8070b6514f3ee16866bf81f3675f0c8b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/git/commits/b472e2ba1279f03bbeb3ea5dcb46eaf160df1726","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commit/b472e2ba1279f03bbeb3ea5dcb46eaf160df1726","node_id":"C_kwDOSo2_sdoAKGI0NzJlMmJhMTI3OWYwM2JiZWIzZWE1ZGNiNDZlYWYxNjBkZjE3MjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commit/9ebd478c2ad41c47cb41c46b6415887a2d306e0b","sha":"9ebd478c2ad41c47cb41c46b6415887a2d306e0b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/9ebd478c2ad41c47cb41c46b6415887a2d306e0b"}],"sha":"b472e2ba1279f03bbeb3ea5dcb46eaf160df1726","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/b472e2ba1279f03bbeb3ea5dcb46eaf160df1726"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/9ebd478c2ad41c47cb41c46b6415887a2d306e0b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-21T15:23:29Z","email":"home@imac.com","name":"HomeIMAC"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-21T15:23:29Z","email":"home@imac.com","name":"HomeIMAC"},"message":"test: fix pre-existing security-slice test failures\n\nThese @WebMvcTest slices had drifted from the controllers on this branch:\n\n- Assignment/Evaluation/Course security tests failed to load the context\n  because the controllers gained dependencies the tests never mocked\n  (DeadlineExtensionRepository, RegradeRequestRepository, SubmissionAnalytics).\n  Added the missing @MockBeans.\n- AuditLogControllerSecurityTest.instructor_can_read_audit_logs expected 200,\n  but audit logs are deliberately ADMIN-only (SecurityConfiguration). Aligned\n  the test to the policy: admin_can_read_audit_logs (200) +\n  audit_logs_are_off_limits_to_instructors (403).\n\nFull suite: 85 tests, 0 failures, 0 errors.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"27d75cf94de7c6ca4fecf71d9e0e8faab2ed6695","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/git/trees/27d75cf94de7c6ca4fecf71d9e0e8faab2ed6695"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/git/commits/9ebd478c2ad41c47cb41c46b6415887a2d306e0b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commit/9ebd478c2ad41c47cb41c46b6415887a2d306e0b","node_id":"C_kwDOSo2_sdoAKDllYmQ0NzhjMmFkNDFjNDdjYjQxYzQ2YjY0MTU4ODdhMmQzMDZlMGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commit/52b5a3b142869f9f5f32c19c2479bb1ac3e16832","sha":"52b5a3b142869f9f5f32c19c2479bb1ac3e16832","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/52b5a3b142869f9f5f32c19c2479bb1ac3e16832"}],"sha":"9ebd478c2ad41c47cb41c46b6415887a2d306e0b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/9ebd478c2ad41c47cb41c46b6415887a2d306e0b"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/52b5a3b142869f9f5f32c19c2479bb1ac3e16832/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-21T15:17:54Z","email":"home@imac.com","name":"HomeIMAC"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-21T15:17:54Z","email":"home@imac.com","name":"HomeIMAC"},"message":"feat: gamification, ER schema explorer & public SQL sandbox\n\nStudent-facing learning UX, informed by a competitive UI analysis of SQL\nlearning platforms (docs/competitive-ui-analysis.md). Five additions, each\nfull-stack:\n\n- Streak & daily goal: dashboard hero shows a consecutive-active-days streak\n  and a per-day submission goal, both derived from existing submission\n  timestamps (no new persistence).\n- Achievements: six badges (first solve, 10/25 solved, perfect module, level 5,\n  3-day streak) computed from existing data, with progress bars.\n- Course leaderboard: GET /student/leaderboard ranks the cohort by achieved\n  points (XP tiebreak); privacy-aware (\"Firstname L.\", self as \"Du\", own rank +\n  percentile).\n- ER schema explorer: SchemaMetadataDTO now carries primary-key flags and\n  foreign-key targets, parsed from the CREATE TABLE AST (inline + table-level,\n  composite keys). SchemaVisualizer renders PK/FK badges and relations. The\n  student questions payload now passes defaultSchemaId so the panel populates.\n- Public SQL sandbox (/try-sql, W3Schools-style, no login): read-only SELECTs\n  against an ephemeral in-memory H2 instance (PostgreSQL mode) seeded per\n  request — fully isolated from the real DB. Linked from the login page.\n\nSecurity: /api/v1/public/** is permitted anonymously. Updated security tests\nso unauthenticated requests assert 401 (the AuthenticationEntryPoint behaviour)\nand added the StudentController mocks needed by the @WebMvcTest slice.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"45dbed338ff9ed6b6ad7c493119e89a6dd735046","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/git/trees/45dbed338ff9ed6b6ad7c493119e89a6dd735046"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/git/commits/52b5a3b142869f9f5f32c19c2479bb1ac3e16832","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commit/52b5a3b142869f9f5f32c19c2479bb1ac3e16832","node_id":"C_kwDOSo2_sdoAKDUyYjVhM2IxNDI4NjlmOWY1ZjMyYzE5YzI0NzliYjFhYzNlMTY4MzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commit/a5ab64e9c234053836d9674f532303aeab3ac8be","sha":"a5ab64e9c234053836d9674f532303aeab3ac8be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/a5ab64e9c234053836d9674f532303aeab3ac8be"}],"sha":"52b5a3b142869f9f5f32c19c2479bb1ac3e16832","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/52b5a3b142869f9f5f32c19c2479bb1ac3e16832"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/a5ab64e9c234053836d9674f532303aeab3ac8be/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-21T14:21:11Z","email":"home@imac.com","name":"HomeIMAC"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-21T14:21:11Z","email":"home@imac.com","name":"HomeIMAC"},"message":"fix: return 401 (not 403) for unauthenticated requests\n\nAn expired/invalid JWT leaves the request anonymous; without an explicit\nAuthenticationEntryPoint Spring answered anonymous-denied with 403, which the\nSPA cannot tell apart from a genuine \"logged in but lacks the role\" 403. The\naxios interceptor only auto-logs-out on 401, so after the 24h token expiry\nusers were stranded on a broken page (\"Could not load schemas\" on SQL-Labor /\nDataset-Playground) instead of being redirected to login.\n\nAdd an HttpStatusEntryPoint(UNAUTHORIZED) so unauthenticated requests return\n401; real authorization failures (authenticated user, wrong role) stay 403.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"618064000d1793d2628a5f99e0cfe767d37ba5e9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/git/trees/618064000d1793d2628a5f99e0cfe767d37ba5e9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/git/commits/a5ab64e9c234053836d9674f532303aeab3ac8be","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commit/a5ab64e9c234053836d9674f532303aeab3ac8be","node_id":"C_kwDOSo2_sdoAKGE1YWI2NGU5YzIzNDA1MzgzNmQ5Njc0ZjUzMjMwM2FlYWIzYWM4YmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commit/396ae1638dfe5247fd86e1d7daf63b39c52fbc15","sha":"396ae1638dfe5247fd86e1d7daf63b39c52fbc15","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/396ae1638dfe5247fd86e1d7daf63b39c52fbc15"}],"sha":"a5ab64e9c234053836d9674f532303aeab3ac8be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/a5ab64e9c234053836d9674f532303aeab3ac8be"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/396ae1638dfe5247fd86e1d7daf63b39c52fbc15/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-21T11:38:47Z","email":"home@imac.com","name":"HomeIMAC"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-21T11:38:47Z","email":"home@imac.com","name":"HomeIMAC"},"message":"feat: teaching-assistant (TUTOR) role (Batch 4: #12 — TA role)\n\n- New TUTOR role: may grade/give feedback/handle regrade requests and view\n  assignments, but cannot manage users, courses or DB connections.\n- Backend: AccessControlService.isTutor(); CourseAccessGuard grading guard now\n  admits tutors (management controllers stay ADMIN/INSTRUCTOR via class-level\n  @PreAuthorize); SecurityConfiguration adds TUTOR to /assignments, /evaluation,\n  /schemas. Admins can create TUTOR users.\n- Frontend: isTutor; /instructor route + redirect for tutors; the panel shows\n  tutors only the grading tabs (Notenbuch, Anfechtungen, Statistiken) under a\n  \"Tutor-Panel\" header; TUTOR option in the user role dropdown (admin only).\n\nNote: course sections/groups remain a follow-up; instructor↔course assignment\nalready works via the user editor.\n\nVerified: regression scan clean (admin/instructor/student unchanged); tutor can\ngrade (regrade/override/assignments 200) but is 403 on users/courses/connections.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c0d7751a2f4a85a2e33c9c00fa632c93658a3b2b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/git/trees/c0d7751a2f4a85a2e33c9c00fa632c93658a3b2b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/git/commits/396ae1638dfe5247fd86e1d7daf63b39c52fbc15","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commit/396ae1638dfe5247fd86e1d7daf63b39c52fbc15","node_id":"C_kwDOSo2_sdoAKDM5NmFlMTYzOGRmZTUyNDdmZDg2ZTFkN2RhZjYzYjM5YzUyZmJjMTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commit/a0514cee6386306d10a63864b19e677ee69bf58c","sha":"a0514cee6386306d10a63864b19e677ee69bf58c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/a0514cee6386306d10a63864b19e677ee69bf58c"}],"sha":"396ae1638dfe5247fd86e1d7daf63b39c52fbc15","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/396ae1638dfe5247fd86e1d7daf63b39c52fbc15"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/a0514cee6386306d10a63864b19e677ee69bf58c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-21T11:29:22Z","email":"home@imac.com","name":"HomeIMAC"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-21T11:29:22Z","email":"home@imac.com","name":"HomeIMAC"},"message":"feat: progressive hints per question (Batch 4: #9 — hints)\n\n- Question.hints (one per line), migration V21; saved on create/update.\n- Instructor: \"Hinweise\" textarea in the question editor.\n- Student: a hints panel reveals hints step by step (\"Hinweis anzeigen (n/total)\").\n  Hints come through the sanitized student view as an array.\n\nNote: ungraded practice is already covered by \"Ausführen\" (run-before-submit, #2);\na separate standalone practice problem bank remains a larger follow-up.\n\nVerified: hints saved (200) and delivered to students as a split array.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a0a234e869da0da02d926773dc205d4912d56aa1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/git/trees/a0a234e869da0da02d926773dc205d4912d56aa1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/git/commits/a0514cee6386306d10a63864b19e677ee69bf58c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commit/a0514cee6386306d10a63864b19e677ee69bf58c","node_id":"C_kwDOSo2_sdoAKGEwNTE0Y2VlNjM4NjMwNmQxMGE2Mzg2NGIxOWU2NzdlZTY5YmY1OGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commit/38f13bff074f444ad44016a602d7b82b0e024108","sha":"38f13bff074f444ad44016a602d7b82b0e024108","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/38f13bff074f444ad44016a602d7b82b0e024108"}],"sha":"a0514cee6386306d10a63864b19e677ee69bf58c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/a0514cee6386306d10a63864b19e677ee69bf58c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/38f13bff074f444ad44016a602d7b82b0e024108/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-21T11:24:03Z","email":"home@imac.com","name":"HomeIMAC"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-21T11:24:03Z","email":"home@imac.com","name":"HomeIMAC"},"message":"feat: topic tags for questions (Batch 4: #7 — tags)\n\n- Question.tags (comma-separated), migration V20; saved on create/update.\n- Instructor: \"Themen-Tags\" field in the question editor.\n- Student: tags shown as chips in the question list; included in the sanitized\n  student question view (instructorQuery stays hidden).\n\nNote: additional auto-graded question types (multiple-choice / DDL / free-text)\nare a larger grading-engine effort tracked separately; this delivers the topic\ntagging part of #7.\n\nVerified: tag saved (200), visible to student, reference solution still hidden.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ac33d2571f7e36282d0c111182dec15b2efe8c7f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/git/trees/ac33d2571f7e36282d0c111182dec15b2efe8c7f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/git/commits/38f13bff074f444ad44016a602d7b82b0e024108","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commit/38f13bff074f444ad44016a602d7b82b0e024108","node_id":"C_kwDOSo2_sdoAKDM4ZjEzYmZmMDc0ZjQ0NGFkNDQwMTZhNjAyZDdiODJiMGUwMjQxMDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commit/02cbae193225b624abcb20348237411e1c320a9c","sha":"02cbae193225b624abcb20348237411e1c320a9c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/02cbae193225b624abcb20348237411e1c320a9c"}],"sha":"38f13bff074f444ad44016a602d7b82b0e024108","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/38f13bff074f444ad44016a602d7b82b0e024108"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/02cbae193225b624abcb20348237411e1c320a9c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-21T11:17:55Z","email":"home@imac.com","name":"HomeIMAC"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-21T11:17:55Z","email":"home@imac.com","name":"HomeIMAC"},"message":"feat: course learning materials (Batch 3: #11)\n\n- CourseMaterial entity/table (V19) + repository; MaterialController:\n  GET /materials (current user''s courses, all roles), POST/DELETE\n  (instructor/admin, course-access guarded).\n- Instructor \"Kursinhalte\" tab (CourseMaterials.tsx): add link/text resources\n  per course, list & delete.\n- Students see a \"Lernmaterial\" card on their dashboard (clickable links / notes).\n  (Deadline overview already surfaced per assignment.)\n\nVerified: create 200 / student sees it / student create 403 / delete 200.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e1798118b8a5e338b34d6c59fe16c9bf550b7567","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/git/trees/e1798118b8a5e338b34d6c59fe16c9bf550b7567"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/git/commits/02cbae193225b624abcb20348237411e1c320a9c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commit/02cbae193225b624abcb20348237411e1c320a9c","node_id":"C_kwDOSo2_sdoAKDAyY2JhZTE5MzIyNWI2MjRhYmNiMjAzNDgyMzc0MTFlMWMzMjBhOWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commit/c4d36309b67033c288b81846324f7cded2f198cd","sha":"c4d36309b67033c288b81846324f7cded2f198cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/c4d36309b67033c288b81846324f7cded2f198cd"}],"sha":"02cbae193225b624abcb20348237411e1c320a9c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/02cbae193225b624abcb20348237411e1c320a9c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/c4d36309b67033c288b81846324f7cded2f198cd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-21T11:09:52Z","email":"home@imac.com","name":"HomeIMAC"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-21T11:09:52Z","email":"home@imac.com","name":"HomeIMAC"},"message":"feat: regrade requests + manual grade override (Batch 2: #8 — completes Batch 2)\n\n- Students can object to a grade: POST /student/submissions/{id}/regrade-request\n  (own submissions only); \"Bewertung anfechten\" button on the result panel.\n- Instructors get an \"Anfechtungen\" tab (RegradeRequests.tsx): list of open\n  requests with student/question/message/current mark; set a new mark (0–100 %)\n  + reason to override and auto-resolve the request.\n- POST /evaluation/submissions/{id}/override sets marks, flags manually_graded,\n  appends the reason to feedback, and resolves open requests.\n- New RegradeRequest entity/table (V18) + manually_graded on submissions.\n\nVerified end-to-end: request -> appears for instructor -> override 50% -> request\nresolved, student marks updated; restored.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"afb30b25f5af4a1672d9da383e243186d69d25fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/git/trees/afb30b25f5af4a1672d9da383e243186d69d25fc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/git/commits/c4d36309b67033c288b81846324f7cded2f198cd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commit/c4d36309b67033c288b81846324f7cded2f198cd","node_id":"C_kwDOSo2_sdoAKGM0ZDM2MzA5YjY3MDMzYzI4OGI4MTg0NjMyNGY3Y2RlZDJmMTk4Y2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commit/b4f51984edbfcf068c99beb9f263889465571fb6","sha":"b4f51984edbfcf068c99beb9f263889465571fb6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/b4f51984edbfcf068c99beb9f263889465571fb6"}],"sha":"c4d36309b67033c288b81846324f7cded2f198cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/c4d36309b67033c288b81846324f7cded2f198cd"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/b4f51984edbfcf068c99beb9f263889465571fb6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-21T11:02:10Z","email":"home@imac.com","name":"HomeIMAC"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-21T11:02:10Z","email":"home@imac.com","name":"HomeIMAC"},"message":"feat: run query before submitting (Batch 2: #2)\n\n- New POST /student/run executes a student''s query against the assignment DB\n  WITHOUT grading: sandbox-validated (SELECT-only), 10s timeout, 100-row preview.\n  Returns columns + rows, or a friendly SQL error; reuses DatabaseService +\n  SqlSandboxService.\n- Student UI: an \"Ausführen\" button next to submit shows a result-set preview\n  table (columns/rows, row count, truncation note) or the SQL error inline.\n\nVerified: SELECT -> 4 rows/5 cols; DROP -> blocked; bad column -> SQL error;\nlive UI preview table renders.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3ed1a89d71c573bff5d1584757a87c1176faa175","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/git/trees/3ed1a89d71c573bff5d1584757a87c1176faa175"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/git/commits/b4f51984edbfcf068c99beb9f263889465571fb6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commit/b4f51984edbfcf068c99beb9f263889465571fb6","node_id":"C_kwDOSo2_sdoAKGI0ZjUxOTg0ZWRiZmNmMDY4Yzk5YmViOWYyNjM4ODk0NjU1NzFmYjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commit/c166d46557011065f2ad4f18d625093141dfa86a","sha":"c166d46557011065f2ad4f18d625093141dfa86a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/c166d46557011065f2ad4f18d625093141dfa86a"}],"sha":"b4f51984edbfcf068c99beb9f263889465571fb6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/b4f51984edbfcf068c99beb9f263889465571fb6"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/c166d46557011065f2ad4f18d625093141dfa86a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-21T10:53:04Z","email":"home@imac.com","name":"HomeIMAC"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-21T10:53:04Z","email":"home@imac.com","name":"HomeIMAC"},"message":"feat: course gradebook with CSV export (Batch 2: #1)\n\n- SubmissionAnalytics.gradebook/gradebookCsv build a students × assignments\n  matrix per course (achieved = best-mark-per-question × weight), reusing the\n  existing \"best mark\" rule.\n- CourseController: GET /admin/courses/{id}/gradebook (+ /export as CSV),\n  course-access guarded, students only.\n- New \"Notenbuch\" primary tab in the instructor panel (Gradebook.tsx): course\n  selector, matrix with per-assignment points + overall %, and CSV download.\n\nVerified: matrix + CSV correct (Max Schüler 10/10), student access -> 403, UI ok.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ab34ea6e44da82771426ef89013681e521f143e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/git/trees/ab34ea6e44da82771426ef89013681e521f143e8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/git/commits/c166d46557011065f2ad4f18d625093141dfa86a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commit/c166d46557011065f2ad4f18d625093141dfa86a","node_id":"C_kwDOSo2_sdoAKGMxNjZkNDY1NTcwMTEwNjVmMmFkNGYxOGQ2MjUwOTMxNDFkZmE4NmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commit/89d39f5927d199b21dc496be75ea647da71a36dd","sha":"89d39f5927d199b21dc496be75ea647da71a36dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/89d39f5927d199b21dc496be75ea647da71a36dd"}],"sha":"c166d46557011065f2ad4f18d625093141dfa86a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/c166d46557011065f2ad4f18d625093141dfa86a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/89d39f5927d199b21dc496be75ea647da71a36dd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-21T10:44:52Z","email":"home@imac.com","name":"HomeIMAC"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-21T10:44:52Z","email":"home@imac.com","name":"HomeIMAC"},"message":"feat: per-student deadline extensions (Batch 1: #5b — completes #5)\n\n- New DeadlineExtension entity/table (V17) + repository.\n- Instructor/admin endpoints on /assignments/{id}/extensions (list/set/delete),\n  course-access guarded; students are 403.\n- calculatePenalty now uses the per-student extended deadline when present, so an\n  extended student is not penalised until their own deadline.\n- Instructor UI: a \"Fristverlängerungen\" action on each assignment card opens a\n  modal to grant/remove per-student extensions (DeadlineExtensionModal).\n\nVerified: set 200 / list / student 403 / delete 200.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"070732a803d6bd4c53cd016aacdb904b804754da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/git/trees/070732a803d6bd4c53cd016aacdb904b804754da"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/git/commits/89d39f5927d199b21dc496be75ea647da71a36dd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commit/89d39f5927d199b21dc496be75ea647da71a36dd","node_id":"C_kwDOSo2_sdoAKDg5ZDM5ZjU5MjdkMTk5YjIxZGM0OTZiZTc1ZWE2NDdkYTcxYTM2ZGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commit/fd7aaa8a7b01cc64d8bb6d878882ff8da3e8966d","sha":"fd7aaa8a7b01cc64d8bb6d878882ff8da3e8966d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/fd7aaa8a7b01cc64d8bb6d878882ff8da3e8966d"}],"sha":"89d39f5927d199b21dc496be75ea647da71a36dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/89d39f5927d199b21dc496be75ea647da71a36dd"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/fd7aaa8a7b01cc64d8bb6d878882ff8da3e8966d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-21T10:37:11Z","email":"home@imac.com","name":"HomeIMAC"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-21T10:37:11Z","email":"home@imac.com","name":"HomeIMAC"},"message":"feat: submission policies — max attempts + grade release (Batch 1: #5a)\n\n- Per-assignment \"max attempts\": enforced in /student/submit (403 once the limit\n  for a question is reached). Configurable in the assignment wizard (Erweitert).\n- Per-assignment \"grade release\" toggle: when off, students'' marks/feedback are\n  withheld — the student submission views return them masked, the live WebSocket\n  score is suppressed, and the student UI shows \"Bewertung noch nicht freigegeben\".\n  Default released = true.\n- Student submission endpoints now return a sanitized view (also fixes an\n  instructorQuery leak that existed on /student/submissions).\n- Migration V16 adds max_attempts + grades_released to xdata_assignment.\n\nVerified: maxAttempts=1 -> 2nd submit 403; withheld -> marks null & flag false &\nno leak; released -> marks restored.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8a5c2f827b15e1440a3b6ca734033edf1cd6c1ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/git/trees/8a5c2f827b15e1440a3b6ca734033edf1cd6c1ca"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/git/commits/fd7aaa8a7b01cc64d8bb6d878882ff8da3e8966d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commit/fd7aaa8a7b01cc64d8bb6d878882ff8da3e8966d","node_id":"C_kwDOSo2_sdoAKGZkN2FhYThhN2IwMWNjNjRkOGJiNmQ4Nzg4ODJmZjhkYTNlODk2NmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commit/c631225430f0e115199a2e0360a2c93e56bc49d6","sha":"c631225430f0e115199a2e0360a2c93e56bc49d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/c631225430f0e115199a2e0360a2c93e56bc49d6"}],"sha":"fd7aaa8a7b01cc64d8bb6d878882ff8da3e8966d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/fd7aaa8a7b01cc64d8bb6d878882ff8da3e8966d"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/c631225430f0e115199a2e0360a2c93e56bc49d6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-21T10:18:01Z","email":"home@imac.com","name":"HomeIMAC"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-21T10:18:01Z","email":"home@imac.com","name":"HomeIMAC"},"message":"feat: brute-force lockout + self-service & forced password change (Batch 1: #6, #4)\n\n#6 Login hardening:\n- After 5 consecutive failed logins an account is locked for 15 min (423).\n  LoginAttemptService records failures/success in its own transaction so it\n  works under the read-only login path. Successful login / admin reset clears it.\n\n#4 Accounts / passwords (local, no e-mail):\n- POST /auth/change-password lets a logged-in user change their own password.\n- New users (form + CSV import) and admin password resets set mustChangePassword;\n  the login response carries the flag and the UI forces a change before continuing\n  (ChangePasswordModal). A \"Passwort ändern\" action is also in the navbar.\n- Migration V15 adds failed_login_attempts, locked_until, must_change_password.\n\nVerified: 5 wrong logins -> 6th = 423; created user mustChangePassword=true ->\nforced modal -> change (wrong old 400 / correct 200) -> flag cleared; live UI OK.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fcc0e7c1997e68145a87c8968e502a403af64e64","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/git/trees/fcc0e7c1997e68145a87c8968e502a403af64e64"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/git/commits/c631225430f0e115199a2e0360a2c93e56bc49d6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commit/c631225430f0e115199a2e0360a2c93e56bc49d6","node_id":"C_kwDOSo2_sdoAKGM2MzEyMjU0MzBmMGUxMTUxOTlhMmUwMzYwYTJjOTNlNTZiYzQ5ZDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commit/25e467dca3b4f7ad4c672ff474003d951a866854","sha":"25e467dca3b4f7ad4c672ff474003d951a866854","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/25e467dca3b4f7ad4c672ff474003d951a866854"}],"sha":"c631225430f0e115199a2e0360a2c93e56bc49d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/c631225430f0e115199a2e0360a2c93e56bc49d6"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/25e467dca3b4f7ad4c672ff474003d951a866854/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-20T21:27:20Z","email":"home@imac.com","name":"HomeIMAC"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-20T21:27:20Z","email":"home@imac.com","name":"HomeIMAC"},"message":"feat: fix template download, restrict instructor roles, sort users; simplify UX\n\nFixes:\n- CSV template download now goes through the authenticated api client (blob),\n  not a plain <a href> that could not send the JWT (was 401). (UserManager)\n- Instructors may only create STUDENTS: backend forces role=STUDENT on createUser\n  (already) and on CSV import (now); the role field is hidden/locked for\n  instructors in the UI. Admins keep full role choice. (UserController, UserManager)\n- User list can be sorted by creation date (newest/oldest/name) with a new\n  \"Erstellt\" column; added createdAt to the User type. (UserManager, types)\n\nUX simplification (progressive disclosure):\n- Instructor panel: 8 flat tabs -> 4 primary (Aufgaben, Studenten, Ankündigungen,\n  Statistiken) + a collapsible \"Erweitert\" group (Schemas, Datenbanken, Kurse,\n  Audit). (InstructorDashboard)\n- Assignment wizard step 1 shows only Name + Deadline; DB connection, publish date\n  and late-penalty move under an \"Erweiterte Einstellungen\" expander with sane\n  defaults. Question partial-mark weights stay behind their existing toggle.\n  (AssignmentManager)\n\nVerified live (Chrome MCP) + role enforcement via API; template GET -> 200.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8936560153d4469e2bdd54a53f3b265549fc3fdd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/git/trees/8936560153d4469e2bdd54a53f3b265549fc3fdd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/git/commits/25e467dca3b4f7ad4c672ff474003d951a866854","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commit/25e467dca3b4f7ad4c672ff474003d951a866854","node_id":"C_kwDOSo2_sdoAKDI1ZTQ2N2RjYTNiNGY3YWQ0YzY3MmZmNDc0MDAzZDk1MWE4NjY4NTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commit/746bb472f440c6fccfe55487ca98a248910888a8","sha":"746bb472f440c6fccfe55487ca98a248910888a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/746bb472f440c6fccfe55487ca98a248910888a8"}],"sha":"25e467dca3b4f7ad4c672ff474003d951a866854","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/25e467dca3b4f7ad4c672ff474003d951a866854"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/746bb472f440c6fccfe55487ca98a248910888a8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-20T20:42:19Z","email":"home@imac.com","name":"HomeIMAC"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-20T20:42:19Z","email":"home@imac.com","name":"HomeIMAC"},"message":"fix: map unmatched routes/methods to 404/405 instead of 500\n\nAfter removing the dead /schemas endpoints, hitting an unknown path or wrong\nmethod surfaced as 500 (NoResourceFoundException / HttpRequestMethodNotSupported\nhit the generic handler). GlobalExceptionHandler now maps:\n- NoResourceFoundException -> 404\n- HttpRequestMethodNotSupportedException -> 405\n\nVerified: /schemas/datasets GET -> 405, /schemas/sample-data/upload POST -> 404,\nunknown path -> 404; edge-case + API-matrix regression scans clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6e8e1030c3dcb20a8b9b3efb76900662697388f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/git/trees/6e8e1030c3dcb20a8b9b3efb76900662697388f6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/git/commits/746bb472f440c6fccfe55487ca98a248910888a8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commit/746bb472f440c6fccfe55487ca98a248910888a8","node_id":"C_kwDOSo2_sdoAKDc0NmJiNDcyZjQ0MGM2ZmNjZmU1NTQ4N2NhOThhMjQ4OTEwODg4YTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commit/796555ba8057c56d50ea76ac149d467e7f4b9ec9","sha":"796555ba8057c56d50ea76ac149d467e7f4b9ec9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/796555ba8057c56d50ea76ac149d467e7f4b9ec9"}],"sha":"746bb472f440c6fccfe55487ca98a248910888a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/746bb472f440c6fccfe55487ca98a248910888a8"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/796555ba8057c56d50ea76ac149d467e7f4b9ec9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-20T20:35:22Z","email":"home@imac.com","name":"HomeIMAC"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-20T20:35:22Z","email":"home@imac.com","name":"HomeIMAC"},"message":"chore: remove dead/misleading features and tighten access (cleanup pass)\n\nDocumented in docs/CLEANUP-REMOVE.md and docs/FEATURE-ROADMAP.md.\n\nRemoved (dead / misleading / no-op):\n- GET /schemas/datasets (returned hardcoded dummy list).\n- POST /schemas/sample-data/upload + its SchemaManager UI (read the file and\n  discarded it, but reported success).\n- \"Eigene Mutante testen\" in the Dataset Playground (mutantQuery was ignored by\n  the engine — a no-op).\n\nTightened access (least privilege):\n- Audit logs are ADMIN-only now (were ADMIN+INSTRUCTOR); they contain\n  system-wide security events. (Impersonation was already ADMIN-only.)\n- Swagger / OpenAPI docs now require authentication instead of permitAll.\n\nScoped down for a local school deployment:\n- Admin \"System\" dashboard (CPU/RAM/Disk/Uptime monitoring) removed — that is\n  the sysadmin''s job, not the LMS''s.\n- \"SQL-Labor\" (partial-marking diagnostic) is now instructor/admin only; it made\n  no sense for students.\n\nAdds docs/FEATURE-ROADMAP.md (missing features for a complete local learning app)\nand docs/CLEANUP-REMOVE.md (this cleanup list).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"74b0ed50671ff9b784e12ce66ecc48a96b1d17aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/git/trees/74b0ed50671ff9b784e12ce66ecc48a96b1d17aa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/git/commits/796555ba8057c56d50ea76ac149d467e7f4b9ec9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commit/796555ba8057c56d50ea76ac149d467e7f4b9ec9","node_id":"C_kwDOSo2_sdoAKDc5NjU1NWJhODA1N2M1NmQ1MGVhNzZhYzE0OWQ0NjdlN2Y0YjllYzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commit/1daaa8aa13e0b7fa7c1a202730111a44f8a37f28","sha":"1daaa8aa13e0b7fa7c1a202730111a44f8a37f28","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/1daaa8aa13e0b7fa7c1a202730111a44f8a37f28"}],"sha":"796555ba8057c56d50ea76ac149d467e7f4b9ec9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/796555ba8057c56d50ea76ac149d467e7f4b9ec9"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/1daaa8aa13e0b7fa7c1a202730111a44f8a37f28/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-20T20:11:10Z","email":"home@imac.com","name":"HomeIMAC"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-20T20:11:10Z","email":"home@imac.com","name":"HomeIMAC"},"message":"fix: resolve 7 bugs from full UI+backend QA pass\n\nSecurity:\n- Stop leaking the reference solution (instructorQuery) to students: the\n  student questions endpoint now returns a sanitized view (id/name/marks only),\n  and GET /admin/questions/{id} is restricted to ADMIN/INSTRUCTOR.\n\nRobustness — bad input now returns proper 4xx instead of 500:\n- Wrong password on login returned 500 (failed-login audit INSERT ran in a\n  read-only transaction). AuditService.log now runs REQUIRES_NEW and is\n  best-effort, so auditing never breaks the request.\n- GlobalExceptionHandler maps validation / type-mismatch / unreadable-body to\n  400 and NoSuchElement to 404; submit guards missing body.\n- GET /db-connections (admin findAll) returned 500 via LazyInitializationException\n  on the lazy course proxy during serialization (OSIV off). course is now\n  @JsonIgnore''d and courseId is materialized inside the session.\n\nVerified: edge-case re-scan 19/19 expected 4xx, API matrix shows no anomalies\nand correct permission boundaries, UI flows (student/instructor/admin) work with\nno JS errors. Adds api_bug_scan.py, edge_scan.py and bug-scan-report.md.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b00b7de1ac86454699fcd471eb25d643aa7b782b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/git/trees/b00b7de1ac86454699fcd471eb25d643aa7b782b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/git/commits/1daaa8aa13e0b7fa7c1a202730111a44f8a37f28","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commit/1daaa8aa13e0b7fa7c1a202730111a44f8a37f28","node_id":"C_kwDOSo2_sdoAKDFkYWFhOGFhMTNlMGI3ZmE3YzFhMjAyNzMwMTExYTQ0ZjhhMzdmMjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commit/fb5dce7bf09d69cc3d98a945c59a4aa6212b2251","sha":"fb5dce7bf09d69cc3d98a945c59a4aa6212b2251","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/fb5dce7bf09d69cc3d98a945c59a4aa6212b2251"}],"sha":"1daaa8aa13e0b7fa7c1a202730111a44f8a37f28","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/1daaa8aa13e0b7fa7c1a202730111a44f8a37f28"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/fb5dce7bf09d69cc3d98a945c59a4aa6212b2251/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-20T19:06:21Z","email":"home@imac.com","name":"HomeIMAC"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-20T19:06:21Z","email":"home@imac.com","name":"HomeIMAC"},"message":"feat: professional UI redesign + Dataset Playground hardening\n\nFrontend redesign (cohesive design system, dark-first, indigo brand + amber XP):\n- Extend the design-system primitives in index.html (buttons, inputs, table,\n  badges, tabs, modal, empty-state, section headers).\n- Full redesign of the Instructor & Admin dashboard shells and UserManager\n  (kicker/display headings, branded nav, x-card/x-input/btn-* primitives,\n  semantic role/status badges, clean tables, honest empty states).\n- Harmonize the remaining components (SqlLab, DatasetPlayground, Assignment\n  Manager/Stats, Schema/DbConnection managers, AuditLog, modals) onto the\n  system (ink surfaces, indigo brand, rounded-2xl, lighter weights).\n\nDataset Playground hardening (UX & robustness; deep engine quality is a\nseparate follow-up documented in the report):\n- Controller returns 422 with a clear user-facing message instead of 500 /\n  misleading success=true on empty results (no internal-docs reference).\n- runEngine acquires the engine lock with tryLock(60s) so one slow/stuck\n  generation can no longer make every request hang.\n- Frontend shows honest empty/error states and marks the custom-mutant path\n  as experimental (it is currently a no-op in the engine).\n\nAdds a semantic stress-test harness (docs/audit/dsp_stress_test.py) and report\n(docs/audit/dataset-playground-stress-report.md) covering 181 cases across 6\nschema shapes x 7 mutation types + custom mutants, plus redesign/UX screenshots.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c3d3979cc1adc5d9e62fdd7b85e16457e13c1684","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/git/trees/c3d3979cc1adc5d9e62fdd7b85e16457e13c1684"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/git/commits/fb5dce7bf09d69cc3d98a945c59a4aa6212b2251","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commit/fb5dce7bf09d69cc3d98a945c59a4aa6212b2251","node_id":"C_kwDOSo2_sdoAKGZiNWRjZTdiZjA5ZDY5Y2MzZDk4YTk0NWM1OWE0YWE2MjEyYjIyNTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commit/038d4f7c6c9021b4bb7210719bc5e45ed2af00c2","sha":"038d4f7c6c9021b4bb7210719bc5e45ed2af00c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/038d4f7c6c9021b4bb7210719bc5e45ed2af00c2"}],"sha":"fb5dce7bf09d69cc3d98a945c59a4aa6212b2251","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/fb5dce7bf09d69cc3d98a945c59a4aa6212b2251"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/038d4f7c6c9021b4bb7210719bc5e45ed2af00c2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-20T17:22:07Z","email":"home@imac.com","name":"HomeIMAC"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-20T17:24:18Z","email":"home@imac.com","name":"HomeIMAC"},"message":"fix: repair core flows (grading WS, stats, user edit, dataset playground) + audit\n\nFunctional fixes verified live via Chrome DevTools across all roles:\n\n- Real-time grading: permit /ws-grading/** handshake (was 403); return loginId\n  in login response (client subscribed to /topic/grading/undefined); robust\n  WebSocketService (fresh SockJS per attempt, re-subscribe on reconnect); add a\n  \"grading…\" state so the result panel no longer flashes a stale 0%.\n- Async grading race: trigger evaluateSubmissionAsync after tx commit\n  (TransactionSynchronization) — fixes intermittent \"Submission not found\".\n- Instructor statistics: aggregate overview/summary client-side from existing\n  submission endpoints (the /summary and /analytics endpoints don''t exist / 500).\n- Admin edit user: derive courseIds from the returned courses (column + modal\n  checkboxes), and read the PUT body as a Map so course assignments persist\n  (entity binding silently dropped courseIds and wiped assignments on save).\n- Dataset Playground killing-data generation: make the legacy Z3 enum-sort\n  declarations idempotent and reset the static Z3 context per run — fixes\n  \"enumeration sort name is already declared\"; now emits real INSERTs.\n- assign-course: return 400 instead of silently no-op''ing on an unknown id.\n- DB connections: reject the system database at save time (not only at\n  assignment use).\n- Assignment wizard: only advance/close after a successful save.\n- Security: stop serializing the BCrypt password hash (WRITE_ONLY).\n- UX: remove duplicate instructor tab bar; replace the forbidden instructor\n  \"create course\" form with a read-only course list; drop a dead delete button.\n- Add frontend/.dockerignore so prod builds don''t reuse stale local artifacts.\n- Add REQUIREMENTS.md (full SaaS-readiness audit) + docs/audit screenshots.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2487e6c84e5216b25fd0b8b43edaee2074b1806d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/git/trees/2487e6c84e5216b25fd0b8b43edaee2074b1806d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/git/commits/038d4f7c6c9021b4bb7210719bc5e45ed2af00c2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commit/038d4f7c6c9021b4bb7210719bc5e45ed2af00c2","node_id":"C_kwDOSo2_sdoAKDAzOGQ0ZjdjNmM5MDIxYjRiYjcyMTA3MTliYzVlNDVlZDJhZjAwYzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commit/6e37e1a9be35b78faa2b2ae23b194618290e2630","sha":"6e37e1a9be35b78faa2b2ae23b194618290e2630","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/6e37e1a9be35b78faa2b2ae23b194618290e2630"}],"sha":"038d4f7c6c9021b4bb7210719bc5e45ed2af00c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/038d4f7c6c9021b4bb7210719bc5e45ed2af00c2"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielshahini/xdata-web-modernized/commits/6e37e1a9be35b78faa2b2ae23b194618290e2630/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-20T12:52:03Z","email":"home@imac.co