NGZmOTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SakthivelSwe/dev-mastery/commit/2c9b2e5f9f9e288c61b0344ee6eff2e2f163e367","sha":"2c9b2e5f9f9e288c61b0344ee6eff2e2f163e367","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SakthivelSwe/dev-mastery/commits/2c9b2e5f9f9e288c61b0344ee6eff2e2f163e367"}],"sha":"6cdade43432d9035c55c8884d829f282aee4ff96","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SakthivelSwe/dev-mastery/commits/6cdade43432d9035c55c8884d829f282aee4ff96"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/209765993?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sakthi-anbu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sakthi-anbu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sakthi-anbu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sakthi-anbu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sakthi-anbu","id":209765993,"login":"sakthi-anbu","node_id":"U_kgDODIDGaQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sakthi-anbu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sakthi-anbu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sakthi-anbu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sakthi-anbu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sakthi-anbu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sakthi-anbu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SakthivelSwe/dev-mastery/commits/2c9b2e5f9f9e288c61b0344ee6eff2e2f163e367/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-06T08:50:36Z","email":"Anbu.Ramamoorthy@nice.com","name":"sakthi-anbu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-06T08:50:36Z","email":"Anbu.Ramamoorthy@nice.com","name":"sakthi-anbu"},"message":"fix(web): make certificate verify page params a Promise (Next.js 15)\n\nRoot cause: Cloudflare Pages runs ''next build'' which enforces the Next.js 15 App Router type contract where params is Promise<T>. The /certificates/verify/[credentialId] page still used the pre-v15 sync shape ({ credentialId: string }) so the build failed:\n\n  Type ''{ params: { credentialId: string; }; }'' does not satisfy the constraint ''PageProps''.  Type ''{ credentialId: string; }'' is missing the following properties from type ''Promise<any>'': then, catch, finally, [Symbol.toStringTag]\n\nFix: change both generateMetadata and CertificateVerifyPage to accept params: Promise<{ credentialId: string }>, then const { credentialId } = await params before use. Matches the pattern already used by /interview/history/[id].","tree":{"sha":"f0a9645679c16d76a72f85a51d49e0cf20b1bb30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SakthivelSwe/dev-mastery/git/trees/f0a9645679c16d76a72f85a51d49e0cf20b1bb30"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SakthivelSwe/dev-mastery/git/commits/2c9b2e5f9f9e288c61b0344ee6eff2e2f163e367","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/209765993?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sakthi-anbu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sakthi-anbu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sakthi-anbu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sakthi-anbu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sakthi-anbu","id":209765993,"login":"sakthi-anbu","node_id":"U_kgDODIDGaQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sakthi-anbu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sakthi-anbu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sakthi-anbu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sakthi-anbu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sakthi-anbu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sakthi-anbu","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SakthivelSwe/dev-mastery/commit/2c9b2e5f9f9e288c61b0344ee6eff2e2f163e367","node_id":"C_kwDOSpCdxNoAKDJjOWIyZTVmOWY5ZTI4OGM2MWIwMzQ0ZWU2ZWZmMmUyZjE2M2UzNjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SakthivelSwe/dev-mastery/commit/bb76f47924a4d0190b04c5008e80ca54ef03d226","sha":"bb76f47924a4d0190b04c5008e80ca54ef03d226","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SakthivelSwe/dev-mastery/commits/bb76f47924a4d0190b04c5008e80ca54ef03d226"}],"sha":"2c9b2e5f9f9e288c61b0344ee6eff2e2f163e367","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SakthivelSwe/dev-mastery/commits/2c9b2e5f9f9e288c61b0344ee6eff2e2f163e367"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/209765993?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sakthi-anbu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sakthi-anbu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sakthi-anbu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sakthi-anbu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sakthi-anbu","id":209765993,"login":"sakthi-anbu","node_id":"U_kgDODIDGaQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sakthi-anbu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sakthi-anbu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sakthi-anbu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sakthi-anbu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sakthi-anbu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sakthi-anbu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SakthivelSwe/dev-mastery/commits/bb76f47924a4d0190b04c5008e80ca54ef03d226/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-06T07:35:05Z","email":"Anbu.Ramamoorthy@nice.com","name":"sakthi-anbu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-06T07:35:36Z","email":"Anbu.Ramamoorthy@nice.com","name":"sakthi-anbu"},"message":"fix(web): Cloudflare Pages build + sidebar missing Projects path\n\nFix 1 (Cloudflare build was failing since commit 6820bb2):\n\nThe /admin/content-health page imported node:fs/promises + node:path at module scope to read apps/web/content/_audit/health.json. Cloudflare Pages runs Next.js on the edge runtime where node:* schemes are banned, so the entire build failed with ''UnhandledSchemeError: Reading from node:fs/promises is not handled by plugins''.\n\nFix: move the audit artifacts from apps/web/content/_audit/ (repo-only) to apps/web/public/_audit/ (served as a static asset), rewrite the admin page as a client component that fetches /_audit/health.json at runtime. audit-content-health.js and .github/workflows/content-health.yml both point at the new path.\n\nFix 2 (sidebar missed the Projects path):\n\nThe Sidebar''s PATHS array was hard-coded and never included the ''projects'' learning path added in Round 5. Added a ''Real-World Projects'' entry with the FlaskConical icon and #F97316 accent, in a new ''Projects'' group at the bottom of the group list.","tree":{"sha":"ebdf7ab91619b4105ac29ee0aff5add7913d469d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SakthivelSwe/dev-mastery/git/trees/ebdf7ab91619b4105ac29ee0aff5add7913d469d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SakthivelSwe/dev-mastery/git/commits/bb76f47924a4d0190b04c5008e80ca54ef03d226","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/209765993?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sakthi-anbu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sakthi-anbu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sakthi-anbu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sakthi-anbu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sakthi-anbu","id":209765993,"login":"sakthi-anbu","node_id":"U_kgDODIDGaQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sakthi-anbu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://