dge0-based com.devmastery.execute.ExecuteController, but forgot to delete the old package. Both classes mapped POST /v1/execute, so Spring Boot bailed out with ''Ambiguous mapping. Cannot map executeController method ...: There is already executionController bean method ... mapped.'' and Render exited with status 1.\n\nFix: delete the entire com/devmastery/execute/ package (ExecuteController, ExecuteRequest, ExecuteResponse, Judge0Dtos). The frontend /api/execute edge route already sends { source, language, stdin } which matches the new ExecutionController''s shape (and falls back to Piston for other languages). All 22 tests still pass.","tree":{"sha":"32b4db2aae9c0fd3a69b046b30becb3fbb8c1d78","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SakthivelSwe/dev-mastery/git/trees/32b4db2aae9c0fd3a69b046b30becb3fbb8c1d78"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SakthivelSwe/dev-mastery/git/commits/b26153417a223637a3d35541cca5f0edbe439be2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/209765993?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sakthi-anbu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sakthi-anbu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sakthi-anbu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sakthi-anbu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sakthi-anbu","id":209765993,"login":"sakthi-anbu","node_id":"U_kgDODIDGaQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sakthi-anbu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sakthi-anbu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sakthi-anbu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sakthi-anbu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sakthi-anbu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sakthi-anbu","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SakthivelSwe/dev-mastery/commit/b26153417a223637a3d35541cca5f0edbe439be2","node_id":"C_kwDOSpCdxNoAKGIyNjE1MzQxN2EyMjM2MzdhM2QzNTU0MWNjYTVmMGVkYmU0MzliZTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SakthivelSwe/dev-mastery/commit/066fa7437a80dd34f40eff2a77bd058dad95bc4f","sha":"066fa7437a80dd34f40eff2a77bd058dad95bc4f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SakthivelSwe/dev-mastery/commits/066fa7437a80dd34f40eff2a77bd058dad95bc4f"}],"sha":"b26153417a223637a3d35541cca5f0edbe439be2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SakthivelSwe/dev-mastery/commits/b26153417a223637a3d35541cca5f0edbe439be2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/209765993?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sakthi-anbu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sakthi-anbu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sakthi-anbu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sakthi-anbu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sakthi-anbu","id":209765993,"login":"sakthi-anbu","node_id":"U_kgDODIDGaQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sakthi-anbu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sakthi-anbu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sakthi-anbu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sakthi-anbu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sakthi-anbu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sakthi-anbu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SakthivelSwe/dev-mastery/commits/066fa7437a80dd34f40eff2a77bd058dad95bc4f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-06T06:54:50Z","email":"Anbu.Ramamoorthy@nice.com","name":"sakthi-anbu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-06T06:54:50Z","email":"Anbu.Ramamoorthy@nice.com","name":"sakthi-anbu"},"message":"fix(v33): remove RLS + auth.uid() policies causing Render startup crash\n\nRoot cause: On Supabase, Flyway connects via the pooler role (postgres.<project>), which cannot execute ALTER TABLE ... ENABLE ROW LEVEL SECURITY on public-schema tables. The whole V33 migration transaction rolled back, Spring Boot startup failed with ''Migration V33 failed'', and Render instances exited with status 1 (see dashboard events for commit bfb3d71).\n\nFix: Drop RLS, policies, and the updated_at trigger. Table + FK + indexes are enough — matches the proven V32 pattern. Auth is already enforced by the Spring backend in CommentServiceImpl.requireOwned() and the SecurityConfig JWT filter; the client never talks to Supabase directly for /v1/comments/**.\n\nV33 was never successfully applied (transactional rollback on failure), so no schema_history row exists on Render — this fixed V33 will be applied fresh on the next deploy.","tree":{"sha":"ba9b05bc92c7c7f756e8f7bbdc7bc406fdde4350","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SakthivelSwe/dev-mastery/git/trees/ba9b05bc92c7c7f756e8f7bbdc7bc406fdde4350"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SakthivelSwe/dev-mastery/git/commits/066fa7437a80dd34f40eff2a77bd058dad95bc4f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/209765993?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sakthi-anbu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sakthi-anbu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sakthi-anbu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sakthi-anbu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sakthi-anbu","id":209765993,"login":"sakthi-anbu","node_id":"U_kgDODIDGaQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sakthi-anbu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sakthi-anbu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sakthi-anbu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sakthi-anbu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sakthi-anbu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sakthi-anbu","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SakthivelSwe/dev-mastery/commit/066fa7437a80dd34f40eff2a77bd058dad95bc4f","node_id":"C_kwDOSpCdxNoAKDA2NmZhNzQzN2E4MGRkMzRmNDBlZmYyYTc3YmQwNThkYWQ5NWJjNGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SakthivelSwe/dev-mastery/commit/578959ea9ee0d2640fff9a2ec443ea4c79d43e08","sha":"578959ea9ee0d2640fff9a2ec443ea4c79d43e08","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SakthivelSwe/dev-mastery/commits/578959ea9ee0d2640fff9a2ec443ea4c79d43e08"}],"sha":"066fa7437a80dd34f40eff2a77bd058dad95bc4f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SakthivelSwe/dev-mastery/commits/066fa7437a80dd34f40eff2a77bd058dad95bc4f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/209765993?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sakthi-anbu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sakthi-anbu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sakthi-anbu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sakthi-anbu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sakthi-anbu","id":209765993,"login":"sakthi-anbu","node_id":"U_kgDODIDGaQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sakthi-anbu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sakthi-anbu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sakthi-anbu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sakthi-anbu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sakthi-anbu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sakthi-anbu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SakthivelSwe/dev-mastery/commits/578959ea9ee0d2640fff9a2ec443ea4c79d43e08/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-06T06:23:46Z","email":"Anbu.Ramamoorthy@nice.com","name":"sakthi-anbu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-06T06:23:46Z","email":"Anbu.Ramamoorthy@nice.com","name":"sakthi-anbu"},"message":"feat(round7): PDF certificates (iText7 + QR) and community discussion threads\n\nPDF certificates: iText7 A4-landscape PDF with learner name, path title, stats strip and ZXing QR code. Generated asynchronously via CertificatePdfListener (@Async @EventListener) after issue(), uploaded to Supabase Storage ''certificates'' bucket, pdf_url written back. Frontend polls every 4s for URL. StorageService gains uploadBytes() to bypass 200KB multipart cap. app.base-url configurable via env.\n\nCommunity discussion threads: V33 migration adds topic_comments + comment_upvotes tables with full RLS policies. New community module (api/internal/web): CommentService with listTopLevel/listReplies/post/edit(15-min grace)/soft-delete/toggleUpvote/flag. 7 REST endpoints under /v1/comments; GET is public. Frontend DiscussionPanel: collapsible, threaded, paginated, inline edit/delete, upvote toggle, flag. Lazy-loaded on lesson pages via next/dynamic.\n\nSecurityConfig: permit /v1/certificates/verify/** and GET /v1/comments/** without auth.\n\n22 backend tests passing (added 4 PDF generator tests). Zero TypeScript errors.","tree":{"sha":"4f161acd907eb202750f96b03338496229d12fee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SakthivelSwe/dev-mastery/git/trees/4f161acd907eb202750f96b03338496229d12fee"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SakthivelSwe/dev-mastery/git/commits/578959ea9ee0d2640fff9a2ec443ea4c79d43e08","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/209765993?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sakthi-anbu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sakthi-anbu/followers","following_url":"https://api