ommitter":{"date":"2026-07-06T05:00:25Z","email":"Anbu.Ramamoorthy@nice.com","name":"sakthi-anbu"},"message":"feat(round5): interviews, review, studio, certs, projects, PWA, CI, adaptive quiz\n## Features shipped (Round 5 — July 6 2026)\n### Content\n- 10 real-world project topics in \\\u0007pps/web/content/projects/\\:\n  LRU Cache, JWT Auth, URL Shortener, Rate Limiter, Chat, Task Manager,\n  Thread Pool, Mini IoC Container, Search Engine, Message Broker.\n  All at 100/100 content-health score (9-section schema, code progression,\n  6 interview Q&As, 5 Feynman checks, 12 spaced-review items).\n### Frontend (apps/web)\n- \\/review\\ — SM-2 spaced-repetition recall queue with 1–5 rating buttons\n- \\/interview\\ — AI mock interviewer (reuses /v1/ai/chat SSE, interviewer\n  system-prompt priming, finish → scorecard → persist to history)\n- \\/interview/history\\ — list past sessions with verdict pills\n- \\/interview/history/[id]\\ — full session: transcript bubbles + scorecard\n- \\/system-design/studio\\ — Capacity Estimator (back-of-envelope math) +\n  Requirements Workshop (4 case studies: URL Shortener, Chat, News Feed,\n  Ride-Sharing)\n- \\/profile/certificates\\ — claim + list earned certificates\n- \\/certificates/verify/[credentialId]\\ — public verification (no auth)\n- \\/offline\\ — PWA offline fallback page\n- \\/admin/content-health\\ — visualise health.json audit report\n- \\src/components/interview/ScoreCardPanel\\ — structured scorecard UI\n- \\src/lib/api.ts\\ — interview session CRUD + spaced review helpers\n- Sidebar footer: Dashboard · Spaced Review · Mock Interview · Design Studio\n  · My Certificates\n- \\\next.config.mjs\\ — PWA with StaleWhileRevalidate content cache (500\n  entries / 30 days) + NetworkFirst for user endpoints + offline fallback\n### Backend (services/devmastery-core)\n- V29 migration: streak_freeze column on user_streak\n- V30 migration: interview_sessions table (JSONB transcript + scorecard)\n- V31 migration: projects learning path seed\n- V32 migration: certificates table + quiz_difficulty table\n- \\InterviewService\\ / \\InterviewServiceImpl\\ / \\InterviewController\\\n  POST /v1/interviews, GET /v1/interviews, GET /v1/interviews/{id},\n  POST /v1/interviews/{id}/grade\n- \\CertificateService\\ / \\CertificateServiceImpl\\ / \\CertificateController\\\n  POST /v1/certificates/{pathSlug}, GET /v1/certificates,\n  GET /v1/certificates/verify/{credentialId} (public)\n- \\QuizDifficultyEntity\\ + \\QuizDifficultyRepository\\ — per-user per-topic\n  adaptive difficulty (auto ±1 after 5 attempts, < 60% → down, > 85% → up)\n- \\AiRateLimiter\\ + \\AiRateLimitExceptionHandler\\ — 100 req/day per user\n- \\StreakRules\\ — freeze-token logic extracted to pure utility class\n- \\UserStreakEntity\\ — freezeTokens field + consumeFreeze() method\n- ProgressService constructor arity fix (freezeCount propagation)\n- 18 unit tests: 3 rate-limit + 5 interview-parser + 10 streak-rules\n### CI / DevOps\n- \\.github/workflows/backend-tests.yml\\ — \\./gradlew test\\ on every backend PR\n- \\.github/workflows/content-health.yml\\ — content audit on every PR, fail\n  below score 70, surface auto-fix candidates\n### Repo hygiene\n- Move legacy root-level spec/roadmap files to \\docs/archive/\\\n- \\docs/ROADMAP.md\\ — single source of truth (this file)\n- Move one-off debug/check scripts to \\scripts/legacy/\\\n- \\scripts/audit-content-health.js\\, \\\u0007uto-fix-content.js\\,\n  \\\u0007pply-auto-fixes.js\\ — new content tooling with test suite","tree":{"sha":"eefbe99e1bacf0f3adfda458f77d02f86e69a05b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SakthivelSwe/dev-mastery/git/trees/eefbe99e1bacf0f3adfda458f77d02f86e69a05b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SakthivelSwe/dev-mastery/git/commits/af71f0b87d16edf2949d633de13d7eb94e6b24d1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20976