07a8e41e8f5f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-23T14:39:24Z","email":"dev@devmastery.local","name":"DevMastery Dev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-23T14:39:24Z","email":"dev@devmastery.local","name":"DevMastery Dev"},"message":"feat(backend): self-ping scheduler to prevent Render free-tier sleep\n\nAdds @Scheduled keep-alive that runs SELECT 1 every 14 minutes (fixedDelay=840000ms) starting 5 minutes after startup. Keeps both the Render instance and the Supabase connection pool active without any env variable changes. Enables @EnableScheduling on the main application class.","tree":{"sha":"ee548ba88bcb0a0b18c56d4de721e6092a9c89d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SakthivelSwe/dev-mastery/git/trees/ee548ba88bcb0a0b18c56d4de721e6092a9c89d1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SakthivelSwe/dev-mastery/git/commits/6a4fbf113392826cdeaa5f77bfb807a8e41e8f5f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/SakthivelSwe/dev-mastery/commit/6a4fbf113392826cdeaa5f77bfb807a8e41e8f5f","node_id":"C_kwDOSpCdxNoAKDZhNGZiZjExMzM5MjgyNmNkZWFhNWY3N2JmYjgwN2E4ZTQxZThmNWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SakthivelSwe/dev-mastery/commit/85a6e2d2669b3e228ffde87e9776ae78728f3ab8","sha":"85a6e2d2669b3e228ffde87e9776ae78728f3ab8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SakthivelSwe/dev-mastery/commits/85a6e2d2669b3e228ffde87e9776ae78728f3ab8"}],"sha":"6a4fbf113392826cdeaa5f77bfb807a8e41e8f5f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SakthivelSwe/dev-mastery/commits/6a4fbf113392826cdeaa5f77bfb807a8e41e8f5f"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SakthivelSwe/dev-mastery/commits/85a6e2d2669b3e228ffde87e9776ae78728f3ab8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-23T14:34:18Z","email":"dev@devmastery.local","name":"DevMastery Dev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-23T14:34:18Z","email":"dev@devmastery.local","name":"DevMastery Dev"},"message":"fix: remove [triggers] from wrangler.toml — not supported in Cloudflare Pages","tree":{"sha":"24c98cf0896e3864df5b342b702bd8a447136ba5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SakthivelSwe/dev-mastery/git/trees/24c98cf0896e3864df5b342b702bd8a447136ba5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SakthivelSwe/dev-mastery/git/commits/85a6e2d2669b3e228ffde87e9776ae78728f3ab8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/SakthivelSwe/dev-mastery/commit/85a6e2d2669b3e228ffde87e9776ae78728f3ab8","node_id":"C_kwDOSpCdxNoAKDg1YTZlMmQyNjY5YjNlMjI4ZmZkZTg3ZTk3NzZhZTc4NzI4ZjNhYjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SakthivelSwe/dev-mastery/commit/45efca326005d4d901666e6aae2935be9792d4b6","sha":"45efca326005d4d901666e6aae2935be9792d4b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SakthivelSwe/dev-mastery/commits/45efca326005d4d901666e6aae2935be9792d4b6"}],"sha":"85a6e2d2669b3e228ffde87e9776ae78728f3ab8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SakthivelSwe/dev-mastery/commits/85a6e2d2669b3e228ffde87e9776ae78728f3ab8"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SakthivelSwe/dev-mastery/commits/45efca326005d4d901666e6aae2935be9792d4b6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-23T14:05:21Z","email":"dev@devmastery.local","name":"DevMastery Dev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-23T14:05:21Z","email":"dev@devmastery.local","name":"DevMastery Dev"},"message":"feat: keep-alive scheduler to prevent Render free-tier sleep\n\nRender free tier sleeps after 15 min idle. Three-layer fix:\n\n1. /api/keepalive edge route — Cloudflare Cron Trigger pings it every 14 min\n\n2. wrangler.toml [triggers] crons = [''*/14 * * * *''] wires the Cloudflare cron\n\n3. useBackendWarmup hook — fires immediately on first page load (client-side)\n\n   and repeats every 13 min so the service stays warm between cron calls","tree":{"sha":"54d046563627d60e1ef51fdb2cce97270e356fc7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SakthivelSwe/dev-mastery/git/trees/54d046563627d60e1ef51fdb2cce97270e356fc7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SakthivelSwe/dev-mastery/git/commits/45efca326005d4d901666e6aae2935be9792d4b6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/SakthivelSwe/dev-mastery/commit/45efca326005d4d901666e6aae2935be9792d4b6","node_id":"C_kwDOSpCdxNoAKDQ1ZWZjYTMyNjAwNWQ0ZDkwMTY2NmU2YWFlMjkzNWJlOTc5MmQ0YjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SakthivelSwe/dev-mastery/commit/98c9f620ddffe946abf5aae2298207fed13a780f","sha":"98c9f620ddffe946abf5aae2298207fed13a780f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SakthivelSwe/dev-mastery/commits/98c9f620ddffe946abf5aae2298207fed13a780f"}],"sha":"45efca326005d4d901666e6aae2935be9792d4b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SakthivelSwe/dev-mastery/commits/45efca326005d4d901666e6aae2935be9792d4b6"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SakthivelSwe/dev-mastery/commits/98c9f620ddffe946abf5aae2298207fed13a780f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-23T13:51:48Z","email":"dev@devmastery.local","name":"DevMastery Dev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-23T13:51:48Z","email":"dev@devmastery.local","name":"DevMastery Dev"},"message":"fix(cloudflare): add edge runtime to /api/admin/ai-assist route","tree":{"sha":"511c5410a3fa079e94091498380b0bba06da2891","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SakthivelSwe/dev-mastery/git/trees/511c5410a3fa079e94091498380b0bba06da2891"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SakthivelSwe/dev-mastery/git/commits/98c9f620ddffe946abf5aae2298207fed13a780f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/SakthivelSwe/dev-mastery/commit/98c9f620ddffe946abf5aae2298207fed13a780f","node_id":"C_kwDOSpCdxNoAKDk4YzlmNjIwZGRmZmU5NDZhYmY1YWFlMjI5ODIwN2ZlZDEzYTc4MGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SakthivelSwe/dev-mastery/commit/e6d0af3700cc6d5b675bf1a4e9e60d965f262868","sha":"e6d0af3700cc6d5b675bf1a4e9e60d965f262868","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SakthivelSwe/dev-mastery/commits/e6d0af3700cc6d5b675bf1a4e9e60d965f262868"}],"sha":"98c9f620ddffe946abf5aae2298207fed13a780f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SakthivelSwe/dev-mastery/commits/98c9f620ddffe946abf5aae2298207fed13a780f"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SakthivelSwe/dev-mastery/commits/e6d0af3700cc6d5b675bf1a4e9e60d965f262868/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-23T13:49:43Z","email":"dev@devmastery.local","name":"DevMastery Dev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-23T13:49:43Z","email":"dev@devmastery.local","name":"DevMastery Dev"},"message":"fix: attach JWT to AI chat and Feynman requests (403 fix)\n\n- Add Authorization: Bearer header to /v1/ai/chat and /v1/ai/feynman/score. Backend requires auth for all /v1/ai/** routes (anyRequest().authenticated()). Previously the hooks sent no token so the server returned 403.\n\n- Fix request body field: ''message'' -> ''userQuery'' to match the backend ChatRequest record.\n\n- Show friendly ''Please sign in'' message for 401/403 instead of generic error.","tree":{"sha":"8a786e738126f4193ee15ece16fc492c3154ea59","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SakthivelSwe/dev-mastery/git/trees/8a786e738126f4193ee15ece16fc492c3154ea59"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SakthivelSwe/dev-mastery/git/commits/e6d0af3700cc6d5b675bf1a4e9e60d965f262868","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/SakthivelSwe/dev-mastery/commit/e6d0af3700cc6d5b675bf1a4e9e60d965f262868","node_id":"C_kwDOSpCdxNoAKGU2ZDBhZjM3MDBjYzZkNWI2NzViZjFhNGU5ZTYwZDk2NWYyNjI4Njg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SakthivelSwe/dev-mastery/commit/8aac5041e13278f7725dc90c87169d262654adfa","sha":"8aac5041e13278f7725dc90c87169d262654adfa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SakthivelSwe/dev-mastery/commits/8aac5041e13278f7725dc90c87169d262654adfa"}],"sha":"e6d0af3700cc6d5b675bf1a4e9e60d965f262868","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SakthivelSwe/dev-mastery/commits/e6d0af3700cc6d5b675bf1a4e9e60d965f262868"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SakthivelSwe/dev-mastery/commits/8aac5041e13278f7725dc90c87169d262654adfa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-23T13:41:44Z","email":"dev@devmastery.local","name":"DevMastery Dev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-23T13:41:44Z","email":"dev@devmastery.local","name":"DevMastery Dev"},"message":"fix(cloudflare): make all routes Edge-runtime compatible\n\nCloudflare Pages (@cloudflare/next-on-pages) requires every non-static route to run on the Edge runtime. Adding ''export const runtime = edge'' to the root layout propagates to every child route in one shot. Also stubs /api/admin/mdx-preview because next-mdx-remote/serialize relies on Node-only modules; admin preview now renders client-side via MarkdownView. Moves themeColor from metadata into viewport export (Next 15 requirement, fixes build warnings).","tree":{"sha":"e99813a089367deb97d851b5c31b32d86627926f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SakthivelSwe/dev-mastery/git/trees/e99813a089367deb97d851b5c31b32d86627926f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SakthivelSwe/dev-mastery/git/commits/8aac5041e13278f7725dc90c87169d262654adfa","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/SakthivelSwe/dev-mastery/commit/8aac5041e13278f7725dc90c87169d262654adfa","node_id":"C_kwDOSpCdxNoAKDhhYWM1MDQxZTEzMjc4Zjc3MjVkYzkwYzg3MTY5ZDI2MjY1NGFkZmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SakthivelSwe/dev-mastery/commit/3e9fb89cbc81be472667d2ec9d5726349446f530","sha":"3e9fb89cbc81be472667d2ec9d5726349446f530","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SakthivelSwe/dev-mastery/commits/3e9fb89cbc81be472667d2ec9d5726349446f530"}],"sha":"8aac5041e13278f7725dc90c87169d262654adfa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SakthivelSwe/dev-mastery/commits/8aac5041e13278f7725dc90c87169d262654adfa"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SakthivelSwe/dev-mastery/commits/3e9fb89cbc81be472667d2ec9d5726349446f530/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-23T13:29:03Z","email":"dev@devmastery.local","name":"DevMastery Dev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-23T13:29:03Z","email":"dev@devmastery.local","name":"DevMastery Dev"},"message":"fix(prod): relax Flyway validation to tolerate pre-existing Supabase migration history\n\nSupabase already contains V1-V26 applied by legacy tooling with checksums that don''t match the SQL files in this repo. Render''s prod profile was doing strict validation and refusing to start. Mirror the dev profile''s tolerance: validate-on-migrate=false, out-of-order=true, baseline-on-migrate=true. New migrations (V27, V28) still apply normally on top.","tree":{"sha":"852c44a8cb734e69e34ee894e5d110ddfb1d4221","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SakthivelSwe/dev-mastery/git/trees/852c44a8cb734e69e34ee894e5d110ddfb1d4221"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SakthivelSwe/dev-mastery/git/commits/3e9fb89cbc81be472667d2ec9d5726349446f530","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/SakthivelSwe/dev-mastery/commit/3e9fb89cbc81be472667d2ec9d5726349446f530","node_id":"C_kwDOSpCdxNoAKDNlOWZiODljYmM4MWJlNDcyNjY3ZDJlYzlkNTcyNjM0OTQ0NmY1MzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SakthivelSwe/dev-mastery/commit/32e08711c01e903bfbb97cf61d046d58691d16df","sha":"32e08711c01e903bfbb97cf61d046d58691d16df","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SakthivelSwe/dev-mastery/commits/32e08711c01e903bfbb97cf61d046d58691d16df"}],"sha":"3e9fb89cbc81be472667d2ec9d5726349446f530","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SakthivelSwe/dev-mastery/commits/3e9fb89cbc81be472667d2ec9d5726349446f530"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SakthivelSwe/dev-mastery/commits/32e08711c01e903bfbb97cf61d046d58691d16df/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-23T13:15:44Z","email":"dev@devmastery.local","name":"DevMastery Dev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-23T13:15:44Z","email":"dev@devmastery.local","name":"DevMastery Dev"},"message":"feat: end-to-end fixes + Microservices learning path\n\nFrontend (web):\n- Fix Sign In / Get Started navigation (Link elements, not bare buttons)\n- Wire login/register to the monolith API (was pointing at defunct :8081)\n- Auth store: store JWT + roles, hydrate from localStorage SSR-safely\n- Topic page: switch to client-side markdown rendering via react-markdown\n  to avoid React-element-version mismatch across the RSC boundary\n- Add Mermaid diagram support (MermaidBlock + MarkdownView pre handler)\n- BSTVisualizer: guard against undefined coords / zero-width SVG\n- VisualizerShell: show \"no visualizer\" placeholder for unsupported topics\n- Roadmap page redesign: remove Map View, modern level cards with per-level\n  accents, completion badges, sticky header, proper scrolling\n- Patterns page redesign: app-shell layout, search filter, modern row UI\n- Sidebar: optional href override; route LeetCode Patterns to /patterns;\n  add Microservices to Backend group\n- Dashboard: drop fake MOCK_DASHBOARD, fetch real /v1/progress/summary with\n  Bearer token, derive rank tiers from XP, render zero-state for new users\n- Landing page: add Microservices card; fix all path-card slugs to match DB\n- All hook files migrated from per-service ports to the single monolith URL\n\nBackend (devmastery-core):\n- UserEntity: map to existing Supabase columns (name, role=user, auth_provider=email)\n- AuthService: normalise role casing for JWT / Spring Security\n- TopicEntity / LearningPathEntity / LessonEntity: schema-drift fixes\n  (order_index, is_published, section_type, content_mdx)\n- CodeExampleEntity: mark expectedOutput @Transient (column absent in DB)\n- UserStreakEntity/SpacedReviewEntity/UserXpEventEntity: column-name fixes\n  (last_activity, easiness_factor, earned_at, reference_id)\n- ContentService: new /v1/paths/{slug}/roadmap endpoint returning the\n  level-grouped roadmap shape the frontend expects\n- ContentServiceImpl.toDetail: load layer content from the lessons table\n  instead of the legacy transient fields; normalise legacy section names\n- application-dev.yml: tolerate Flyway out-of-order migrations\n\nDatabase (Flyway):\n- V28__microservices_path.sql: new \"Microservices with Spring\" learning path\n  (28 topics across 5 levels) plus deep Why / Theory / RealWorld / Interview\n  content with Mermaid diagrams and Java/Spring code blocks for 3 hero\n  topics: ms-intro, ms-service-discovery, ms-circuit-breaker\n\nMisc:\n- .gitignore: exclude run-dev.cmd / dump-schema.js / schema.txt /\n  .wrangler/ / next-dev.log / boot.log (contain creds or local artifacts)","tree":{"sha":"0fefc136ef68ab940fd49835c95b19d1a1ad82fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SakthivelSwe/dev-mastery/git/trees/0fefc136ef68ab940fd49835c95b19d1a1ad82fe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SakthivelSwe/dev-mastery/git/commits/32e08711c01e903bfbb97cf61d046d58691d16df","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/SakthivelSwe/dev-mastery/commit/32e08711c01e903bfbb97cf61d046d58691d16df","node_id":"C_kwDOSpCdxNoAKDMyZTA4NzExYzAxZTkwM2JmYmI5N2NmNjFkMDQ2ZDU4NjkxZDE2ZGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SakthivelSwe/dev-mastery/commit/37021a61af0d016c0e4509c484537dd48b6e1666","sha":"37021a61af0d016c0e4509c484537dd48b6e1666","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SakthivelSwe/dev-mastery/commits/37021a61af0d016c0e4509c484537dd4