users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rossiko22/Inventory-Supply-Management-Frontend/commits/861825746ef12015a5fa7460267e2b9397676355/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-26T15:21:38Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude Code"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-26T15:21:38Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude Code"},"message":"Step 5 / A6: products list — SKU search + category filter\n\nWeb products-mf has a SKU search input + category filter dropdown; mobile\nproducts list had neither (audit row ''Products — filter by category'' and\n''find by SKU'').\n\n- SKU search: client-side substring filter (case-insensitive) — keeps it\n  immediate as the user types. The scanner already uses the dedicated\n  GET /products/by-sku for hard lookups, so this is a quick browse aid\n  rather than a duplicate of that flow.\n- Category filter: horizontally-scrolling chip row populated from\n  /categories, plus a leading ''All'' chip. Active chip uses the brand-blue\n  accent style other filter chips use elsewhere in the app.\n\nGateway routing unchanged — productsApi.getAllCategories is the existing\nGET /categories proxy. No new endpoints.\n\nVerified: mobile typechecks; jest 20/20.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a64b14280a9785de73f883cbdafa59074bfc20a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rossiko22/Inventory-Supply-Management-Frontend/git/trees/a64b14280a9785de73f883cbdafa59074bfc20a6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rossiko22/Inventory-Supply-Management-Frontend/git/commits/861825746ef12015a5fa7460267e2b9397676355","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","follow