,"received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rossiko22/Inventory-Supply-Management-Frontend/commits/24c928260d21b0178fc3d55b1abfa3f8b030b2c3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-26T15:20:06Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude Code"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-26T15:20:06Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude Code"},"message":"Step 5 / A2: add delivery date field to mobile order create\n\nThe web orders-mf create form has a delivery date input; mobile''s was\nmissing it (audit row ''Orders — create''). Adds an optional YYYY-MM-DD\nfield that maps to CreateOrderRequest.deliveryDate (already in the DTO).\n\nEmpty input sends null so the backend can default / leave unset, matching\nthe web form''s behavior. Date is plain text input to avoid a new picker\ndependency — native date pickers can be wired later.\n\nGateway: ordersApi.create routes through mobile-gateway as before. No new\nendpoints.\n\nVerified: mobile typechecks.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b01433c8d186e1bebafbfa6cf1ff253163d6355c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rossiko22/Inventory-Supply-Management-Frontend/git/trees/b01433c8d186e1bebafbfa6cf1ff253163d6355c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rossiko22/Inventory-Supply-Management-Frontend/git/commits/24c928260d21b0178fc3d55b1abfa3f8b030b2c3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/even