om/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rossiko22/Inventory-Supply-Management-Frontend/commits/6c16779f32dcf4d83c71f67499469564483aef24/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-26T15:17:55Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude Code"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-26T15:17:55Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude Code"},"message":"Step 5 / A1: resolve IDs to names in order list, detail, stock cards\n\nPARITY_AUDIT.md flagged that mobile rendered raw UUIDs in places where the\nweb MFs resolved them to human names. Closes that readability gap:\n\n- orders/index.tsx: OrderCard now shows the product name (and company name\n  on a sub-line) instead of ''#<8 chars of id>''. Adds queries for products +\n  companies and a memo map keyed by id.\n- orders/[id].tsx: detail view replaces the mono UUIDs for product /\n  warehouse / company / driver with resolved names via a nameById helper;\n  fetches products/companies/warehouses/drivers alongside the order.\n- stock/index.tsx: StockCard now shows the product name instead of raw\n  productId; productMap is built the same way as warehouseMap.\n\nGateway routing: every new query uses the existing api modules\n(productsApi, companiesApi, warehousesApi, fleetApi), all of which go\nthrough mobile/lib/http/client.ts -> mobile-gateway. No new endpoints, no\nbypass.\n\nMobile-only extras (AI, scanner, push, offline cache) untouched.\n\nVerified: mobile typechecks; jest 20/20.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1b3aece5439d0cb7b1e37a791f71d0501d5f0ab6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rossiko22/Inventory-Supply-Management-Frontend/git/trees/1b3aece5439d0cb7b1e37a791f71d0501d5f0ab6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rossiko22/Inventory-Supply-Management-Frontend/git/commits/6c16779f32dcf4d83c71f67499469564483aef24","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rossiko22/Inventory-Supply-Management-Frontend/commit/6c16779f32dcf4d83c71f67499469564483aef24","node_id":"C_kwDOSpXL-9oAKDZjMTY3NzlmMzJkY2Y0ZDgzYzcxZjY3NDk5NDY5NTY0NDgzYWVmMjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rossiko22/Inventory-Supply-Management-Frontend/commit/9a75fd8117da8256c2bce11297e9e06e52c4c99b","sha":"9a75fd8117da8256c2bce11297e9e06e52c4c99b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rossiko22/Inventory-Supply-Management-Frontend/commits/9a75fd8117da8256c2bce11297e9e06e52c4c99b"}],"sha":"6c16779f32dcf4d83c71f67499469564483aef24","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rossiko22/Inventory-Supply-Management-Frontend/commits/6c16779f32dcf4d83c71f67499469564483aef24"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rossiko22/Inventory-Supply-Management-Frontend/commits/9a75fd8117da8256c2bce11297e9e06e52c4c99b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-26T14:55:25Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude Code"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-26T14:55:25Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude Code"},"message":"Step 4: align mobile design tokens with the web MFs\n\nDerived web tokens (from MFs'' inline styling + shell Layout):\n  Primary blue #3b82f6 | Sidebar/header slate #1e293b | App bg #f1f5f9\n  Success #10b981 | Warning #f59e0b | Danger #dc2626 | Info #3b82f6\n  Order status: Requested #f59e0b · Approved #3b82f6 · Delivered #10b981 · Closed #64748b\n  Notification severity: info #3b82f6 · warning #f59e0b · error #dc2626 · success #16a34a\n\nMobile fixes:\n- constants/colors.ts: success #22c55e -> #10b981, info #0ea5e9 -> #3b82f6;\n  added statusRequested/Approved/Delivered/Closed + severityInfo/Warning/\n  Error/Success tokens (single source of truth).\n- orders/index.tsx + orders/[id].tsx: STATUS_COLORS now match orders-mf\n  exactly (Approved #3b82f6, Delivered #10b981, Closed #64748b).\n- notifications.tsx: SEVERITY_COLORS now match shell NotificationsPanel\n  (INFO #3b82f6, ERROR #dc2626, added SUCCESS #16a34a).\n- stock/index.tsx: low-stock badge switched from amber to red (web treats\n  low stock as danger; mobile now matches).\n- (tabs)/_layout.tsx: header chrome blue -> slate #1e293b to match web''s\n  sidebar/header chrome. Native layout (tabs/FABs/cards) preserved.\n- Bulk: replaced hardcoded #ef4444 -> #dc2626 (matches token + web) and\n  hardcoded #22c55e -> #10b981 across all mobile components.\n\nNo native interaction patterns changed — mobile still feels native, just\nshares the MFs'' palette + status semantics.\n\nVerified: all 9 apps typecheck; mobile jest 20/20 pass.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3363c75729c2b61992dd43f3cfaad1bdca8c5b1b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rossiko22/Inventory-Supply-Management-Frontend/git/trees/3363c75729c2b61992dd43f3cfaad1bdca8c5b1b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rossiko22/Inventory-Supply-Management-Frontend/git/commits/9a75fd8117da8256c2bce11297e9e06e52c4c99b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rossiko22/Inventory-Supply-Management-Frontend/commit/9a75fd8117da8256c2bce11297e9e06e52c4c99b","node_id":"C_kwDOSpXL-9oAKDlhNzVmZDgxMTdkYTgyNTZjMmJjZTExMjk3ZTllMDZlNTJjNGM5OWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rossiko22/Inventory-Supply-Management-Frontend/commit/51acd6d4ea5f048d786b29b8f25685bcb7f3eca2","sha":"51acd6d4ea5f048d786b29b8f25685bcb7f3eca2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rossiko22/Inventory-Supply-Management-Frontend/commits/51acd6d4ea5f048d786b29b8f25685bcb7f3eca2"}],"sha":"9a75fd8117da8256c2bce11297e9e06e52c4c99b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rossiko22/Inventory-Supply-Management-Frontend/commits/9a75fd8117da8256c2bce11297e9e06e52c4c99b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rossiko22/Inventory-Supply-Management-Frontend/commits/51acd6d4ea5f048d786b29b8f25685bcb7f3eca2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-26T14:40:14Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude Code"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-26T14:40:14Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude Code"},"message":"Step 3: multilingual SL/EN, both sides\n\nShared dictionary in @erp/i18n (pure data, no runtime framework code):\n- packages/i18n/src/{sl.ts,en.ts,messages.ts,index.ts} — canonical SL table\n  plus a parallel EN table. Locale, Strings, getStrings, LOCALES, LOCALE_LABEL\n  exported. No React/DOM.\n\nMobile (RN, Expo):\n- lib/i18n/locale.ts now reads tables from @erp/i18n; Locale union widened to\n  ''sl'' | ''en''; zustand+persist store unchanged.\n- constants/i18n.ts replaces the old static `sl` object with a LIVE PROXY\n  that resolves each access against the current locale at read time. Avoids\n  touching the ~45 existing ''sl.x'' call sites; root _layout.tsx subscribes to\n  the locale store so the tree re-renders on language change.\n- profile.tsx gets a language switcher (SL/EN chips).\n- Added jest async-storage mock setup (locale store loads AsyncStorage at\n  module import, which jest''s autolinker couldn''t resolve).\n\nWeb (Module Federation: shell + 8 MFs):\n- One small i18n.ts per app (identical content) — useStrings()/useLocale()\n  hooks read from @erp/i18n; cross-app sync via localStorage + a custom\n  ''erp:locale-changed'' window event (MFs can''t share React runtime over the\n  federation boundary).\n- shell/components/Layout.tsx adds SL/EN buttons to the sidebar and writes\n  through the shared setLocale.\n- shell App + NotificationsPanel migrated.\n- All 8 MFs migrated: hardcoded English strings replaced with\n  s.{entity,common}.* lookups. Style objects renamed from `s` to `styles`\n  to free the name for the strings hook.\n\nUncertain Slovenian terms (please review):\n- appTitle: ''Sistem za upravljanje zalog'' (auth-mf inventory system title)\n- stock.consumeStock / consumeTitle: ''Poraba zaloge'' / ''Poraba zaloge''\n- stock.useStock: ''Porabi zalogo'' (consume modal submit button)\n- stock.proofDocument: ''Dokazilo (PDF, neobvezno)''\n- orders.uploadAndClose: ''Naloži in zapri''\n- products.findBySku / find / clear / match / noMatchSku: best-guess SL\n- ai.acknowledge: ''Zaženi analizo''\n- roles.WORKER: ''Skladiščni delavec''\n\nNot extracted (intentional):\n- jsPDF document text strings inside inventory-mf consume PDF (the doc\n  produced is the artifact; treating as English-only).\n- Some thrown error strings (''Failed to load orders'', ''Status update failed\n  (${status})'') — concatenations / debugging surfaces.\n\nVerified: all 9 apps typecheck clean; mobile jest 20/20 pass.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0c78c87dd040d0c6b2a00308b43ff099a1b03600","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rossiko22/Inventory-Supply-Management-Frontend/git/trees/0c78c87dd040d0c6b2a00308b43ff099a1b03600"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rossiko22/Inventory-Supply-Management-Frontend/git/commits/51acd6d4ea5f048d786b29b8f25685bcb7f3eca2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rossiko22/Inventory-Supply-Management-Frontend/commit/51acd6d4ea5f048d786b29b8f25685bcb7f3eca2","node_id":"C_kwDOSpXL-9oAKDUxYWNkNmQ0ZWE1ZjA0OGQ3ODZiMjliOGYyNTY4NWJjYjdmM2VjYTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rossiko22/Inventory-Supply-Management-Frontend/commit/83ad4863ede9b5e462e5d234589256b8eb5271be","sha":"83ad4863ede9b5e462e5d234589256b8eb5271be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rossiko22/Inventory-Supply-Management-Frontend/commits/83ad4863ede9b5e462e5d234589256b8eb5271be"}],"sha":"51acd6d4ea5f048d786b29b8f25685bcb7f3eca2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rossiko22/Inventory-Supply-Management-Frontend/commits/51acd6d4ea5f048d786b29b8f25685bcb7f3eca2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rossiko22/Inventory-Supply-Management-Frontend/commits/83ad4863ede9b5e462e5d234589256b8eb5271be/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-26T14:09:58Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude Code"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-26T14:09:58Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude Code"},"message":"Step 2B: extract @erp/api-types (mobile DTOs)\n\n- Move all DTO/type definitions from mobile/types/api.ts into\n  packages/api-types/src (types only). Country/City become literal-union types;\n  OrderResponse.status references OrderStatus type-imported from @erp/domain.\n- Runtime values stay out of the types-only package: COUNTRIES/CITIES move to\n  mobile/constants/warehouseOptions.ts (used by WarehouseForm).\n- Repoint all 26 mobile @/types/api importers to @erp/api-types; delete\n  mobile/types/api.ts; add @erp/api-types jest moduleNameMapper.\n- Web MFs NOT consolidated: shapes match for Company/Driver/Vehicle/Product/\n  Inventory but DIVERGE for Order (web status:number vs OrderStatus string),\n  Notification (web message+category vs body) and Category (null vs optional).\n  Left inline per playbook ''flag mismatches, don''t force'' — awaiting decision.\n\nVerified: mobile + all web MFs typecheck; mobile jest 20/20.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5ab8ac17840021f8b5c46c5c8f65241a8d28be1d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rossiko22/Inventory-Supply-Management-Frontend/git/trees/5ab8ac17840021f8b5c46c5c8f65241a8d28be1d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rossiko22/Inventory-Supply-Management-Frontend/git/commits/83ad4863ede9b5e462e5d234589256b8eb5271be","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_ur