i.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rossiko22/Inventory-Supply-Management-Frontend/commits/bf28408e57acfb8b67771b3851837dce5b2ecbc0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-26T14:06:34Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude Code"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-26T14:06:34Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude Code"},"message":"Step 2A: extract @erp/domain (roles, query keys, order-status)\n\n- Move mobile constants/roles.ts, constants/queryKeys.ts, lib/orders/statusFlow.ts\n  into packages/domain/src; consolidate order-status runtime maps\n  (ORDER_STATUS_VALUES/NAMES) + the OrderStatus type with the transition flow in\n  orderStatus.ts (runtime values can''t live in the types-only @erp/api-types).\n- types/api.ts now imports/re-exports OrderStatus from @erp/domain.\n- Repoint all mobile imports (~35 files) to @erp/domain; move the two unit\n  tests to reference @erp/domain (kept in mobile/__tests__ so they run under the\n  existing jest; added an @erp/domain moduleNameMapper).\n- Web MFs diverge in shape (no React Query/query keys, no role-gating logic,\n  numeric+color status map inline) -> left their copies untouched per playbook.\n\nDependency fixes for the workspace install (surfaced by hoisting under\nlegacy-peer-deps):\n- Pin react-test-renderer to 19.1.0 (root override + devDep) so it matches\n  mobile''s react 19.1.0 and RTL-RN''s exact-version check passes.\n- Add @testing-library/dom ^10.4.0 at root (peer of @testing-library/react 16\n  that legacy-peer-deps skipped) so the MFs'' tests typecheck again.\n\nVerified: all 9 apps typecheck clean; mobile jest 20/20 pass.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4c0d7299ece7808b3fdfc46b77aa1f6b2480215b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rossiko22/Inventory-Supply-Management-Frontend/git/trees/4c0d7299ece7808b3fdfc46b77aa1f6b2480215b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/r