0: Normalize agent list and add agentListLocal\n\nNormalize agent list and add agentListLocal\n\nProcess incoming agentList into a local, cleaned dropdown source and update template binding. Implements OnChanges to build agentListLocal by filtering null/empty entries, normalizing value/name fields, and prepending a default ''Otros'' option; template dropdown now uses agentListLocal. Also: import OnChanges/SimpleChanges, remove an unused local variable in validateData, and extend element mapping with Name and CompanyShortName fields while unifying id/name handling.","tree":{"sha":"f74f6ac29eb714ffafdaa6feec3463c85d06fb34","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DaisyMa2006/ManeuverCore/git/trees/f74f6ac29eb714ffafdaa6feec3463c85d06fb34"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DaisyMa2006/ManeuverCore/git/commits/93f42809cb5ef6ae3106fcabe7807faf2aee4e08","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/DaisyMa2006/ManeuverCore/commit/93f42809cb5ef6ae3106fcabe7807faf2aee4e08","node_id":"C_kwDOSpiq-doAKDkzZjQyODA5Y2I1ZWY2YWUzMTA2ZmNhYmU3ODA3ZmFmMmFlZTRlMDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DaisyMa2006/ManeuverCore/commit/e8434398f9386689bd19fdba570469a2ea57965f","sha":"e8434398f9386689bd19fdba570469a2ea57965f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DaisyMa2006/ManeuverCore/commits/e8434398f9386689bd19fdba570469a2ea57965f"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/DaisyMa2006/ManeuverCore/commit/a800aafbe76baa5f348b54a8798e2722bd94249a","sha":"a800aafbe76baa5f348b54a8798e2722bd94249a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DaisyMa2006/ManeuverCore/commits/a800aafbe76baa5f348b54a8798e2722bd94249a"}],"sha":"93f42809cb5ef6ae3106fcabe7807faf2aee4e08","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DaisyMa2006/ManeuverCore/commits/93f42809cb5ef6ae3106fcabe7807faf2aee4e08"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DaisyMa2006/ManeuverCore/commits/a800aafbe76baa5f348b54a8798e2722bd94249a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-21T20:03:40Z","email":"alejandro.montoya@globalmvm.com","name":"Alejandro Montoya"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-21T20:03:40Z","email":"alejandro.montoya@globalmvm.com","name":"Alejandro Montoya"},"message":"Normalize agent list and add agentListLocal\n\nProcess incoming agentList into a local, cleaned dropdown source and update template binding. Implements OnChanges to build agentListLocal by filtering null/empty entries, normalizing value/name fields, and prepending a default ''Otros'' option; template dropdown now uses agentListLocal. Also: import OnChanges/SimpleChanges, remove an unused local variable in validateData, and extend element mapping with Name and CompanyShortName fields while unifying id/name handling.","tree":{"sha":"66c51964f64db5b7f21049ba4bb99b3c93e1436f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DaisyMa2006/ManeuverCore/git/trees/66c51964f64db5b7f21049ba4bb99b3c93e1436f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DaisyMa2006/ManeuverCore/git/commits/a800aafbe76baa5f348b54a8798e2722bd94249a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/DaisyMa2006/ManeuverCore/commit/a800aafbe76baa5f348b54a8798e2722bd94249a","node_id":"C_kwDOSpiq-doAKGE4MDBhYWZiZTc2YmFhNWYzNDhiNTRhODc5OGUyNzIyYmQ5NDI0OWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DaisyMa2006/ManeuverCore/commit/edae6a81cc9e2639577204dc30ebbae7a7211e84","sha":"edae6a81cc9e2639577204dc30ebbae7a7211e84","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DaisyMa2006/ManeuverCore/commits/edae6a81cc9e2639577204dc30ebbae7a7211e84"}],"sha":"a800aafbe76baa5f348b54a8798e2722bd94249a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DaisyMa2006/ManeuverCore/commits/a800aafbe76baa5f348b54a8798e2722bd94249a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DaisyMa2006/ManeuverCore/commits/e8434398f9386689bd19fdba570469a2ea57965f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-14T16:39:05Z","email":"alejandro.montoya@globalmvm.com","name":"Alejandro Stevens Montoya Gaviria"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-14T16:39:05Z","email":"alejandro.montoya@globalmvm.com","name":"Alejandro Stevens Montoya Gaviria"},"message":"Merged PR 232420: Defer column visibility updates, refactor modal\n\nDefer column visibility updates, refactor modal\n\nAdd dataBound handler and deferred flags (shouldShowColumn, shouldHideColumn, pendingColumnUpdate) so column visibility changes are applied after dataBound instead of during filtering. Move fade-in class into ng-template, adjust dropdown filter template, and refine actionComplete/validateData logic to set visibility flags and pending updates. Refactor modal/grid code style, constructor formatting, and modal open/close flows; consolidate normalizeElement, relocate generateIdSdl with improved ID increment logic and table refresh, and expose delete/update helpers (updateTableSdl). Misc whitespace and minor cleanup.","tree":{"sha":"2d58a64d35ab747b6380177663148e569e96e05e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DaisyMa2006/ManeuverCore/git/trees/2d58a64d35ab747b6380177663148e569e96e05e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DaisyMa2006/ManeuverCore/git/commits/e8434398f9386689bd19fdba570469a2ea57965f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/DaisyMa2006/ManeuverCore/commit/e8434398f9386689bd19fdba570469a2ea57965f","node_id":"C_kwDOSpiq-doAKGU4NDM0Mzk4ZjkzODY2ODliZDE5ZmRiYTU3MDQ2OWEyZWE1Nzk2NWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DaisyMa2006/ManeuverCore/commit/e439cd29f7004fcb966c0107fb19d8394d559ab2","sha":"e439cd29f7004fcb966c0107fb19d8394d559ab2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DaisyMa2006/ManeuverCore/commits/e439cd29f7004fcb966c0107fb19d8394d559ab2"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/DaisyMa2006/ManeuverCore/commit/edae6a81cc9e2639577204dc30ebbae7a7211e84","sha":"edae6a81cc9e2639577204dc30ebbae7a7211e84","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DaisyMa2006/ManeuverCore/commits/edae6a81cc9e2639577204dc30ebbae7a7211e84"}],"sha":"e8434398f9386689bd19fdba570469a2ea57965f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DaisyMa2006/ManeuverCore/commits/e8434398f9386689bd19fdba570469a2ea57965f"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DaisyMa2006/ManeuverCore/commits/edae6a81cc9e2639577204dc30ebbae7a7211e84/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-14T15:39:00Z","email":"alejandro.montoya@globalmvm.com","name":"Alejandro Montoya"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-14T15:39:00Z","email":"alejandro.montoya@globalmvm.com","name":"Alejandro Montoya"},"message":"Defer column visibility updates, refactor modal\n\nAdd dataBound handler and deferred flags (shouldShowColumn, shouldHideColumn, pendingColumnUpdate) so column visibility changes are applied after dataBound instead of during filtering. Move fade-in class into ng-template, adjust dropdown filter template, and refine actionComplete/validateData logic to set visibility flags and pending updates. Refactor modal/grid code style, constructor formatting, and modal open/close flows; consolidate normalizeElement, relocate generateIdSdl with improved ID increment logic and table refresh, and expose delete/update helpers (updateTableSdl). Misc whitespace and minor cleanup.","tree":{"sha":"706a79580f0adaea3c217b2a516002ab77390720","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DaisyMa2006/ManeuverCore/git/trees/706a79580f0adaea3c217b2a516002ab77390720"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DaisyMa2006/ManeuverCore/git/commits/edae6a81cc9e2639577204dc30ebbae7a7211e84","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/DaisyMa2006/ManeuverCore/commit/edae6a81cc9e2639577204dc30ebbae7a7211e84","node_id":"C_kwDOSpiq-doAKGVkYWU2YTgxY2M5ZTI2Mzk1NzcyMDRkYzMwZWJiYWU3YTcyMTFlODQ","pare