394d559ab2","node_id":"C_kwDOSpiq-doAKGU0MzljZDI5ZjcwMDRmY2I5NjZjMDEwN2ZiMTlkODM5NGQ1NTlhYjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DaisyMa2006/ManeuverCore/commit/dd351024a07a164a70501c975af7c301e4e384af","sha":"dd351024a07a164a70501c975af7c301e4e384af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DaisyMa2006/ManeuverCore/commits/dd351024a07a164a70501c975af7c301e4e384af"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/DaisyMa2006/ManeuverCore/commit/c4d639ee65342db251b27791ff0ad47f84157afc","sha":"c4d639ee65342db251b27791ff0ad47f84157afc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DaisyMa2006/ManeuverCore/commits/c4d639ee65342db251b27791ff0ad47f84157afc"}],"sha":"e439cd29f7004fcb966c0107fb19d8394d559ab2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DaisyMa2006/ManeuverCore/commits/e439cd29f7004fcb966c0107fb19d8394d559ab2"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DaisyMa2006/ManeuverCore/commits/c4d639ee65342db251b27791ff0ad47f84157afc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-13T23:26:27Z","email":"alejandro.montoya@globalmvm.com","name":"Alejandro Montoya"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-13T23:26:27Z","email":"alejandro.montoya@globalmvm.com","name":"Alejandro Montoya"},"message":"Fix typo in modal title (SDL)\n\nCorrects a casing typo in ModalElementsSdlComponent title: changed ''Agregar elementos del SDl manualmente'' to ''Agregar elementos del SDL manualmente'' to use the correct ''SDL'' acronym.","tree":{"sha":"79575f5b09d7066fd446e7afe326c89204ecf855","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DaisyMa2006/ManeuverCore/git/trees/79575f5b09d7066fd446e7afe326c89204ecf855"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DaisyMa2006/ManeuverCore/git/commits/c4d639ee65342db251b27791ff0ad47f84157afc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/DaisyMa2006/ManeuverCore/commit/c4d639ee65342db251b27791ff0ad47f84157afc","node_id":"C_kwDOSpiq-doAKGM0ZDYzOWVlNjUzNDJkYjI1MWIyNzc5MWZmMGFkNDdmODQxNTdhZmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DaisyMa2006/ManeuverCore/commit/1cb2920116f94ab4039f04c0fa95e6689f2a6291","sha":"1cb2920116f94ab4039f04c0fa95e6689f2a6291","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DaisyMa2006/ManeuverCore/commits/1cb2920116f94ab4039f04c0fa95e6689f2a6291"}],"sha":"c4d639ee65342db251b27791ff0ad47f84157afc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DaisyMa2006/ManeuverCore/commits/c4d639ee65342db251b27791ff0ad47f84157afc"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DaisyMa2006/ManeuverCore/commits/1cb2920116f94ab4039f04c0fa95e6689f2a6291/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-13T23:23:44Z","email":"alejandro.montoya@globalmvm.com","name":"Alejandro Montoya"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-13T23:23:44Z","email":"alejandro.montoya@globalmvm.com","name":"Alejandro Montoya"},"message":"Enhance SDL modal UI and column handling\n\nAdd informational cards for agent/element messages and a soft shadow style to improve modal UX; update modal title. Replace the element company column with a templated column that includes a dropdown filter and proper display template. Toggle the column visibility dynamically when grid results change or when validating/clearing data to avoid empty/duplicate displays. Deduplicate element data by introducing loadDataElements() and use it when opening the modal from ModalSeguimientoCnoComponent. Miscellaneous whitespace/cleanup in related TS/HTML/SCSS files.","tree":{"sha":"8ee9c7bf303ef9c2657e80ce2415053db358b61a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DaisyMa2006/ManeuverCore/git/trees/8ee9c7bf303ef9c2657e80ce2415053db358b61a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DaisyMa2006/ManeuverCore/git/commits/1cb2920116f94ab4039f04c0fa95e6689f2a6291","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/DaisyMa2006/ManeuverCore/commit/1cb2920116f94ab4039f04c0fa95e6689f2a6291","node_