:1251526328,"sha":"7256e1cf1d4eb0f8a5229f16ed3ee45430abd053"}],"observedAt":"2026-10-08T23:12:22.532Z","raw":[{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YakovlevCoded/react-render-telemetry/commits/934069b58024857ffdb1bc190d7a2f7f58809fde/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-27T17:51:44Z","email":"leonid.iakovlev@plata.work","name":"Leonid Iakovlev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-27T17:51:44Z","email":"leonid.iakovlev@plata.work","name":"Leonid Iakovlev"},"message":"docs: replace product-specific pilot findings with generic methodology","tree":{"sha":"a6161450e742fb60ecb104708aec69df1e71c7a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YakovlevCoded/react-render-telemetry/git/trees/a6161450e742fb60ecb104708aec69df1e71c7a0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YakovlevCoded/react-render-telemetry/git/commits/934069b58024857ffdb1bc190d7a2f7f58809fde","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/YakovlevCoded/react-render-telemetry/commit/934069b58024857ffdb1bc190d7a2f7f58809fde","node_id":"C_kwDOSpjGuNoAKDkzNDA2OWI1ODAyNDg1N2ZmZGIxYmMxOTBkN2EyZjdmNTg4MDlmZGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/YakovlevCoded/react-render-telemetry/commit/c8977f819dfeb4bca76ccb4a8649f7383cd365c2","sha":"c8977f819dfeb4bca76ccb4a8649f7383cd365c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YakovlevCoded/react-render-telemetry/commits/c8977f819dfeb4bca76ccb4a8649f7383cd365c2"}],"sha":"934069b58024857ffdb1bc190d7a2f7f58809fde","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YakovlevCoded/react-render-telemetry/commits/934069b58024857ffdb1bc190d7a2f7f58809fde"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YakovlevCoded/react-render-telemetry/commits/c8977f819dfeb4bca76ccb4a8649f7383cd365c2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-27T17:46:59Z","email":"leonid.iakovlev@plata.work","name":"Leonid Iakovlev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-27T17:46:59Z","email":"leonid.iakovlev@plata.work","name":"Leonid Iakovlev"},"message":"docs: final README + commit built scan bundles for shareable clone\n\n- Force-include packages/scan/dist/ in .gitignore so a fresh clone works\n  without running a build first.\n- Rewrite README for sharing with teammates: clearer quickstart, the full\n  MCP tool surface, and an honest ''findings from the pilot'' section that\n  documents what we measured, what we tried, what didn''t work, and why\n  the naive ''apply fix → re-run scenario'' workflow gave a false-positive\n  win before we wired up proper full-reload measurement.","tree":{"sha":"5bc2f6af14c99ed8065aebd1959fc13dfdd7a683","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YakovlevCoded/react-render-telemetry/git/trees/5bc2f6af14c99ed8065aebd1959fc13dfdd7a683"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YakovlevCoded/react-render-telemetry/git/commits/c8977f819dfeb4bca76ccb4a8649f7383cd365c2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/YakovlevCoded/react-render-telemetry/commit/c8977f819dfeb4bca76ccb4a8649f7383cd365c2","node_id":"C_kwDOSpjGuNoAKGM4OTc3ZjgxOWRmZWI0YmNhNzZjY2I0YTg2NDlmNzM4M2NkMzY1YzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/YakovlevCoded/react-render-telemetry/commit/6f6f74826454d39ab938f1155dfb9302c833c6ec","sha":"6f6f74826454d39ab938f1155dfb9302c833c6ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YakovlevCoded/react-render-telemetry/commits/6f6f74826454d39ab938f1155dfb9302c833c6ec"}],"sha":"c8977f819dfeb4bca76ccb4a8649f7383cd365c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YakovlevCoded/react-render-telemetry/commits/c8977f819dfeb4bca76ccb4a8649f7383cd365c2"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YakovlevCoded/react-render-telemetry/commits/6f6f74826454d39ab938f1155dfb9302c833c6ec/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-27T17:39:06Z","email":"leonid.iakovlev@plata.work","name":"Leonid Iakovlev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-27T17:39:06Z","email":"leonid.iakovlev@plata.work","name":"Leonid Iakovlev"},"message":"refactor: vendor react-scan fork in packages/scan/ + drop custom browser runtime\n\nThe custom browser runtime (homegrown fiber walker + canvas overlay + MCP\ninject) didn''t survive parity testing against react-scan''s bippy-based\ncollector — its prop-diff approximation overcounted renders that React\nactually bailed out of. Dropping it in favour of the forked react-scan\nruntime as the single source of truth.\n\n- Vendor the fork (branch mcp-headless-aggregator on github/YakovlevCoded/\n  react-scan) into packages/scan/ — same code, easier clone-and-go than a\n  submodule. Resync via `pnpm sync:scan-from-fork`.\n- Rewrite packages/mcp-server/src/index.js to read\n  window.ReactScanInternals.Store.legacyReportData via CDP. New tool surface:\n  prime_and_reload (reliable install via evaluateOnNewDocument), snapshot\n  with framework-filtering, reset, diff_snapshots for measured before/after,\n  find_hotspots.\n- Drop packages/browser/ (custom runtime), packages/mcp-server/vendor/\n  (now references ../scan/dist/ directly).\n- Update README to describe the new architecture and quickstart.","tree":{"sha":"4b15e8ea9a0c4938d6b96b0b1f63459989840ced","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YakovlevCoded/react-render-telemetry/git/trees/4b15e8ea9a0c4938d6b96b0b1f63459989840ced"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YakovlevCoded/react-render-telemetry/git/commits/6f6f74826454d39ab938f1155dfb9302c833c6ec","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/YakovlevCoded/react-render-telemetry/commit/6f6f74826454d39ab938f1155dfb9302c833c6ec","node_id":"C_kwDOSpjGuNoAKDZmNmY3NDgyNjQ1NGQzOWFiOTM4ZjExNTVkZmI5MzAyYzgzM2M2ZWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/YakovlevCoded/react-render-telemetry/commit/0bcc679ba75e9c3c6809b40ebf988d26f4ba3cf3","sha":"0bcc679ba75e9c3c6809b40ebf988d26f4ba3cf3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YakovlevCoded/react-render-telemetry/commits/0bcc679ba75e9c3c6809b40ebf988d26f4ba3cf3"}],"sha":"6f6f74826454d39ab938f1155dfb9302c833c6ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YakovlevCoded/react-render-telemetry/commits/6f6f74826454d39ab938f1155dfb9302c833c6ec"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YakovlevCoded/react-render-telemetry/commits/0bcc679ba75e9c3c6809b40ebf988d26f4ba3cf3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-27T17:02:47Z","email":"leonid.iakovlev@plata.work","name":"Leonid Iakovlev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-27T17:02:47Z","email":"leonid.iakovlev@plata.work","name":"Leonid Iakovlev"},"message":"feat: toolbar log, FPS counter, click-to-select, fork plan, framework filter\n\n- Browser runtime: idempotent hook patch (fixes inflation when reinjected),\n  default user-component filter on summary/componentStats (raw available\n  via { raw: true }), FPS indicator in toolbar, live event log panel,\n  scroll-aware overlay, click-to-select inspector with side panel\n- MCP server: re-read browser source on every inject_telemetry (live\n  source-of-truth edits without server restart), always re-grab page\n  reference (handles page reload / detached frame)\n- scripts/launch-chrome.sh: dedicated CDP Chrome launcher\n- FORK_PLAN.md: migration plan to fork react-scan and add MCP bridge on\n  top of their Store","tree":{"sha":"8c67ea8c5d590d3c3c378982b3cd2878e5cbccad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YakovlevCoded/react-render-telemetry/git/trees/8c67ea8c5d590d3c3c378982b3cd2878e5cbccad"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YakovlevCoded/react-render-telemetry/git/commits/0bcc679ba75e9c3c6809b40ebf988d26f4ba3cf3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/YakovlevCoded/react-render-telemetry/commit/0bcc679ba75e