pattern\n  + show-evidence best practice (2026-06)\n- guides/08: ultrawork = generated orchestration semantics clarified","tree":{"sha":"1dc71fd2055efa7cc892984d872d3495082fd7f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nic611/nic-opencode-config/git/trees/1dc71fd2055efa7cc892984d872d3495082fd7f7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nic611/nic-opencode-config/git/commits/22d755070ed6abf060ba504de20947d563f83543","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/nic611/nic-opencode-config/commit/22d755070ed6abf060ba504de20947d563f83543","node_id":"C_kwDOSpjmMdoAKDIyZDc1NTA3MGVkNmFiZjA2MGJhNTA0ZGUyMDk0N2Q1NjNmODM1NDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/nic611/nic-opencode-config/commit/1225b5f945f03e48d2d4fdfc27d8304f41363580","sha":"1225b5f945f03e48d2d4fdfc27d8304f41363580","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nic611/nic-opencode-config/commits/1225b5f945f03e48d2d4fdfc27d8304f41363580"}],"sha":"22d755070ed6abf060ba504de20947d563f83543","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nic611/nic-opencode-config/commits/22d755070ed6abf060ba504de20947d563f83543"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nic611/nic-opencode-config/commits/1225b5f945f03e48d2d4fdfc27d8304f41363580/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-04T09:24:27Z","email":"bbellgakki@gmail.com","name":"nic611"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-04T09:24:27Z","email":"bbellgakki@gmail.com","name":"nic611"},"message":"feat: hierarchical AGENTS.md + ultrawork orchestration + show-evidence verify\n\n- /init-deep: walk monorepo, write per-package AGENTS.md for lean context injection\n- /ultrawork (alias /ulw): heavy-mode orchestrator entry — parallel fan-out\n  with per-group self-critique loop, for 5+ file cross-cutting work\n- opencode.json: extend instructions glob with packages/*/AGENTS.md and\n  apps/*/AGENTS.md so per-package rules auto-load\n- skills/verify-before-done: require pasted raw output (build/test tail +\n  coverage diff), not just green checkmarks\n- README: document new monorepo helper section + commands table updates","tree":{"sha":"06d9b8acfcff683d21f23f4a75c6c8b0e71954a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nic611/nic-opencode-config/git/trees/06d9b8acfcff683d21f23f4a75c6c8b0e71954a3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nic611/nic-opencode-config/git/commits/1225b5f945f03e48d2d4fdfc27d8304f41363580","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/nic611/nic-opencode-config/commit/1225b5f945f03e48d2d4fdfc27d8304f41363580","node_id":"C_kwDOSpjmMdoAKDEyMjViNWY5NDVmMDNlNDhkMmQ0ZmRmYzI3ZDgzMDRmNDEzNjM1ODA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/nic611/nic-opencode-config/commit/5476eae9298145b0fac1acf60514a8b6f01b33bc","sha":"5476eae9298145b0fac1acf60514a8b6f01b33bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nic611/nic-opencode-config/commits/5476eae9298145b0fac1acf60514a8b6f01b33bc"}],"sha":"1225b5f945f03e48d2d4fdfc27d8304f41363580","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nic611/nic-opencode-config/commits/1225b5f945f03e48d2d4fdfc27d8304f41363580"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nic611/nic-opencode-config/commits/5476eae9298145b0fac1acf60514a8b6f01b33bc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-27T17:07:18Z","email":"bbellgakki@gmail.com","name":"nic611"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-27T17:35:02Z","email":"bbellgakki@gmail.com","name":"nic611"},"message":"feat: initial OpenCode config — GPT-5.5 + copilot-api + Codex-style pipeline\n\n- opencode.json: copilot-api provider on port 4041, 11 agents with calibrated reasoning effort and permissions\n- AGENTS.md baseline + PRIMER.md session brief tuned for GPT-5.5 (CTCO frame)\n- 11 agents: orchestrator + plan/explore/code-review/tdd/fix-build + watcher + ui-from-image + 3 profile agents (safe/careful/bold)\n- 14 slash commands incl. /spec /implement /ship pipeline + /auto orchestration entry\n- 8 skills + 3 docs (CTCO, GPT-5.5 patterns, permission modes)\n- Cross-platform installer (Node-based): Windows / macOS / Linux with symlink-or-copy fallback\n- Doctor health check for prerequisites + env vars + port 4041 reachability\n- Internal MCP placeholders (Confluence / Jira / Git) ready to enable via env vars\n\nStack: React 18 + rspack / rsbuild + pnpm + Vitest + oxc + micro-frontend.","tree":{"sha":"fb32ce6ca46d311cee5f1a6a1f0636e43e65b1de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nic611/nic-opencode-config/git/trees/fb32ce6ca46d311cee5f1a6a1f0636e43e65b1de"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nic611/nic-opencode-config/git/commits/5476eae9298145b0fac1acf60514a8b6f01b33bc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/nic611/nic-opencode-config/commit/5476eae9298145b0fac1acf60514a8b6f01b33bc","node_id":"C_kwDOSpjmMdoAKDU0NzZlYWU5Mjk4MTQ1YjBmYWMxYWNmNjA1MTRhOGI2ZjAxYjMzYmM","parents":[],"sha":"5476eae9298145b0fac1acf60514a8b6f01b33bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nic611/nic-opencode-config/commits/5476eae9298145b0fac1acf60514a8b6f01b33bc"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/nic611/nic-opencode-config/commits?per_page=100&page=1&sha=37c675d9b989c826c7bc3d6e703c46f341be8edc&since=2025-03-31T23%3A59%3A59.000Z&until=2026-10-08T16%3A00%3A10.921Z"}');
